<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.200" end="00:00:03.400" style="s2">Imagine being trapped on a sky island</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.700" end="00:00:05.400" style="s2">with 29 beautiful women in a survival</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.400" end="00:00:07.000" style="s2">game. You have to complete system quests</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.400" end="00:00:08.800" style="s2">to get supplies and survive. But</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.000" end="00:00:09.900" style="s2">ironically, the first thing they all</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.800" end="00:00:11.600" style="s2">agree on</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.900" end="00:00:13.600" style="s2">is kicking you out for being the only</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.600" end="00:00:16.600" style="s2">man. What would you do?</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.600" end="00:00:16.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I say we kick you on out.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.800" end="00:00:21.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? Simple. You&#39;re the only man here.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.500" end="00:00:22.500" style="s2">We&#39;re all women. If anything happens,</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.500" end="00:00:24.100" style="s2">who takes the blame?</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.500" end="00:00:25.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree. Having a man tagging along</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.100" end="00:00:26.500" style="s2">makes things awkward for us.</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.300" end="00:00:28.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.500" end="00:00:29.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, you keep staring at me. It</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.300" end="00:00:30.800" style="s2">makes me uncomfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.200" end="00:00:32.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t be too careful. He&#39;s the only</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.800" end="00:00:33.800" style="s2">man here.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.000" end="00:00:36.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why should we all feel unsafe just to</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.800" end="00:00:38.100" style="s2">keep him around?</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.200" end="00:00:39.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.100" end="00:00:41.100" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.300" end="00:00:43.800" style="s2">But tell me one thing. Does everyone</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.100" end="00:00:45.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want me gone or just some of you?</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.800" end="00:00:49.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still can&#39;t take a hint. Anyone against</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.900" end="00:00:49.100" style="s2">it? Raise your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.500" end="00:00:54.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng&#39;s my classmate. He&#39;s a good guy.</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.900" end="00:00:56.100" style="s2">This must be a misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.300" end="00:00:57.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you know, little girl? You never</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.100" end="00:00:59.300" style="s2">know what someone&#39;s really like.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.700" end="00:01:01.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Even if he&#39;s innocent and we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.300" end="00:01:02.200" style="s2">being unfair, so what? Keeping a man</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.100" end="00:01:03.500" style="s2">around is a risk.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.200" end="00:01:04.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s to say he won&#39;t grow passing our</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.500" end="00:01:06.900" style="s2">sleep?</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.800" end="00:01:10.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.900" end="00:01:10.300" style="s2">Think carefully before you decide.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.600" end="00:01:18.000" style="s2">At least you&#39;ve got some sense.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.100" end="00:01:19.700" style="s2">You saw it yourself, Ye Feng. Everyone</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.000" end="00:01:21.300" style="s2">voted you out. I know sending you off</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.700" end="00:01:23.300" style="s2">alone is harsh, so I&#39;ll offer you a</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.300" end="00:01:25.300" style="s2">compromise. A chance to survive. During</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.300" end="00:01:26.900" style="s2">the day, under our constant supervision,</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.300" end="00:01:28.700" style="s2">stay with a group and obey everyone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.900" end="00:01:31.100" style="s2">orders. At night, you must go to a</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.700" end="00:01:32.400" style="s2">remote spot we choose and rest alone.</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.100" end="00:01:33.800" style="s2">Stay away from camp.</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.400" end="00:01:37.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.800" end="00:01:37.300" style="s2">You dare talk to me like that?</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.000" end="00:01:42.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You all cast me out, then offer to let</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.000" end="00:01:44.000" style="s2">me stay so I can be your unpaid slave at</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.400" end="00:01:45.900" style="s2">everyone&#39;s beck and call. You&#39;d watch</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.000" end="00:01:47.900" style="s2">me, control me, and yell at me all day,</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.900" end="00:01:50.200" style="s2">then chase me off like a dog at night.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.900" end="00:01:53.900" style="s2">Nice little scheme you&#39;ve got. Think I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.200" end="00:01:56.100" style="s2">some spineless simp? Dream on.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.900" end="00:01:58.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, I kindly offered you a chance</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.100" end="00:02:00.192" style="s2">to survive, and you&#39;re throwing it away.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.200" end="00:02:00.792" style="s2">Reject my kindness, and you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.192" end="00:02:02.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.792" end="00:02:05.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll be the ones regretting it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.492" end="00:02:08.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trash. Oh, I don&#39;t just mean you. I mean</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.292" end="00:02:09.792" style="s2">every last one of you here is trash.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.992" end="00:02:11.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.792" end="00:02:13.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome to Survival by Choice. You have</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.692" end="00:02:15.892" style="s2">been placed on Sky Islands in teams of</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.792" end="00:02:17.692" style="s2">30. Each survivor is automatically</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.892" end="00:02:19.292" style="s2">assigned a starter fishing rod. Use it</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.692" end="00:02:21.592" style="s2">to fish in the resource pools across</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.292" end="00:02:23.592" style="s2">your island for supplies up to three</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.592" end="00:02:25.192" style="s2">times a day per person. Your seven-day</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.592" end="00:02:27.292" style="s2">beginner protection period is now</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.192" end="00:02:29.192" style="s2">active. Your islands are safe for now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.292" end="00:02:30.892" style="s2">In addition to surviving</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.192" end="00:02:33.292" style="s2">and building a home, you must complete</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.892" end="00:02:34.892" style="s2">one Choice Quest each day.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.292" end="00:02:37.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Choice Quest begins. You are</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.892" end="00:02:39.192" style="s2">trapped in a loop. Each day you wake in</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.292" end="00:02:40.792" style="s2">the jungle, climb a hillside, climb a</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.192" end="00:02:42.492" style="s2">tree, and reach the edge of the Sky</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.792" end="00:02:44.792" style="s2">Island. Then you somehow return to the</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.492" end="00:02:46.492" style="s2">jungle and fall fast asleep. This keeps</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.792" end="00:02:47.892" style="s2">repeating. You&#39;ve lost count of how many</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.492" end="00:02:49.492" style="s2">times you&#39;ve woken up. To break the</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.892" end="00:02:51.692" style="s2">loop, choose an option.</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.492" end="00:02:53.692" style="s2">Option one, roll down the hillside.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.692" end="00:02:56.192" style="s2">Option two, jump from the tree. Option</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.692" end="00:02:58.392" style="s2">three, jump off the Sky Island.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.192" end="00:03:00.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make your choice within 100 seconds. You</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.392" end="00:03:02.192" style="s2">must complete the task you choose.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.292" end="00:03:05.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of crap choices are these? Why</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.192" end="00:03:05.592" style="s2">make pretty girls like us do this?</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.492" end="00:03:10.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Awakening your talent.</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.992" end="00:03:12.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talent.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.892" end="00:03:15.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talent awakened. Character&#39;s Eye</p>
<p begin="00:03:12.692" end="00:03:16.492" style="s2">provides hints when making a choice.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.092" end="00:03:18.792" style="s2">Usable three times a day.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.492" end="00:03:20.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Character&#39;s Eye.</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.792" end="00:03:22.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I actually got a talent.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.292" end="00:03:24.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hint for option three. At exactly 14</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.092" end="00:03:25.792" style="s2">hours, 44 minutes, and 44 seconds system</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.092" end="00:03:27.492" style="s2">time, stand on the large blue rock at</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.792" end="00:03:29.492" style="s2">the island&#39;s northwest edge and jump</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.492" end="00:03:31.292" style="s2">into the void. You&#39;ll survive unharmed</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.492" end="00:03:31.892" style="s2">and receive a special one-of-a-kind</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.292" end="00:03:33.492" style="s2">reward.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.892" end="00:03:34.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can actually access hidden</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.492" end="00:03:36.892" style="s2">information.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.892" end="00:03:37.992" style="s2">It&#39;s 14 hours, 34 minutes, and 12</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.892" end="00:03:39.392" style="s2">seconds.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.992" end="00:03:42.092" style="s2">I&#39;ve got 10 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.392" end="00:03:42.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll risk it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.092" end="00:03:49.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Girls, look. That guy ran off.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.992" end="00:03:50.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He must be nuts. Good riddance. He</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.292" end="00:03:52.092" style="s2">creeped me out.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.492" end="00:03:54.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry. Time&#39;s almost up. Don&#39;t let it</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.092" end="00:03:56.692" style="s2">pick for you. If you get option three,</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.092" end="00:03:56.692" style="s2">you&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.192" end="00:04:00.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.292" end="00:04:00.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. Someone actually picked the</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.192" end="00:04:01.892" style="s2">death option.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.992" end="00:04:02.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have phone?</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.892" end="00:04:03.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that the guy from</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.494" end="00:04:04.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; earlier?</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.094" end="00:04:05.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He chose to jump off the sky island.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.794" end="00:04:07.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is he insane?</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.994" end="00:04:09.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A 100000m</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.994" end="00:04:11.494" style="s2">drop will turn him to mush.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.594" end="00:04:13.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He must be out of his mind. I know it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.494" end="00:04:14.994" style="s2">wrong to say this, but now we women have</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.694" end="00:04:16.794" style="s2">the whole island to ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.994" end="00:04:18.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng must be unstable. He chose</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.794" end="00:04:20.494" style="s2">certain death. Forget him. Let&#39;s hurry</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.994" end="00:04:22.894" style="s2">and finish our tasks.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.494" end="00:04:23.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not rolling. I&#39;ll scrape my delicate</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.894" end="00:04:24.994" style="s2">skin.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.694" end="00:04:27.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s too dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.994" end="00:04:29.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made your choice. Now follow</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.094" end="00:04:29.494" style="s2">through.</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.194" end="00:04:33.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can they make us do this? I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.194" end="00:04:35.594" style="s2">rolling around. You&#39;d better do it</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.694" end="00:04:37.194" style="s2">though. The warning said if you fail,</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.594" end="00:04:39.094" style="s2">you face the consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.194" end="00:04:39.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what? Let&#39;s see what they can do to</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.094" end="00:04:42.094" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.894" end="00:04:43.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wen Qi, listen. We&#39;re not doing this.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.094" end="00:04:46.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Being a big star doesn&#39;t mean you can</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.694" end="00:04:46.494" style="s2">boss us around.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.294" end="00:04:54.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m done dancing. What are they going to</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.094" end="00:04:54.194" style="s2">do? Kill me?</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.794" end="00:05:06.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only 4 seconds left.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.194" end="00:05:06.394" style="s2">Three, jump.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.894" end="00:05:11.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m screwed. I&#39;m going to die.</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.394" end="00:05:14.694" style="s2">I never should HAVE TRUSTED THOSE</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.594" end="00:05:14.694" style="s2">[ __ ] HIDDEN HINTS.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.794" end="00:05:24.394" style="s2">OVER HERE.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.394" end="00:05:25.394" style="s2">I&#39;M ALIVE. I MADE IT. THE WIND blew me</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.394" end="00:05:27.294" style="s2">back up.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.394" end="00:05:29.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Time is up. All survivors who failed</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.294" end="00:05:30.794" style="s2">their tasks will be punished.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.194" end="00:05:33.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What punishment? We all finished our</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.794" end="00:05:33.494" style="s2">tasks, right?</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.494" end="00:05:48.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone&#39;s dead.</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.794" end="00:05:57.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help me. I don&#39;t want to die.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.094" end="00:06:08.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daily choice task complete. Hidden</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.195" end="00:06:09.195" style="s2">reward unlocked. Selecting a random</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.195" end="00:06:10.195" style="s2">reward.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.195" end="00:06:11.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s my reward?</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.195" end="00:06:13.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve earned an additional talent.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.995" end="00:06:15.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An extra talent. Two talents.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.995" end="00:06:17.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Awakening your talent. Awakening</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.895" end="00:06:19.795" style="s2">successful. Second talent acquired.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.995" end="00:06:21.595" style="s2">Ultimate ascension. Usable three times a</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.795" end="00:06:22.795" style="s2">day with a chance to grant bonus traits</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.595" end="00:06:24.195" style="s2">or special effects.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.795" end="00:06:25.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even heaven&#39;s on my side.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.195" end="00:06:26.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if I use ultimate ascension on my</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.695" end="00:06:28.795" style="s2">character&#39;s eye?</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.495" end="00:06:29.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ultimate ascension. Target, character&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.795" end="00:06:30.395" style="s2">eye.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.295" end="00:06:32.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ultimate ascension activated on</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.395" end="00:06:34.295" style="s2">character&#39;s eye. Upgrade successful.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.595" end="00:06:36.195" style="s2">It worked. Your character&#39;s eye has</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.295" end="00:06:37.295" style="s2">evolved into the eye of revelation.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.195" end="00:06:39.195" style="s2">Whenever you face a choice, you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.295" end="00:06:40.595" style="s2">receive multiple hints. Observing other</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.195" end="00:06:42.895" style="s2">things may also trigger hints.</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.595" end="00:06:45.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unlimited uses. Even ordinary things can</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.895" end="00:06:45.395" style="s2">trigger hints.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.495" end="00:06:48.795" style="s2">That upgrade really paid off.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.195" end="00:06:52.995" style="s2">Low chance of obtaining resources.</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.395" end="00:06:55.095" style="s2">So each fishing pool has different odds</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.995" end="00:06:56.495" style="s2">of yielding resources. The odds even</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.095" end="00:06:59.695" style="s2">change daily.</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.495" end="00:06:59.695" style="s2">Looks like I need a better fishing pool.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.695" end="00:07:07.095" style="s2">Why are there fewer people here?</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.595" end="00:07:07.695" style="s2">Five are missing. Do they kill</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.095" end="00:07:09.595" style="s2">themselves?</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.695" end="00:07:11.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Each Sky Island starts with 30 people.</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.595" end="00:07:12.695" style="s2">Work together, avoid casualties, and</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.195" end="00:07:14.795" style="s2">keep everyone alive to improve your</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.695" end="00:07:17.295" style="s2">chances of long-term survival.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.795" end="00:07:18.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Work together with these people?</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.295" end="00:07:20.495" style="s2">They don&#39;t deserve it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.695" end="00:07:21.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, what&#39;s he doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.495" end="00:07:23.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, why is he still alive?</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.995" end="00:07:25.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, how are you still alive?</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.495" end="00:07:25.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re still alive, why would I be</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.195" end="00:07:27.095" style="s2">dead?</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.795" end="00:07:28.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, five of us failed to complete</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.095" end="00:07:30.595" style="s2">the task properly. They all died.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.695" end="00:07:32.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, however you survived, stay away</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.595" end="00:07:33.695" style="s2">from us. We&#39;re in a terrible mood.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.610" end="00:07:35.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.695" end="00:07:37.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every one of them deserved to die,</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.395" end="00:07:37.995" style="s2">especially that Li Mengqi. She got what</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.295" end="00:07:40.895" style="s2">she deserved.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.995" end="00:07:42.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good riddance. What a glorious day.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.895" end="00:07:44.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.995" end="00:07:45.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, how can you say that?</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.695" end="00:07:48.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re gloating over other people&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.895" end="00:07:49.195" style="s2">deaths. Have you no decency? That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.095" end="00:07:51.895" style="s2">disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.195" end="00:07:55.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. There&#39;s still plenty of time. You</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.895" end="00:07:55.095" style="s2">could be next.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.495" end="00:07:58.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, you&#39;re no man.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.095" end="00:07:59.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sick freak.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.495" end="00:08:01.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, why did you come looking for</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.995" end="00:08:03.495" style="s2">us? Whatever you&#39;re after, with that</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.895" end="00:08:06.095" style="s2">attitude of yours, you&#39;re never getting</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.495" end="00:08:08.897" style="s2">back on this team. Even if you beg, we</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.095" end="00:08:10.597" style="s2">won&#39;t take you back. So forget about it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.897" end="00:08:13.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When did I say I wanted to come back?</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.597" end="00:08:15.297" style="s2">I&#39;m just looking for a pond to fish in.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.497" end="00:08:16.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever. We&#39;ve claimed this fishing</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.297" end="00:08:17.497" style="s2">pond.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.397" end="00:08:19.697" style="s2">Please leave.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.497" end="00:08:21.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, get lost. You&#39;re not welcome here.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.697" end="00:08:23.197" style="s2">Get out of our sight.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.397" end="00:08:25.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s yours just because you say so.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.197" end="00:08:28.097" style="s2">Thought your name&#39;s on it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.497" end="00:08:29.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This pond is garbage. Could it get any</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.097" end="00:08:33.497" style="s2">worse?</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.097" end="00:08:33.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. You can keep this little paradise.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.197" end="00:08:39.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He just left.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.797" end="00:08:40.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eye of Apocalypse.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.297" end="00:08:41.897" style="s2">Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.297" end="00:08:43.897" style="s2">This is the one. Good thing I have the</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.897" end="00:08:46.097" style="s2">Eye of Apocalypse. That pond&#39;s got</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.897" end="00:08:48.297" style="s2">barely any resources. You won&#39;t catch</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.097" end="00:08:49.997" style="s2">squat. You&#39;ll only get three tries.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.297" end="00:08:53.197" style="s2">Catch nothing good and you&#39;ll go hungry</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.997" end="00:08:53.197" style="s2">tonight. Let&#39;s get started.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.397" end="00:08:58.397" style="s2">So I just toss this in.</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.497" end="00:08:58.397" style="s2">All right, here goes.</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.597" end="00:09:02.697" style="s2">I should be able to upgrade this thing,</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.897" end="00:09:04.297" style="s2">right? Extreme Ascension.</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.697" end="00:09:06.497" style="s2">Ascension granted a new trait. It</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.297" end="00:09:08.397" style="s2">worked. I even got a new trait. Eternal</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.497" end="00:09:10.497" style="s2">lucky fishing rod. Special quality.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.397" end="00:09:12.397" style="s2">Fishing luck plus 30%. Extreme Ascension</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.497" end="00:09:14.897" style="s2">added a bonus trait too. A chance for</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.397" end="00:09:14.897" style="s2">double loot.</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.397" end="00:09:22.497" style="s2">Got a bite.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.797" end="00:09:24.797" style="s2">Cloud bread. Nice. Food on my very first</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.497" end="00:09:26.897" style="s2">catch.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.797" end="00:09:29.297" style="s2">Bread alone won&#39;t cut it. I&#39;m so</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.897" end="00:09:30.797" style="s2">thirsty. I need water too. Let&#39;s keep</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.297" end="00:09:33.497" style="s2">going. I should be able to catch</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.797" end="00:09:33.497" style="s2">something even better.</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.097" end="00:09:41.497" style="s2">A treasure chest. Extreme Ascension</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.597" end="00:09:44.997" style="s2">should work on chests too.</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.497" end="00:09:47.897" style="s2">Let&#39;s try it. Extreme Ascension.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.997" end="00:09:47.897" style="s2">Let&#39;s see what&#39;s inside.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.197" end="00:09:55.997" style="s2">Holy crap.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.097" end="00:09:58.697" style="s2">I&#39;ve hit the jackpot.</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.997" end="00:10:00.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Girls, I I&#39;ve awakened my talent.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.697" end="00:10:01.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? That&#39;s great.</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.097" end="00:10:03.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congrats, Ruyan. What&#39;s your talent?</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.897" end="00:10:04.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I awakened a talent. Good things come in</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.797" end="00:10:06.697" style="s2">pairs.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.597" end="00:10:10.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It doubles any resources I fish up.</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.697" end="00:10:11.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, we&#39;re set. THAT&#39;S OUR RUYAN.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.297" end="00:10:14.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, girls. Let me show you how</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.898" end="00:10:14.198" style="s2">it&#39;s done.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.098" end="00:10:22.098" style="s2">How did that happen?</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.198" end="00:10:26.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.598" end="00:10:29.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.798" end="00:10:34.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Girls, maybe I&#39;m just having bad luck.</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.198" end="00:10:37.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. I still have good things come in</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.998" end="00:10:37.298" style="s2">pairs.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.498" end="00:10:44.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are we so unlucky? Why all this</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.098" end="00:10:47.298" style="s2">junk? Even the food we caught isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.698" end="00:10:50.998" style="s2">enough. This game sucks. I quit.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.298" end="00:10:50.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is this game so hard?</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.598" end="00:10:56.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a lucky haul. So many supplies. Hot</p>
<p begin="00:10:54.098" end="00:10:56.498" style="s2">pot tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.398" end="00:11:12.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, everyone, we know how day one</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.298" end="00:11:13.798" style="s2">went, but it&#39;s not our fault.</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.198" end="00:11:15.098" style="s2">Empty catches are common. We just got a</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.798" end="00:11:16.898" style="s2">little unlucky.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.098" end="00:11:18.198" style="s2">We&#39;ll get a huge haul tomorrow. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.898" end="00:11:20.898" style="s2">the heroines of this story. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.198" end="00:11:20.898" style="s2">destined to win.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.498" end="00:11:25.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ruoyan, we&#39;re starving.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.498" end="00:11:26.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, just hand out the food.</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.098" end="00:11:28.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do we split it?</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.298" end="00:11:30.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some caught more than others.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.898" end="00:11:31.798" style="s2">As for sharing the food, we&#39;re all in</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.498" end="00:11:33.398" style="s2">this together.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.798" end="00:11:34.798" style="s2">We should pool our supplies and ration</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.398" end="00:11:35.798" style="s2">them out equally.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.798" end="00:11:37.298" style="s2">Pool everything.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.798" end="00:11:38.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Liu, I get to decide what to do</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.298" end="00:11:40.498" style="s2">with my own catch, right? I caught the</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.798" end="00:11:41.498" style="s2">most and contributed more. Shouldn&#39;t I</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.498" end="00:11:43.298" style="s2">get a bigger share?</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.498" end="00:11:44.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Bai, Miss Zhou, we&#39;re a team. We</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.298" end="00:11:45.698" style="s2">need to follow orders, or we&#39;ll fall</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.698" end="00:11:47.698" style="s2">apart.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.698" end="00:11:49.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two did contribute the most today.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.698" end="00:11:51.698" style="s2">But luck won&#39;t always be on your side.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.598" end="00:11:53.098" style="s2">You might get nothing tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.698" end="00:11:54.398" style="s2">But if we pool our supplies, you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.098" end="00:11:55.098" style="s2">still have food.</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.398" end="00:11:56.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.098" end="00:11:58.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too. Miss Liu has everyone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.898" end="00:12:01.298" style="s2">interests at heart. Sharing everything</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.698" end="00:12:02.298" style="s2">equally is fair.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.298" end="00:12:03.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t think it&#39;s fair.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.298" end="00:12:06.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some people need reminding. We&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.898" end="00:12:08.698" style="s2">team. So stop being selfish. Being a</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.598" end="00:12:09.298" style="s2">celebrity doesn&#39;t entitle you to special</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.698" end="00:12:10.798" style="s2">treatment.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.298" end="00:12:11.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you calling selfish? When did I</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.798" end="00:12:12.299" style="s2">ask for special treatment?</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.898" end="00:12:13.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who said I</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.299" end="00:12:14.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; meant you?</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.099" end="00:12:18.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyone who disagrees is selfish.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.899" end="00:12:18.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I Shut up, all of you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.499" end="00:12:24.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Liu&#39;s plan to split everything</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.199" end="00:12:26.599" style="s2">equally. Who&#39;s in favor? Who&#39;s against?</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.899" end="00:12:28.599" style="s2">Since there are no objections, let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.599" end="00:12:30.499" style="s2">divide it up. But to keep everyone</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.599" end="00:12:33.299" style="s2">motivated, each day&#39;s top three</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.499" end="00:12:35.199" style="s2">contributors get an extra half portion.</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.299" end="00:12:38.099" style="s2">Oh, Zhu Nianxue, hand over that sausage</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.199" end="00:12:38.099" style="s2">so everyone can share it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.099" end="00:12:44.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is it so cold?</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.499" end="00:12:44.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I&#39;m freezing.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.999" end="00:12:47.199" style="s2">What do you think that bastard Ye Feng</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.299" end="00:12:48.499" style="s2">caught?</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.199" end="00:12:49.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That loser probably got nothing on all</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.499" end="00:12:50.999" style="s2">three tasks.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.299" end="00:12:51.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s probably starving in some corner.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.999" end="00:12:53.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if he got lucky and caught some</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.999" end="00:12:54.099" style="s2">water or bread, it wouldn&#39;t fill a grown</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.599" end="00:12:55.599" style="s2">man up.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.099" end="00:12:57.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Team lucky? No way.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.599" end="00:12:57.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If our luck&#39;s this bad, his must be</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.299" end="00:12:59.799" style="s2">worse.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.799" end="00:13:00.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Men could never measure up to</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.799" end="00:13:02.199" style="s2">us girls.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.499" end="00:13:04.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;d better not come crawling back when</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.199" end="00:13:05.499" style="s2">he&#39;s hungry. He&#39;d better stay away. He</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.199" end="00:13:06.899" style="s2">makes me sick.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.499" end="00:13:08.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you smell that?</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.899" end="00:13:10.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that smell?</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.599" end="00:13:12.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smells like someone&#39;s cooking.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.899" end="00:13:13.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It smells like meat.</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.099" end="00:13:15.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe hot pot.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.869" end="00:13:17.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.099" end="00:13:19.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hot pot? Who&#39;s having hot pot?</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.799" end="00:13:20.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could it be Ye Feng?</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.299" end="00:13:22.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did he get hot pot?</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.599" end="00:13:25.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; None of us fished any up. How could he?</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.999" end="00:13:26.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re freezing and starving, and Ye</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.099" end="00:13:28.099" style="s2">Feng&#39;s having hot pot.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.799" end="00:13:29.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.099" end="00:13:30.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That loser.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.399" end="00:13:31.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe there&#39;s someone else on the</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.499" end="00:13:33.599" style="s2">island.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.699" end="00:13:34.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe Ye Feng died, and the system</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.599" end="00:13:36.699" style="s2">replaced him.</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.499" end="00:13:37.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could be. He failed the task, too. He</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.699" end="00:13:39.199" style="s2">should be dead.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.599" end="00:13:42.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Why did Li Mengqi and the</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.199" end="00:13:44.399" style="s2">others die, but he survived?</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.199" end="00:13:46.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we do have a new teammate. Anyone</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.399" end="00:13:48.099" style="s2">with hot pot must be one capable girl.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.799" end="00:13:48.999" style="s2">We girls can stick together and get</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.099" end="00:13:50.799" style="s2">through this.</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.999" end="00:13:51.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Girls have to look out for each other.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.799" end="00:13:53.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.899" end="00:13:55.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Either way, we should check it out.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.899" end="00:13:58.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You come in.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.099" end="00:13:58.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, come on. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:14:08.899" end="00:14:12.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Ye Feng. He really has hot pot.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.899" end="00:14:14.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a letdown.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.499" end="00:14:16.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why couldn&#39;t it be another girl?</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.199" end="00:14:17.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My best friend Li Mengqi died,</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.101" end="00:14:19.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The low life scum like Ye Feng gets to</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.901" end="00:14:20.801" style="s2">survive and feast on hot pot.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.901" end="00:14:21.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How&#39;s that fair?</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.801" end="00:14:23.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did he do it?</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.801" end="00:14:24.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With this hot pot.</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.001" end="00:14:25.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.001" end="00:14:27.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; can&#39;t we be here?</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.501" end="00:14:29.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who says this is your turf?</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.301" end="00:14:31.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, it&#39;s pretty selfish of Ye Feng to</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.001" end="00:14:33.701" style="s2">keep all this food to himself. We can</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.001" end="00:14:34.701" style="s2">get him to share, right?</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.701" end="00:14:36.001" style="s2">Ye Feng,</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.701" end="00:14:38.601" style="s2">could you</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.001" end="00:14:38.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could I what?</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.101" end="00:14:43.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Delicious. Could you spare me a bite? We</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.201" end="00:14:43.801" style="s2">haven&#39;t eaten all day. Let us have some</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.201" end="00:14:45.601" style="s2">hot pot.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.801" end="00:14:48.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, you haven&#39;t eaten all day?</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.601" end="00:14:48.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.301" end="00:14:51.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You haven&#39;t eaten all day? How&#39;s that my</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.501" end="00:14:52.601" style="s2">problem?</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.201" end="00:14:53.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is it not? We&#39;re all stuck on this</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.601" end="00:14:55.301" style="s2">island. You can&#39;t just look out for</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.701" end="00:14:56.701" style="s2">yourself. We haven&#39;t eaten all day and</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.301" end="00:14:58.301" style="s2">you&#39;ve got so much. What&#39;s wrong with</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.701" end="00:14:59.801" style="s2">sharing? We&#39;re on the same team.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.301" end="00:15:01.701" style="s2">Shouldn&#39;t we help each other? At least</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.801" end="00:15:02.801" style="s2">let us have a hot meal.</p>
<p begin="00:15:01.701" end="00:15:04.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same team.</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.801" end="00:15:07.801" style="s2">When you kicked me out a few hours ago,</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.901" end="00:15:09.601" style="s2">why didn&#39;t anyone say we were a team?</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.801" end="00:15:10.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, can you really leave us out</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.601" end="00:15:13.001" style="s2">here cold and hungry?</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.801" end="00:15:15.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, have a little compassion. We don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.001" end="00:15:17.001" style="s2">expect a handout. We&#39;ll pay you back.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.201" end="00:15:18.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pay me back? With what? This is a</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.001" end="00:15:21.001" style="s2">survival game. You know better than I do</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.701" end="00:15:22.301" style="s2">how vital supplies are. It&#39;s my food. I</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.001" end="00:15:24.301" style="s2">decide who gets it. Want to work</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.301" end="00:15:26.101" style="s2">together? We can talk, but you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.301" end="00:15:27.301" style="s2">kick me out then expect me to act like a</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.101" end="00:15:28.801" style="s2">teammate.</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.301" end="00:15:30.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even in a survival game, the system put</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.801" end="00:15:32.501" style="s2">us all on the same team. On this Sky</p>
<p begin="00:15:30.601" end="00:15:34.401" style="s2">Island, we&#39;re all in this together. Five</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.501" end="00:15:36.101" style="s2">of us died today. Who knows how many</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.401" end="00:15:37.801" style="s2">more will die? Our only chance on this</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.101" end="00:15:39.201" style="s2">island is to help each other and pull</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.801" end="00:15:41.601" style="s2">through together.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.201" end="00:15:43.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop. Is your memory really that bad?</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.601" end="00:15:45.301" style="s2">You kicked me off the team just a few</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.101" end="00:15:47.201" style="s2">hours ago. We even traded insults.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.301" end="00:15:49.201" style="s2">Seriously? You&#39;ve forgotten already?</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.201" end="00:15:51.301" style="s2">You&#39;ve got some nerve. You just kicked</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.201" end="00:15:52.701" style="s2">me out and now you&#39;re asking me for</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.301" end="00:15:54.701" style="s2">food.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.701" end="00:15:56.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, you should have told us. If we&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.701" end="00:15:57.201" style="s2">known you could do this, we&#39;d never have</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.301" end="00:15:59.101" style="s2">kicked you out.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.201" end="00:16:02.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, we just got carried away.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.101" end="00:16:03.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Facts aside, you&#39;re to blame too.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.001" end="00:16:06.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up. If you&#39;re ignoring the facts,</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.901" end="00:16:07.201" style="s2">what&#39;s left to discuss? I&#39;m telling you</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.301" end="00:16:08.801" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.201" end="00:16:09.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get away from my camp.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.801" end="00:16:10.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng,</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.601" end="00:16:12.701" style="s2">don&#39;t let your temper get the better of</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.701" end="00:16:13.901" style="s2">you. Just tell us what we have to do to</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.701" end="00:16:15.901" style="s2">get some food.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.901" end="00:16:18.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen to yourself. Is that how you ask</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.901" end="00:16:20.402" style="s2">for a favor? Know your place. You&#39;re the</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.202" end="00:16:21.502" style="s2">ones begging me for food. And you can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.402" end="00:16:23.402" style="s2">even say sir?</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.502" end="00:16:24.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, what would it take for you to share</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.402" end="00:16:24.802" style="s2">your food?</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.102" end="00:16:27.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want food?</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.802" end="00:16:28.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy. Kneel and apologize, and I might</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.302" end="00:16:29.502" style="s2">toss you some scraps.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.502" end="00:16:30.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got that?</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.502" end="00:16:32.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve gone too far.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.902" end="00:16:34.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a lowlife. We were right to kick</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.702" end="00:16:35.202" style="s2">you out.</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.102" end="00:16:38.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a creep.</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.202" end="00:16:41.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve heard my terms. Now get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.702" end="00:16:44.302" style="s2">Leave. Stay at least 100 m from my camp</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.602" end="00:16:46.102" style="s2">or face the consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.302" end="00:16:47.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? A hand crossbow?</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.102" end="00:16:49.502" style="s2">Where did you get that?</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.202" end="00:16:51.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, take it easy. I&#39;ll get everyone</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.502" end="00:16:54.002" style="s2">out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.302" end="00:16:54.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re leaving now.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.202" end="00:16:59.102" style="s2">One last question. Ye Feng, where did</p>
<p begin="00:16:57.402" end="00:17:01.602" style="s2">you get the hot pot in the tent?</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.102" end="00:17:04.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I fished them up, of course. What? Got a</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.602" end="00:17:04.302" style="s2">problem with that?</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.702" end="00:17:16.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m so cold. I&#39;m freezing to death.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.402" end="00:17:18.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is this damn place so cold at night?</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.502" end="00:17:18.802" style="s2">Why does that bastard Ye Feng get all</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.102" end="00:17:20.702" style="s2">the luck?</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.802" end="00:17:22.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. First he dodges punishment,</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.702" end="00:17:24.902" style="s2">then he gets all that food, hot pot,</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.602" end="00:17:27.002" style="s2">warm clothes, and a tent. It&#39;s so</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.902" end="00:17:27.902" style="s2">unfair. The more I think about it, the</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.002" end="00:17:29.602" style="s2">more I regret it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.902" end="00:17:31.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did we kick him out today?</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.602" end="00:17:32.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Ye Feng were still with us, we&#39;d be</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.502" end="00:17:34.902" style="s2">enjoying that hot pot.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.902" end="00:17:36.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s got a tent, too. He must be all</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.902" end="00:17:38.002" style="s2">warm and cozy in there.</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.402" end="00:17:40.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we&#39;d kept him, that tent would be</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.002" end="00:17:43.602" style="s2">ours.</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.402" end="00:17:43.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you think we&#39;re going to make it?</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.702" end="00:17:47.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who knows? Pick the wrong answer or fail</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.902" end="00:17:49.802" style="s2">a task tomorrow, and you could drop</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.802" end="00:17:50.502" style="s2">dead. You won&#39;t even live long enough to</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.802" end="00:17:52.702" style="s2">starve.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.502" end="00:17:54.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. That bastard&#39;s selfish to the</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.702" end="00:17:55.902" style="s2">core. He&#39;d still hoard all the food</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.502" end="00:17:57.602" style="s2">here. Keep dreaming.</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.902" end="00:17:59.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know? Maybe he&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.602" end="00:18:00.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe what? We just begged him for food.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.502" end="00:18:02.602" style="s2">Did he share? What&#39;s the point of</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.702" end="00:18:04.302" style="s2">regretting it now? You all voted to kick</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.602" end="00:18:06.202" style="s2">Ye Feng out, didn&#39;t you? You did it,</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.302" end="00:18:08.802" style="s2">too. Why act all innocent now?</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.202" end="00:18:10.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, quiet down and listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.802" end="00:18:12.702" style="s2">After today, I&#39;ll admit we were a little</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.302" end="00:18:14.602" style="s2">hasty kicking Ye Feng out.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.702" end="00:18:16.402" style="s2">But so what? As they say, slow and</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.602" end="00:18:17.802" style="s2">steady wins the race. This is a survival</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.402" end="00:18:19.402" style="s2">game. We have to last and think long</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.802" end="00:18:21.103" style="s2">term. In the long run, kicking Ye Feng</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.402" end="00:18:22.803" style="s2">out was the right call. Oppressing women</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.103" end="00:18:24.703" style="s2">is in men&#39;s nature. Ye Feng is clearly</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.803" end="00:18:25.903" style="s2">no exception. Keeping him here would</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.703" end="00:18:27.503" style="s2">only hurt us all.</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.903" end="00:18:29.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng just got lucky today, but</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.503" end="00:18:31.303" style="s2">everyone knows that kind of luck can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.103" end="00:18:33.003" style="s2">last. Tomorrow, all three casts might</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.303" end="00:18:34.103" style="s2">come up empty. We just had a little bad</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.003" end="00:18:35.803" style="s2">luck today.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.103" end="00:18:39.703" style="s2">I&#39;m sure we&#39;ll fish up something good</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.803" end="00:18:39.703" style="s2">tomorrow. Justice will prevail.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.203" end="00:18:46.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. There&#39;s only one of him. There</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.303" end="00:18:48.503" style="s2">are 24 of us with three casts each.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.403" end="00:18:49.703" style="s2">That&#39;s 72 chances tomorrow. We&#39;re bound</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.503" end="00:18:51.503" style="s2">to reel in something good.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.703" end="00:18:52.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s having hot pot today. We&#39;ll have</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.503" end="00:18:53.703" style="s2">barbecue tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.603" end="00:18:55.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, barbecue.</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.703" end="00:18:56.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see him gloat then. His luck has</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.903" end="00:18:58.503" style="s2">to run out.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.603" end="00:19:01.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll win in the end. Justice will</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.503" end="00:19:01.603" style="s2">prevail. We&#39;ll win.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.703" end="00:19:08.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That hit the spot.</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.703" end="00:19:09.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like I&#39;m set for food for now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.303" end="00:19:12.003" style="s2">That&#39;s bottled water.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.503" end="00:19:14.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still can&#39;t go. Keeping myself safe is</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.003" end="00:19:16.403" style="s2">a top priority too. I need more weapons</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.303" end="00:19:18.903" style="s2">or items to protect myself.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.403" end="00:19:20.603" style="s2">After all, those women have</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.903" end="00:19:23.003" style="s2">She&#39;s a tough fighter. And what if one</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.603" end="00:19:27.003" style="s2">of them awakens a combat talent?</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.003" end="00:19:27.003" style="s2">If only I could make myself stronger.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.203" end="00:19:30.303" style="s2">Make myself stronger.</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.303" end="00:19:31.903" style="s2">Ascension.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.303" end="00:19:34.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t I think of that sooner?</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.903" end="00:19:36.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wonder if it&#39;ll work. If it does,</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.903" end="00:19:37.803" style="s2">I could get a lot stronger.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.703" end="00:19:40.103" style="s2">Then I won&#39;t have to worry about my</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.803" end="00:19:43.003" style="s2">safety. Time to get some rest.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.103" end="00:19:43.003" style="s2">Tomorrow will be better.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.603" end="00:19:47.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Extreme Realm Ascension has reset for</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.503" end="00:19:50.103" style="s2">the day.</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.203" end="00:19:53.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have three uses of Ascension today.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.103" end="00:19:54.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Extreme Realm Ascension. Target myself.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.203" end="00:19:56.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.903" end="00:19:58.603" style="s2">It actually works.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.503" end="00:20:01.103" style="s2">This feeling.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.603" end="00:20:03.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Extreme Realm Ascension complete. All</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.103" end="00:20:05.403" style="s2">stats raised to human limits. You have</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.303" end="00:20:06.903" style="s2">gained an additional passive trait,</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.403" end="00:20:10.003" style="s2">ageless.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.903" end="00:20:10.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a strange feeling.</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.603" end="00:20:15.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; System announcement. The Sky Island has</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.603" end="00:20:17.503" style="s2">expanded. Its total area has increased</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.603" end="00:20:19.303" style="s2">from one to two square li. New terrain</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.503" end="00:20:21.003" style="s2">includes low hills and thickets. New</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.303" end="00:20:23.105" style="s2">resources include small quantities of</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.003" end="00:20:24.905" style="s2">edible wild fruit scattered across the</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.105" end="00:20:26.605" style="s2">Survivors explore and gather these</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.905" end="00:20:28.505" style="s2">resources yourself. Chests obtained by</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.605" end="00:20:29.905" style="s2">fishing can yield abundant resources but</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.505" end="00:20:31.905" style="s2">have a small chance of spawning a wild</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.905" end="00:20:33.305" style="s2">beast. Survivors proceed with caution.</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.905" end="00:20:34.905" style="s2">Friendly reminder, keep at least 10</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.305" end="00:20:36.805" style="s2">survivors alive on the island or face</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.905" end="00:20:41.005" style="s2">the consequences. Today&#39;s Choice Quest</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.805" end="00:20:41.005" style="s2">begins at 9 a.m. Good luck.</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.305" end="00:20:46.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another system announcement.</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.505" end="00:20:48.905" style="s2">The Choice Quest starts at 9 a.m.</p>
<p begin="00:20:46.605" end="00:20:51.305" style="s2">New terrain and new resources.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.905" end="00:20:52.505" style="s2">Chests can spawn wild beasts now. Also,</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.305" end="00:20:54.305" style="s2">don&#39;t let the island&#39;s population drop</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.505" end="00:20:56.905" style="s2">below 10. Could this survival game have</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.305" end="00:20:58.505" style="s2">team missions too? And the chests, the</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.905" end="00:21:00.905" style="s2">system specifically warned they might</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.505" end="00:21:03.105" style="s2">contain beasts. If I get one, could I</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.905" end="00:21:03.105" style="s2">beat it?</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.405" end="00:21:07.005" style="s2">If even someone as strong as me can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.305" end="00:21:10.705" style="s2">handle these beasts,</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.005" end="00:21:10.705" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t everyone else be dead meat?</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.305" end="00:21:15.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The island&#39;s bigger and wild fruit is</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.305" end="00:21:16.905" style="s2">growing. Great. We&#39;ve got another source</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.905" end="00:21:18.905" style="s2">of food.</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.905" end="00:21:20.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s only a little wild fruit, but it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.905" end="00:21:23.305" style="s2">better than nothing. I wonder what</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.405" end="00:21:25.505" style="s2">today&#39;s Choice Mission is.</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.305" end="00:21:27.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In that case, let&#39;s hold off for now.</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.505" end="00:21:29.805" style="s2">We&#39;ll finish the Choice Mission, then</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.105" end="00:21:29.805" style="s2">see about fishing.</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.005" end="00:21:37.605" style="s2">System announcement. Mandatory daily</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.705" end="00:21:39.405" style="s2">choice. Make your choice within 100</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.605" end="00:21:41.005" style="s2">seconds. If you fail to choose, the</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.405" end="00:21:42.305" style="s2">system will choose randomly for you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.005" end="00:21:44.205" style="s2">Make your choice.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.305" end="00:21:46.405" style="s2">Option one, enter the arena and fight a</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.205" end="00:21:48.605" style="s2">sick dog to the death. Reward, 20</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.405" end="00:21:50.805" style="s2">portions of water or food, your choice.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.605" end="00:21:52.705" style="s2">Option two, enter the arena and fight a</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.805" end="00:21:54.905" style="s2">hungry wolf to the death.</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.705" end="00:21:55.505" style="s2">Reward, 20 portions of water or food,</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.905" end="00:21:58.405" style="s2">your choice.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.505" end="00:22:01.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option three, sit out. No reward or</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.405" end="00:22:04.425" style="s2">penalty. Notice, repeatedly sitting out</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.205" end="00:22:06.445" style="s2">may trigger mandatory missions later.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.425" end="00:22:06.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.505" end="00:22:11.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fight a wolf or a dog to the death?</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.005" end="00:22:13.805" style="s2">That&#39;s suicide. It&#39;s a wolf, a hungry</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.305" end="00:22:14.905" style="s2">one, too. Hungry wolves are vicious. Who</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.805" end="00:22:16.405" style="s2">could beat one?</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.905" end="00:22:18.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least we can sit this one out.</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.405" end="00:22:20.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But what about those mandatory missions?</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.405" end="00:22:21.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll worry about that later. Thinking</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.005" end="00:22:22.405" style="s2">it through, we might stand a chance</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.505" end="00:22:23.805" style="s2">against a sick dog.</p>
<p begin="00:22:22.405" end="00:22:26.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A dog&#39;s no good either. What if it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.805" end="00:22:28.106" style="s2">huge, like a Tibetan mastiff? One bite</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.306" end="00:22:29.706" style="s2">tear your flesh off. How could girls</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.106" end="00:22:31.306" style="s2">like us possibly beat it?</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.706" end="00:22:32.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m out. I choose option three.</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.306" end="00:22:33.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.306" end="00:22:35.806" style="s2">How could we beat a dog? Unless it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.806" end="00:22:37.306" style="s2">tiny, like a toy poodle. But 20 whole</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.806" end="00:22:39.006" style="s2">supply packs</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.306" end="00:22:41.306" style="s2">that&#39;s a huge reward.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.006" end="00:22:42.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quiet, everyone. Listen. Unlike</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.306" end="00:22:44.506" style="s2">yesterday, today&#39;s choice involves a</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.906" end="00:22:46.106" style="s2">fight to the death. Option three has no</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.506" end="00:22:48.106" style="s2">reward, but it&#39;s completely safe.</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.106" end="00:22:49.406" style="s2">Options one and two offer big rewards,</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.106" end="00:22:51.606" style="s2">but you have to fight a wolf or dog in</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.406" end="00:22:54.006" style="s2">the arena. Win and you get the reward.</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.606" end="00:22:55.806" style="s2">Lose and you die. So it&#39;s your choice.</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.006" end="00:22:57.706" style="s2">Is anyone brave enough to step up and</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.806" end="00:23:00.106" style="s2">try? You could take a chance on option</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.706" end="00:23:02.206" style="s2">one, fighting a sick dog. It&#39;s sick</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.106" end="00:23:04.606" style="s2">after all. If it&#39;s small too, we&#39;d have</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.206" end="00:23:06.906" style="s2">a good chance. Whoever wins gets to keep</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.606" end="00:23:07.706" style="s2">all the supplies. Fortune favors the</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.906" end="00:23:10.706" style="s2">brave.</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.706" end="00:23:10.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think I can do it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.106" end="00:23:14.606" style="s2">I fished this out yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.006" end="00:23:16.806" style="s2">With this, I could handle more than one</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.606" end="00:23:18.606" style="s2">sick dog. Even if two healthy dogs came</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.806" end="00:23:20.906" style="s2">at me, I&#39;d smash their skulls in.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.606" end="00:23:21.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You go, girl. YOU&#39;RE THE BEST,</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.906" end="00:23:24.706" style="s2">KILL THAT DOG!</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.806" end="00:23:24.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;LL WIN FOR SURE.</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.706" end="00:23:31.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I THINK I CAN DO IT. It&#39;s just a dog. I</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.106" end="00:23:33.906" style="s2">could kill it barehanded.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.906" end="00:23:35.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be rash. Let&#39;s play it safe and</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.906" end="00:23:37.406" style="s2">sit this one out. We&#39;re still figuring</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.606" end="00:23:40.406" style="s2">out the survival games rules. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.406" end="00:23:44.206" style="s2">watch this round and decide next time.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.406" end="00:23:44.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. I&#39;ll follow your lead.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.806" end="00:23:50.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fight a sick dog to the death.</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.006" end="00:23:51.906" style="s2">Fight a hungry wolf to the death.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.206" end="00:23:53.106" style="s2">That&#39;s a tough choice.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.906" end="00:23:54.506" style="s2">What a relief.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.106" end="00:23:56.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hint for option one says the arena</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.506" end="00:23:58.106" style="s2">dog is infected with a zombie virus. Far</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.506" end="00:23:59.806" style="s2">stronger than a grown man. It&#39;s highly</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.106" end="00:24:03.106" style="s2">aggressive and has a deadly bite.</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.806" end="00:24:04.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Holy crap. A zombie dog.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.106" end="00:24:06.306" style="s2">What a sneaky trick.</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.706" end="00:24:08.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The arena wolf hasn&#39;t eaten for seven</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.306" end="00:24:10.706" style="s2">days and nights. It&#39;s collapsed from</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.106" end="00:24:12.406" style="s2">hunger, barely able to lift its head.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.706" end="00:24:15.206" style="s2">Just walk up and give it a kick. It&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.406" end="00:24:15.206" style="s2">never get up again.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.306" end="00:24:19.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.106" end="00:24:21.606" style="s2">That dog&#39;s the real killer.</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.306" end="00:24:23.806" style="s2">I choose option two. Fight the starving</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.606" end="00:24:23.806" style="s2">wolf.</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.906" end="00:24:30.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option one</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.706" end="00:24:33.207" style="s2">Option two</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.506" end="00:24:35.507" style="s2">Option three, Liu Ruyan. Qin Shuang. Bai</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.207" end="00:24:38.107" style="s2">Lichu. An Fengjiao.</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.507" end="00:24:40.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, Ye Feng picked option two. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.107" end="00:24:43.207" style="s2">got some nerve. He&#39;s asking to get</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.507" end="00:24:43.207" style="s2">killed.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.207" end="00:24:51.507" style="s2">It must be in the arena.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.507" end="00:24:56.707" style="s2">We can even watch it happen.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.307" end="00:24:58.908" style="s2">Amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.707" end="00:25:01.408" style="s2">It&#39;s starting. Look, Guifang&#39;s sure to</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.908" end="00:25:04.207" style="s2">win. Wait, look at Ye Feng. Why isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.408" end="00:25:04.207" style="s2">that wolf moving?</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.067" end="00:25:15.087" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.707" end="00:25:19.908" style="s2">How long was that?</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.107" end="00:25:21.507" style="s2">3 seconds.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.908" end="00:25:24.007" style="s2">He killed that starving wolf with one</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.507" end="00:25:26.307" style="s2">kick. Oh no, girls, look at Wang</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.007" end="00:25:26.307" style="s2">Guifang.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.707" end="00:25:40.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is that?</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.307" end="00:25:40.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a sick dog.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.408" end="00:25:47.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is this happening?</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.607" end="00:25:49.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that? That&#39;s no dog.</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.207" end="00:25:50.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wang Guifang&#39;s dead. It tore her to</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.408" end="00:25:53.207" style="s2">pieces.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.507" end="00:25:55.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My god, what kind of monster is that?</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.207" end="00:25:56.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank goodness we picked option three,</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.007" end="00:25:57.908" style="s2">or</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.207" end="00:25:59.507" style="s2">or that would have been us.</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.908" end="00:26:01.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng picked the wolf, but it was too</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.507" end="00:26:03.607" style="s2">hungry to even stand. He barely had to</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.307" end="00:26:06.207" style="s2">try. But Wang Guifang chose wrong and</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.607" end="00:26:08.507" style="s2">got zombie dogs. They tore her apart.</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.207" end="00:26:09.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This [ __ ] quest. One wrong choice</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.507" end="00:26:11.007" style="s2">and you die.</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.408" end="00:26:12.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How the hell did Ye Feng get lucky</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.007" end="00:26:14.207" style="s2">enough to pick right?</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.207" end="00:26:14.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he picked the dog two, he&#39;d be dead</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.207" end="00:26:17.207" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.908" end="00:26:19.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why does he get to be so lucky?</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.207" end="00:26:21.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng just got lucky, but his luck</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.607" end="00:26:23.408" style="s2">won&#39;t last forever.</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.408" end="00:26:24.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s reckless. He might be dead by</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.408" end="00:26:26.007" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.408" end="00:26:28.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng&#39;s so arrogant. He&#39;s bound to</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.007" end="00:26:30.207" style="s2">keep taking risks. One wrong move and</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.107" end="00:26:31.409" style="s2">he&#39;s dead. Then we can take all his</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.207" end="00:26:33.109" style="s2">food.</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.409" end="00:26:34.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyway, we&#39;re done with today&#39;s choice</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.109" end="00:26:36.309" style="s2">quest.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.109" end="00:26:37.709" style="s2">Our priority now is gathering supplies.</p>
<p begin="00:26:36.309" end="00:26:39.709" style="s2">Let&#39;s stick together and go fishing</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.709" end="00:26:41.109" style="s2">first. I&#39;ve got a feeling we&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.709" end="00:26:41.709" style="s2">lucky today.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.109" end="00:26:44.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.709" end="00:26:44.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move out.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.009" end="00:26:49.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That should keep me stocked with water</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.709" end="00:26:51.109" style="s2">for days.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.709" end="00:26:52.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Time to go fishing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.109" end="00:26:54.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But that means opening the chests I</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.409" end="00:26:55.309" style="s2">catch. And there could be wild beasts</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.509" end="00:26:56.809" style="s2">inside.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.309" end="00:26:59.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll watch them fish and open their</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.809" end="00:27:00.609" style="s2">chests first. If a beast shows up, I can</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.009" end="00:27:02.909" style="s2">see how strong it is. Then I&#39;ll decide</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.609" end="00:27:02.909" style="s2">what to do.</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.309" end="00:27:15.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not a bad haul.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.909" end="00:27:20.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can I be this unlucky with catches</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.109" end="00:27:21.709" style="s2">this rare? How did Ye Feng get so many</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.709" end="00:27:23.413" style="s2">supplies?</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.709" end="00:27:25.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does Ye Feng have a talent?</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.413" end="00:27:25.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.609" end="00:27:37.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll light a</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.809" end="00:27:38.309" style="s2">Now we can build a fire to keep warm at</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.709" end="00:27:40.609" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.309" end="00:27:42.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today&#39;s our lucky day. Girls who smile</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.609" end="00:27:45.109" style="s2">always have good luck.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.209" end="00:27:46.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep it up, everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.109" end="00:27:49.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is so unfair.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.609" end="00:27:50.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did I get wood? I don&#39;t want wood.</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.109" end="00:27:53.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These women haven&#39;t fished up a single</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.709" end="00:27:55.609" style="s2">chest yet. Still, it&#39;s a blessing in</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.009" end="00:27:57.609" style="s2">disguise. After all, the more chests you</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.609" end="00:28:00.109" style="s2">open, the likelier you are to encounter</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.609" end="00:28:00.109" style="s2">a beast.</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.609" end="00:28:10.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three catches, zero catches. You&#39;re a</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.609" end="00:28:12.309" style="s2">riot, An Song Jiao.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.709" end="00:28:13.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were so sure of yourself. You didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.309" end="00:28:14.709" style="s2">even catch a weed.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.409" end="00:28:16.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thought you&#39;d land a big one.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.709" end="00:28:19.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just practicing your casts.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.109" end="00:28:19.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She must be the unluckiest one today.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.109" end="00:28:28.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.809" end="00:28:28.009" style="s2">Nothing at all? What a letdown.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.809" end="00:28:32.510" style="s2">A treasure chest.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.909" end="00:28:33.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s a treasure chest.</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.510" end="00:28:34.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.909" end="00:28:37.310" style="s2">You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.110" end="00:28:37.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; so lucky. Open it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.010" end="00:28:52.310" style="s2">I can&#39;t die.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.810" end="00:28:54.610" style="s2">I don&#39;t have to be the fastest. Just</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.310" end="00:28:56.410" style="s2">faster than someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.610" end="00:28:57.310" style="s2">Damn it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.410" end="00:29:00.710" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.310" end="00:29:00.710" style="s2">At this rate, I&#39;M DEAD.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.310" end="00:29:05.110" style="s2">YOU [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.610" end="00:29:10.510" style="s2">I&#39;M DONE FOR.</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.310" end="00:29:13.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.510" end="00:29:14.710" style="s2">Am I going to die?</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.210" end="00:29:17.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should I step in?</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.710" end="00:29:18.410" style="s2">Looks like an ordinary python.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.210" end="00:29:19.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; goes to my school.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.410" end="00:29:21.610" style="s2">Only she stood up for me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.910" end="00:29:23.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;d be a shame to let that python eat</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.610" end="00:29:23.810" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.110" end="00:29:27.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m alive.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.010" end="00:29:38.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This beast pretty weak, just as I</p>
<p begin="00:29:35.810" end="00:29:38.510" style="s2">thought.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.210" end="00:29:47.710" style="s2">It vanished.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.510" end="00:29:48.610" style="s2">Guess snake&#39;s off the menu.</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.710" end="00:29:50.710" style="s2">But what&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.610" end="00:29:53.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtained one survival coin.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.710" end="00:29:56.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Survival coin. So killing beasts earns</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.110" end="00:29:56.010" style="s2">these. Two.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.210" end="00:30:00.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.110" end="00:30:02.110" style="s2">Thank you for saving me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.410" end="00:30:04.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t saving you. Don&#39;t flatter</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.110" end="00:30:07.110" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.410" end="00:30:07.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. Still, thank you for saving my</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.110" end="00:30:09.510" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.910" end="00:30:11.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Glad you&#39;re okay. You&#39;re the only one</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.510" end="00:30:14.310" style="s2">who stood up for me. I&#39;d hate for you to</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.210" end="00:30:14.310" style="s2">die before these women.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.310" end="00:30:22.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s so strong.</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.510" end="00:30:24.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; killed that giant python in just a few</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.410" end="00:30:25.510" style="s2">moves, like a martial arts master.</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.610" end="00:30:27.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unbelievable.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.510" end="00:30:28.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s so strong</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.210" end="00:30:30.810" style="s2">and so hot.</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.710" end="00:30:32.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s better than me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.810" end="00:30:33.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By far.</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.110" end="00:30:35.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you all just standing there? The</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.510" end="00:30:37.912" style="s2">python&#39;s dead. Get back to Count the</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.512" end="00:30:37.912" style="s2">supplies.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.812" end="00:30:42.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.212" end="00:30:44.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn right I did, you [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.912" end="00:30:46.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You nearly got me killed.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.312" end="00:30:47.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you pulled my hair, I came this</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.412" end="00:30:48.712" style="s2">close.</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.112" end="00:30:49.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The giant that snakes jaws. YOU</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.712" end="00:30:51.912" style="s2">MURDERER.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.812" end="00:30:51.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP.</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.112" end="00:30:57.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MISS LIU, I WANT JUSTICE. That [ __ ] was</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.112" end="00:30:58.812" style="s2">right behind me. SHE PULLED MY HAIR and</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.212" end="00:31:00.612" style="s2">made me and Zhong Nianxue fall behind.</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.812" end="00:31:02.412" style="s2">That python nearly killed us. She&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.612" end="00:31:04.412" style="s2">murderer. She has to answer for this.</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.412" end="00:31:05.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re lying. I never touched you. You</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.412" end="00:31:06.912" style="s2">tripped.</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.712" end="00:31:08.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.912" end="00:31:10.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t see what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.712" end="00:31:12.612" style="s2">Did anyone see Shen Manqing pull An</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.012" end="00:31:12.612" style="s2">Fengjiao&#39;s hair?</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.812" end="00:31:16.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw it clearly.</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.912" end="00:31:19.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re friends and you fell together. Of</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.812" end="00:31:21.312" style="s2">course you&#39;d take her side.</p>
<p begin="00:31:19.712" end="00:31:22.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhong Nianxue also counts as involved.</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.312" end="00:31:24.912" style="s2">Without another witness, her word</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.812" end="00:31:26.912" style="s2">doesn&#39;t count. Doesn&#39;t count.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.912" end="00:31:29.312" style="s2">Like I said, I didn&#39;t see it. For the</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.912" end="00:31:31.112" style="s2">sake of team unity, this ends here.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.312" end="00:31:32.512" style="s2">An Fengjiao, drop it</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.112" end="00:31:34.612" style="s2">or else.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.512" end="00:31:36.112" style="s2">Understood. Everyone still gets just one</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.612" end="00:31:37.612" style="s2">portion of food and half a bottle of</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.112" end="00:31:38.912" style="s2">water today. That&#39;s your ration for the</p>
<p begin="00:31:37.612" end="00:31:39.912" style="s2">whole day.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.912" end="00:31:41.312" style="s2">Zhong Nianxue,</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.912" end="00:31:43.212" style="s2">you only get half the others food and</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.312" end="00:31:44.212" style="s2">water today.</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.212" end="00:31:45.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.212" end="00:31:47.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You opened the chest with that python.</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.712" end="00:31:48.012" style="s2">Without it, would our food and water</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.212" end="00:31:48.912" style="s2">have been ruined?</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.012" end="00:31:50.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all your fault.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.912" end="00:31:51.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, you nearly got us all killed.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.412" end="00:31:53.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know how close that was?</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.612" end="00:31:54.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You all heard the system. Any chest</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.212" end="00:31:55.612" style="s2">could have a beast inside. How is that</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.712" end="00:31:57.512" style="s2">my fault?</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.612" end="00:31:58.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I nearly got mauled to death. I&#39;m a</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.512" end="00:31:59.812" style="s2">victim too.</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.612" end="00:32:01.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a victim.</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.812" end="00:32:03.112" style="s2">We&#39;re the victims here. Your bad luck</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.512" end="00:32:04.112" style="s2">put us all in danger, and now you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.112" end="00:32:06.112" style="s2">playing the victim.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.112" end="00:32:07.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? I&#39;m part of this team too. Why are</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.112" end="00:32:08.812" style="s2">you cutting my rations?</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.412" end="00:32:09.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got us so much food from those chests</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.812" end="00:32:10.112" style="s2">yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.512" end="00:32:11.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.112" end="00:32:13.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you&#39;re bad luck. Because you</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.812" end="00:32:14.812" style="s2">nearly got us killed. You&#39;re lucky we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.512" end="00:32:18.312" style="s2">giving you half, and you&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.812" end="00:32:20.112" style="s2">complaining. Then you can have nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.312" end="00:32:21.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You Rouyan, you can do this.</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.112" end="00:32:21.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you say we&#39;d all get equal</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.312" end="00:32:23.912" style="s2">shares?</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.912" end="00:32:25.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, everyone gets an equal share, but</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.912" end="00:32:27.412" style="s2">mistakes have consequences. Zhong</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.512" end="00:32:29.512" style="s2">Nianxue, you earned credit by fishing up</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.412" end="00:32:31.412" style="s2">food yesterday, and you were rewarded.</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.512" end="00:32:33.712" style="s2">Today, you messed up, so you&#39;re being</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.412" end="00:32:36.112" style="s2">punished. Don&#39;t worry. It&#39;s just this</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.712" end="00:32:36.112" style="s2">once.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.112" end="00:32:41.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, everyone. Keep your spirits</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.013" end="00:32:43.513" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.713" end="00:32:45.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We didn&#39;t get much today, but we can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.513" end="00:32:47.513" style="s2">give up. Everyone has unlucky days.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.813" end="00:32:49.713" style="s2">Today was rough, but tomorrow will be</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.513" end="00:32:51.013" style="s2">better. If we stick together, we&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.713" end="00:32:52.713" style="s2">through this.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.013" end="00:32:54.313" style="s2">Besides, the system says there&#39;s wild</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.713" end="00:32:56.713" style="s2">fruit on the island now. This is our</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.313" end="00:32:58.413" style="s2">chance. The island&#39;s grown a lot, too.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.713" end="00:33:00.113" style="s2">There may be new opportunities. At least</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.413" end="00:33:01.913" style="s2">we can gather wild fruit to eat. There</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.113" end="00:33:02.913" style="s2">isn&#39;t much, but it&#39;ll take the edge off</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.913" end="00:33:05.113" style="s2">our hunger.</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.913" end="00:33:07.513" style="s2">We also have a way to make fire now. We</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.113" end="00:33:09.313" style="s2">fished up some wood, but I reckon</p>
<p begin="00:33:07.513" end="00:33:11.113" style="s2">wood seems pretty important, so we</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.313" end="00:33:13.413" style="s2">should conserve it. I think we can</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.113" end="00:33:15.113" style="s2">gather dry leaves and firewood to keep</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.413" end="00:33:17.313" style="s2">warm at night. Everyone should also make</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.113" end="00:33:18.613" style="s2">a basic bed to sleep on. We also need to</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.313" end="00:33:20.113" style="s2">deal with Li Mengzhi&#39;s body and the</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.613" end="00:33:21.813" style="s2">others. Maybe throw them into the</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.113" end="00:33:23.913" style="s2">fishing pool. We&#39;ll cover more ground if</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.813" end="00:33:25.613" style="s2">we split into groups this time. Explore</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.913" end="00:33:27.613" style="s2">the Sky Island in groups of three to</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.613" end="00:33:29.813" style="s2">five. Bring back firewood and wild fruit</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.613" end="00:33:31.813" style="s2">before dark. So much work. Finding</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.813" end="00:33:33.613" style="s2">fruit, gathering firewood. We&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.813" end="00:33:35.513" style="s2">exhausted.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.613" end="00:33:36.913" style="s2">I know none of you want to work, but we</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.513" end="00:33:38.713" style="s2">have no other choice.</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.913" end="00:33:40.513" style="s2">We get too little from fishing. Wild</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.713" end="00:33:41.513" style="s2">fruit is our only other food source, and</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.513" end="00:33:42.513" style="s2">if you don&#39;t want to freeze again</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.513" end="00:33:44.713" style="s2">tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.513" end="00:33:46.113" style="s2">we need that firewood.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.713" end="00:33:48.713" style="s2">Now we have a lighter, so we can make a</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.113" end="00:33:51.213" style="s2">fire and stay warmer tonight. Isn&#39;t that</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.713" end="00:33:51.213" style="s2">a good thing?</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.413" end="00:33:55.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Choosing the right pool matters. It</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.913" end="00:33:56.613" style="s2">matters a lot, actually. Look at those</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.013" end="00:33:58.413" style="s2">women fishing in the low-tier pool. All</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.613" end="00:34:00.013" style="s2">they catch is junk.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.413" end="00:34:02.313" style="s2">Even the bread comes two slices at a</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.013" end="00:34:02.313" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.213" end="00:34:06.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtain eight servings of bread.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.713" end="00:34:08.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Any food is a decent catch.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.413" end="00:34:09.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Notice double rewards activated for this</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.113" end="00:34:11.013" style="s2">catch.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.613" end="00:34:13.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The special rod&#39;s double reward effect</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.013" end="00:34:13.713" style="s2">actually kicked in.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.813" end="00:34:18.713" style="s2">Opening treasure chests is still today&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.613" end="00:34:20.813" style="s2">main event, but I need to be careful.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.713" end="00:34:22.113" style="s2">There could be beasts inside. I used</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.813" end="00:34:23.913" style="s2">ultimate ascension on myself this</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.113" end="00:34:25.213" style="s2">morning. I&#39;ve got two uses of ultimate</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.913" end="00:34:26.813" style="s2">ascension left.</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.213" end="00:34:29.313" style="s2">I&#39;ll use both on chests.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.813" end="00:34:29.313" style="s2">But which one?</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.313" end="00:34:32.713" style="s2">More food, too.</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.113" end="00:34:33.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ascension complete. Obtained one fine</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.713" end="00:34:36.413" style="s2">quality treasure chest.</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.813" end="00:34:38.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice. I&#39;ve got enough food for now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.413" end="00:34:40.613" style="s2">Extreme ascension. Hope I get something</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.313" end="00:34:40.613" style="s2">good.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.113" end="00:34:43.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtained one bronze bone saber.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.714" end="00:34:44.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.414" end="00:34:45.814" style="s2">A melee weapon?</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.014" end="00:34:47.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bronze bone saber, fine quality,</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.814" end="00:34:49.214" style="s2">strength plus two, agility plus two,</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.714" end="00:34:50.114" style="s2">attack plus three percent.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.214" end="00:34:52.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn.</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.114" end="00:34:53.114" style="s2">Fine quality with great stat boosts. I</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.114" end="00:34:54.114" style="s2">can feel it already.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.114" end="00:34:55.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Notice,</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.114" end="00:34:57.514" style="s2">stat bonuses from equipment of the same</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.914" end="00:34:59.114" style="s2">type do not stack.</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.514" end="00:35:01.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So there are other types of equipment,</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.114" end="00:35:02.814" style="s2">too. Maybe equipment slots will unlock</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.114" end="00:35:05.514" style="s2">later. This survival game still has</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.814" end="00:35:07.114" style="s2">plenty of features to unlock.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.514" end="00:35:07.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtained one basic saber technique</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.114" end="00:35:08.914" style="s2">scroll.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.714" end="00:35:10.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A saber skill scroll?</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.914" end="00:35:12.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A skill. Basic saber technique scroll,</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.714" end="00:35:14.014" style="s2">fine quality. Tear this scroll to use it</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.714" end="00:35:14.914" style="s2">and instantly become an expert saber</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.014" end="00:35:16.614" style="s2">wielder.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.914" end="00:35:18.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect. This skill goes with my new</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.614" end="00:35:19.914" style="s2">saber. Should I use Ascension on it? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.714" end="00:35:21.314" style="s2">out of uses today.</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.914" end="00:35:23.114" style="s2">I&#39;d have to wait until tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.314" end="00:35:24.414" style="s2">Besides, even after I learn it, I should</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.114" end="00:35:26.814" style="s2">still be able to upgrade it just like my</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.414" end="00:35:26.814" style="s2">talents.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.714" end="00:35:30.914" style="s2">This feeling</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.114" end="00:35:32.414" style="s2">amazing. According to the Eye of</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.914" end="00:35:33.614" style="s2">Revelation, this is packed with</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.414" end="00:35:36.114" style="s2">delicious food.</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.614" end="00:35:37.714" style="s2">Let&#39;s see just how delicious it is.</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.114" end="00:35:39.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtained one cleaned whole chicken and</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.714" end="00:35:41.914" style="s2">one barbecue seasoning set.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.614" end="00:35:42.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Roast chicken, skewers, barbecue it is</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.914" end="00:35:44.614" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.514" end="00:35:46.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice. White chests are just as good as</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.614" end="00:35:48.314" style="s2">fine chests. What a haul.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.814" end="00:35:50.314" style="s2">This resource-rich fishing pool really</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.314" end="00:35:53.114" style="s2">delivers.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.314" end="00:35:53.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One last white chest.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.614" end="00:35:56.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtained 10 bananas and one bunch of</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.714" end="00:35:59.514" style="s2">grapes.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.514" end="00:36:01.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some food&#39;s nice, too.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.514" end="00:36:03.514" style="s2">Luckily, no beasts came out of the</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.114" end="00:36:03.514" style="s2">chest.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.914" end="00:36:09.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You all see it now, right?</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.514" end="00:36:16.214" style="s2">And Wang Xiaoman are their lackeys,</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.214" end="00:36:17.714" style="s2">along with a few man-hating followers.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.214" end="00:36:20.614" style="s2">Those dozen or so women form the inner</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.714" end="00:36:22.014" style="s2">circle. The rest of us are outsiders.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.614" end="00:36:23.814" style="s2">After that incident with Shen Manqing</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.014" end="00:36:25.814" style="s2">today,</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.814" end="00:36:27.114" style="s2">and I even got on Liu Ruyan&#39;s bad side.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.814" end="00:36:28.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what if we did?</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.114" end="00:36:31.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Staying on her good side hasn&#39;t helped</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.614" end="00:36:33.114" style="s2">us much. This damn game gives us a daily</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.114" end="00:36:35.314" style="s2">choice quest that could kill us.</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.114" end="00:36:38.214" style="s2">And barely any supplies, no trading</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.314" end="00:36:39.714" style="s2">system, no chat channel, nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.214" end="00:36:41.314" style="s2">We just have to tough it out, and we</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.714" end="00:36:42.714" style="s2">made the wrong choice.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.314" end="00:36:43.914" style="s2">Liu Ruyan is nowhere near the leader Ye</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.714" end="00:36:45.016" style="s2">Feng is.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.914" end="00:36:46.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree.</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.016" end="00:36:48.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sure Ye Feng will make it much</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.416" end="00:36:50.716" style="s2">further. Think about it. One giant</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.616" end="00:36:52.416" style="s2">python sent over 20 of us running. Even</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.716" end="00:36:54.816" style="s2">Qin Shuang grabbed Liu Ru Yan and fled,</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.416" end="00:36:56.916" style="s2">but Ye Feng stepped in and killed it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.816" end="00:36:59.316" style="s2">He&#39;s strong, he&#39;s lucky, and he&#39;s got a</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.916" end="00:37:01.116" style="s2">whole stockpile of food.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.316" end="00:37:03.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, what&#39;s your point?</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.116" end="00:37:05.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m starving. Let&#39;s ask him for some</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.016" end="00:37:07.516" style="s2">food.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.016" end="00:37:09.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But when we went to him last night, he</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.516" end="00:37:11.216" style="s2">humiliated all of us. He made outrageous</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.716" end="00:37:13.316" style="s2">demands and told us to keep our</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.216" end="00:37:14.316" style="s2">distance. What if he does that to us</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.316" end="00:37:16.116" style="s2">again?</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.316" end="00:37:18.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He might, but we won&#39;t know unless we</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.116" end="00:37:19.916" style="s2">try. I&#39;m too hungry to take it anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.116" end="00:37:21.916" style="s2">He saved Nian Xue and me today. We can</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.916" end="00:37:23.416" style="s2">go thank him. Fair enough, right?</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.916" end="00:37:25.216" style="s2">Besides, a few of us won&#39;t pose a</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.416" end="00:37:28.016" style="s2">threat. Ye Feng probably won&#39;t attack us</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.216" end="00:37:29.716" style="s2">on sight. And Nian Xue,</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.016" end="00:37:32.516" style="s2">after what happened today, Ye Feng might</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.716" end="00:37:32.516" style="s2">take pity on us.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.016" end="00:37:37.316" style="s2">Ye Feng&#39;s capable, I&#39;ll admit. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.316" end="00:37:39.916" style="s2">better than Liu Ru Yan, too. But you go</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.316" end="00:37:41.716" style="s2">ahead. I&#39;m staying.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.916" end="00:37:43.416" style="s2">How could I go begging to him? We kicked</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.716" end="00:37:44.916" style="s2">him out yesterday. He hates us. We&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.416" end="00:37:46.416" style="s2">just be asking for humiliation. No</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.916" end="00:37:47.516" style="s2">matter how hungry I get, I won&#39;t give</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.416" end="00:37:48.416" style="s2">him that satisfaction.</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.516" end="00:37:49.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Li Chu,</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.416" end="00:37:51.416" style="s2">save your breath. But I won&#39;t stop you</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.916" end="00:37:51.816" style="s2">from asking him, especially you, Nian</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.416" end="00:37:53.416" style="s2">Xue.</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.816" end="00:37:55.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got the best chance. I&#39;ll wait</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.416" end="00:37:57.916" style="s2">here. Go on. Don&#39;t waste time.</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.816" end="00:37:59.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. You&#39;ve got your pride, miss movie</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.916" end="00:38:01.916" style="s2">star. I won&#39;t push you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.716" end="00:38:03.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not as proud as you. I&#39;m starving.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.916" end="00:38:04.016" style="s2">I&#39;ll take my chances.</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.216" end="00:38:06.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about you?</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.016" end="00:38:06.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to go too.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.716" end="00:38:13.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That smells amazing.</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.516" end="00:38:14.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s eating?</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.316" end="00:38:17.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s barbecue.</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.516" end="00:38:17.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who else could it be over there?</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.661" end="00:38:25.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.016" end="00:38:27.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How does he do it?</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.116" end="00:38:28.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He had hot pot yesterday, now barbecue?</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.516" end="00:38:30.016" style="s2">Am I starving to death?</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.916" end="00:38:32.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m hallucinating.</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.016" end="00:38:34.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not hallucinating. I see it, too.</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.016" end="00:38:34.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s right there.</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.516" end="00:38:40.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.716" end="00:38:41.516" style="s2">Didn&#39;t I warn you to stay away from my</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.116" end="00:38:42.916" style="s2">camp?</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.516" end="00:38:44.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng,</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.916" end="00:38:47.216" style="s2">you were amazing back there. Killing</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.716" end="00:38:47.617" style="s2">that huge snake, you were so cool.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.216" end="00:38:49.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.617" end="00:38:51.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; look at me. I haven&#39;t eaten in two days.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.417" end="00:38:52.417" style="s2">My tummy is so hungry. Look at my face</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.117" end="00:38:54.617" style="s2">and here I&#39;m wasting away.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.417" end="00:38:57.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could you spare just a little food?</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.617" end="00:38:57.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty please?</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.817" end="00:39:02.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quite the actress. You deserve an Oscar.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.717" end="00:39:03.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not acting or faking it. I&#39;m really</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.117" end="00:39:04.417" style="s2">really hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.117" end="00:39:07.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do I even know you?</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.417" end="00:39:09.317" style="s2">How is your hunger my problem?</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.117" end="00:39:09.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please handsome, have a little pity on</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.317" end="00:39:10.917" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.817" end="00:39:12.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pity you?</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.917" end="00:39:13.917" style="s2">Did any of you pity me when you all</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.117" end="00:39:15.217" style="s2">kicked me out yesterday?</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.917" end="00:39:18.217" style="s2">Why play the victim now?</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.217" end="00:39:18.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tears won&#39;t help.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.217" end="00:39:23.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, this limited edition watch is</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.517" end="00:39:25.717" style="s2">worth at least 800,000 yuan.</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.517" end="00:39:27.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How about I trade it for some food?</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.717" end="00:39:28.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 800,000?</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.217" end="00:39:30.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Feng Jiao, don&#39;t you get it yet?</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.917" end="00:39:31.817" style="s2">We&#39;re on a sky island fighting to</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.217" end="00:39:32.417" style="s2">survive. The system panel tells the</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.817" end="00:39:33.717" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.417" end="00:39:34.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That thing you&#39;re holding is worthless</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.717" end="00:39:36.217" style="s2">junk here.</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.617" end="00:39:38.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think you can trade junk for food?</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.217" end="00:39:40.917" style="s2">How naive.</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.317" end="00:39:42.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still, I could spare you some food.</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.917" end="00:39:44.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to be my dogs. Just make a fair</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.617" end="00:39:45.817" style="s2">trade. Trade me anything useful you fish</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.717" end="00:39:47.817" style="s2">up for food.</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.817" end="00:39:48.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We haven&#39;t caught anything. What can we</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.817" end="00:39:50.017" style="s2">trade?</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.517" end="00:39:51.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.017" end="00:39:53.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ugh.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.917" end="00:39:55.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give us a chance, please.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.817" end="00:39:56.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, I&#39;m a kind soul. I&#39;ll give you a</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.817" end="00:39:58.317" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.317" end="00:39:59.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kicked me out yesterday. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.317" end="00:40:01.117" style="s2">just let that slide.</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.517" end="00:40:02.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get on your knees and sincerely</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.117" end="00:40:04.317" style="s2">apologize for yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.617" end="00:40:05.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show some real remorse and I&#39;ll reward</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.317" end="00:40:10.417" style="s2">you with my leftover chicken bones.</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.617" end="00:40:11.717" style="s2">Remember, kneel, apologize, and mean it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.417" end="00:40:13.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.717" end="00:40:15.517" style="s2">you&#39;re excused. I have other plans for</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.517" end="00:40:16.917" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.517" end="00:40:19.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.917" end="00:40:22.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, I&#39;ll apologize. I&#39;ll even beg.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.017" end="00:40:24.617" style="s2">I&#39;ll even bow to you. But I won&#39;t kneel.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.117" end="00:40:25.517" style="s2">I may be useless, but I, Su Qingqian,</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.617" end="00:40:26.517" style="s2">have my limits.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.517" end="00:40:28.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I kneel,</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.517" end="00:40:29.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll lose every shred of dignity.</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.317" end="00:40:30.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could you just</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.017" end="00:40:32.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you babbling about?</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.217" end="00:40:33.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kneel or get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.117" end="00:40:35.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feng Jiao,</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.217" end="00:40:38.017" style="s2">let&#39;s go. We don&#39;t need his food. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.917" end="00:40:39.917" style="s2">go back to Li Chu. She was right. We</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.017" end="00:40:42.917" style="s2">never should have come. Ye Feng is</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.917" end="00:40:44.317" style="s2">humiliating us.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.917" end="00:40:46.617" style="s2">Sis,</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.317" end="00:40:49.817" style="s2">you go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.617" end="00:40:49.817" style="s2">Then then I&#39;ll go.</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.217" end="00:40:51.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.318" end="00:40:52.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feng, I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.818" end="00:40:54.218" style="s2">And</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.718" end="00:40:55.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think a simple sorry cuts it?</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.218" end="00:40:57.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m truly sorry. I</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.918" end="00:40:58.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Formally apologize for driving you out</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.518" end="00:40:59.918" style="s2">yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.118" end="00:41:01.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was wrong, so terribly wrong. I see</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.918" end="00:41:03.418" style="s2">now that Liu Ru Yan can&#39;t lead this</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.418" end="00:41:05.318" style="s2">group. Only you can.</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.418" end="00:41:06.118" style="s2">Please forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.318" end="00:41:08.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.118" end="00:41:10.718" style="s2">I accept your apology.</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.518" end="00:41:12.518" style="s2">Since your apology is sincere, I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:41:10.718" end="00:41:13.418" style="s2">merciful and grant you these chicken</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.518" end="00:41:15.718" style="s2">bones.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.418" end="00:41:15.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.118" end="00:41:21.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Delicious.</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.318" end="00:41:21.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So delicious.</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.818" end="00:41:26.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, I&#39;ll get going.</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.318" end="00:41:32.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.318" end="00:41:38.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go easy on you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.418" end="00:41:40.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To me, it&#39;s a fair trade.</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.918" end="00:41:41.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me something and you get something</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.418" end="00:41:43.018" style="s2">in return.</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.118" end="00:41:45.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what do you have to offer?</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.018" end="00:41:47.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have nothing and I have no skills.</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.818" end="00:41:49.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can learn. Just massage my legs. 10</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.918" end="00:41:51.518" style="s2">minutes and you can eat your fill.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.418" end="00:41:53.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just 10 minutes for a full meal.</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.518" end="00:41:54.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An actual meal, not just bones.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.918" end="00:41:57.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.718" end="00:41:57.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.718" end="00:42:00.318" style="s2">I can do this.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.418" end="00:42:04.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No wonder she&#39;s the school beauty.</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.318" end="00:42:06.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gorgeous.</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.518" end="00:42:08.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too gentle.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.018" end="00:42:10.518" style="s2">Still too gentle. Haven&#39;t you eaten?</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.518" end="00:42:11.918" style="s2">Oh, right. You haven&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.518" end="00:42:15.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng,</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.918" end="00:42:15.118" style="s2">the 10 minutes are up.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.518" end="00:42:21.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.718" end="00:42:23.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks. You earned it. Here&#39;s some water</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.018" end="00:42:23.318" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.718" end="00:42:30.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s good. So good.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.318" end="00:42:32.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have some fruit with that meat.</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.118" end="00:42:33.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm, I&#39;m stuffed.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.018" end="00:42:34.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come back if you&#39;re hungry tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.518" end="00:42:36.718" style="s2">I&#39;ve got another deal for you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.618" end="00:42:39.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. It&#39;s entirely voluntary.</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.718" end="00:42:41.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More leg massages? Maybe more. This is</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.418" end="00:42:42.318" style="s2">so embarrassing. Ye Feng, I&#39;M NEVER</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.518" end="00:42:43.518" style="s2">COMING BACK.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.318" end="00:42:45.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NEVER.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.518" end="00:42:48.118" style="s2">You ate my food.</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.018" end="00:42:48.118" style="s2">Now you&#39;re running off.</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.518" end="00:42:51.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jin Qian, why are you back alone? Where</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.418" end="00:42:52.620" style="s2">are the others?</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.018" end="00:42:53.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mei Chu, Ye Feng, he</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.620" end="00:42:54.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; went too far.</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.520" end="00:42:55.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.320" end="00:42:58.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He wouldn&#39;t give you food. He said we</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.720" end="00:42:59.920" style="s2">had to kneel, apologize, and truly</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.020" end="00:43:01.220" style="s2">repent. Just to get a few of his</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.920" end="00:43:02.820" style="s2">leftover chicken bones.</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.220" end="00:43:05.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kneeling is so degrading.</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.820" end="00:43:06.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Who&#39;d agree to that? I couldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.620" end="00:43:07.320" style="s2">do it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.320" end="00:43:09.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.320" end="00:43:10.220" style="s2">She&#39;s brave. She told me to go ahead. I</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.220" end="00:43:12.220" style="s2">think she&#39;ll kneel.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.220" end="00:43:14.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;ll really do whatever it takes. She</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.220" end="00:43:15.720" style="s2">now saw this show biz veteran in a whole</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.620" end="00:43:17.720" style="s2">new light.</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.720" end="00:43:19.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.720" end="00:43:21.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She hasn&#39;t come back either. But was</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.620" end="00:43:24.020" style="s2">nice to her. He said she didn&#39;t have to</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.620" end="00:43:25.720" style="s2">apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.020" end="00:43:28.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That makes sense. They went to the same</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.720" end="00:43:31.120" style="s2">school after all.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.420" end="00:43:33.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feng Jiao, did did you get any food?</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.120" end="00:43:34.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I saved some and brought it back</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.720" end="00:43:37.220" style="s2">for you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.920" end="00:43:39.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These chicken bones have spit on them.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.220" end="00:43:41.820" style="s2">Even so, I had to kneel and apologize to</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.620" end="00:43:44.120" style="s2">get them. I&#39;m happy to share them with</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.820" end="00:43:44.120" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.120" end="00:43:49.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve thought it over. Pride won&#39;t fill</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.120" end="00:43:51.920" style="s2">my stomach. We drove him away yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.720" end="00:43:54.120" style="s2">We owe him. If he can thrive on this</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.920" end="00:43:57.020" style="s2">island and give me food, there&#39;s no</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.120" end="00:43:59.220" style="s2">shame in swallowing my pride.</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.020" end="00:44:01.720" style="s2">You&#39;re a proud, untouchable beauty. I</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.220" end="00:44:03.220" style="s2">know you disagree. That&#39;s fine. We all</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.720" end="00:44:05.520" style="s2">live our own way.</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.220" end="00:44:07.420" style="s2">Keep your pride. I&#39;ll take my knees.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.520" end="00:44:09.820" style="s2">When survival&#39;s at stake, no one&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.420" end="00:44:12.020" style="s2">better than anyone else.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.820" end="00:44:14.220" style="s2">As for these chicken bones with spit on</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.020" end="00:44:17.820" style="s2">them, whether you eat them or not,</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.220" end="00:44:17.820" style="s2">please keep this to yourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.720" end="00:44:28.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It smells amazing. It&#39;s so good.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.320" end="00:44:30.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about you,</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.020" end="00:44:33.520" style="s2">I&#39;m not eating that. I can&#39;t stomach</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.120" end="00:44:33.520" style="s2">some filthy man&#39;s spit.</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.720" end="00:44:38.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re back.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.020" end="00:44:41.520" style="s2">Did you get enough to eat? Did you bring</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.920" end="00:44:41.520" style="s2">any back?</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.220" end="00:44:47.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god,</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.920" end="00:44:50.220" style="s2">How did you get all this?</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.520" end="00:44:52.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is actual meat.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.220" end="00:44:54.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did make you kneel too?</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.420" end="00:44:54.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. He didn&#39;t make me kneel.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.520" end="00:44:56.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.621" end="00:44:59.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; how did you get it?</p>
<p begin="00:44:56.621" end="00:45:02.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He just had me rub his feet. He gave me</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.421" end="00:45:05.021" style="s2">all this food for a 10-minute foot rub.</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.121" end="00:45:07.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A foot rub? All this for 10 minutes? If</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.021" end="00:45:09.321" style="s2">I&#39;d known, I&#39;d have</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.021" end="00:45:12.821" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t Ye Feng ask me?</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.321" end="00:45:15.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see. All that food just for a foot</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.821" end="00:45:18.421" style="s2">rub? If that&#39;s true, it sounds like a</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.721" end="00:45:21.121" style="s2">good deal. Would I agree to that? I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.421" end="00:45:21.121" style="s2">never give in.</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.556" end="00:45:23.576" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.321" end="00:45:27.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now this is living.</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.321" end="00:45:30.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That should do it. We&#39;ve still got a</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.821" end="00:45:30.721" style="s2">task to complete.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.121" end="00:45:44.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eating this after that fruit it&#39;s like</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.821" end="00:45:44.021" style="s2">chewing cardboard.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.421" end="00:46:00.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve counted 28 sour wild fruits from</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.021" end="00:46:03.521" style="s2">this trip.</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.321" end="00:46:03.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You each get one shortly.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.021" end="00:46:09.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are we supposed to eat this?</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.521" end="00:46:11.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t had a full meal in two days.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.621" end="00:46:13.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve been scraping by on scraps every</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.521" end="00:46:18.921" style="s2">day, and now we have to eat this?</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.921" end="00:46:18.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t take it. I really can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.221" end="00:46:24.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m stuffed.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.121" end="00:46:24.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw Ye Feng fishing up loads of stuff</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.121" end="00:46:26.421" style="s2">again today.</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.921" end="00:46:28.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did he catch?</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.421" end="00:46:30.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No idea, but someone smelled meat</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.421" end="00:46:32.321" style="s2">cooking near his camp. Looks like he</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.221" end="00:46:33.021" style="s2">roasted a whole chicken and grilled some</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.321" end="00:46:35.421" style="s2">meat, too.</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.021" end="00:46:36.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s really all alone. How can one guy</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.421" end="00:46:39.021" style="s2">fish up so much?</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.721" end="00:46:40.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s no ordinary guy. Didn&#39;t you see him</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.021" end="00:46:42.721" style="s2">kill that snake this morning?</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.421" end="00:46:45.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That speed, that strength he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:42.721" end="00:46:46.221" style="s2">superhuman. I bet he&#39;s awakened a combat</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.321" end="00:46:48.521" style="s2">talent.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.221" end="00:46:50.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How come he gets to eat barbecue? We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.521" end="00:46:52.721" style="s2">the ones who deserve barbecue.</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.321" end="00:46:54.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not fair.</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.721" end="00:46:57.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we hadn&#39;t kicked Ye Feng out, he</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.921" end="00:46:59.523" style="s2">could have gotten meat for all of us.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.122" end="00:47:00.422" style="s2">What&#39;s the point of saying that now?</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.523" end="00:47:02.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.422" end="00:47:04.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who saw this coming? He can kill snakes,</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.723" end="00:47:07.523" style="s2">fish, and roast a whole chicken all by</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.922" end="00:47:09.823" style="s2">himself. Over 20 of us, and we can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.523" end="00:47:11.223" style="s2">even scrounge up one decent bite.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.823" end="00:47:13.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This again?</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.223" end="00:47:15.323" style="s2">Like you didn&#39;t help kick him out.</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.323" end="00:47:16.323" style="s2">And as for Ye Feng, have you forgotten</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.323" end="00:47:18.223" style="s2">what he&#39;s like?</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.323" end="00:47:19.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We begged him for food last night. Did</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.223" end="00:47:21.023" style="s2">he give us any?</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.023" end="00:47:22.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He refused because he was angry. I would</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.023" end="00:47:24.622" style="s2">have been angry too. Even if he wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.922" end="00:47:27.122" style="s2">share, he could kill snakes and protect</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.622" end="00:47:28.422" style="s2">us. Would we really be any worse off?</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.122" end="00:47:30.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of logic is that? He</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.422" end="00:47:32.323" style="s2">humiliated us, and you&#39;re defending him?</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.622" end="00:47:34.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just stating the facts.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.323" end="00:47:36.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure, he turned us away out of spite.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.922" end="00:47:38.523" style="s2">But should we be proud that we all</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.723" end="00:47:40.723" style="s2">ganged up and kicked him out?</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.523" end="00:47:42.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s doing better than all of us now.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.723" end="00:47:44.023" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t that say it all?</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.122" end="00:47:45.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of woman are you? How can you</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.023" end="00:47:48.422" style="s2">defend Ye Feng?</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.223" end="00:47:50.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know, can I even say I regret it?</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.422" end="00:47:51.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone, listen.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.323" end="00:47:53.523" style="s2">We&#39;ve gathered less than we&#39;d hoped</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.622" end="00:47:55.823" style="s2">these past two days, but this is only</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.523" end="00:47:57.523" style="s2">temporary. Luck comes and goes. Today&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.823" end="00:48:00.023" style="s2">bad luck means we&#39;ll hit the jackpot</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.523" end="00:48:01.622" style="s2">tomorrow. I know you&#39;re all starving.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.023" end="00:48:05.422" style="s2">Here&#39;s what we&#39;ll do. We&#39;ll hand out</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.622" end="00:48:06.323" style="s2">more food. Half a portion each.</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.422" end="00:48:08.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.323" end="00:48:10.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over 20 women working together. How can</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.622" end="00:48:11.823" style="s2">we lose to one man?</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.122" end="00:48:13.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let this setback scare you. We</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.823" end="00:48:16.223" style="s2">still have plenty of chances. Ye Feng</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.723" end="00:48:18.523" style="s2">just got lucky. Besides, he&#39;s only one</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.223" end="00:48:18.523" style="s2">man.</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.622" end="00:48:24.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t believe a word Liu Ruoyan says.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.023" end="00:48:26.323" style="s2">Tomorrow will be better.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.223" end="00:48:29.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More like every day will be worse than</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.323" end="00:48:31.723" style="s2">the last. Hunger, cold, and those daily</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.422" end="00:48:32.723" style="s2">chore tasks. I&#39;m still hungry from</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.723" end="00:48:34.323" style="s2">earlier.</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.723" end="00:48:34.723" style="s2">How many calories can chicken bones</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.323" end="00:48:37.422" style="s2">have?</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.723" end="00:48:40.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t wait any longer. I have to act.</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.422" end="00:48:40.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll do it now.</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.922" end="00:48:49.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this thing even for?</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.823" end="00:48:52.723" style="s2">Whatever it&#39;s for, I might as well save</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.023" end="00:48:52.723" style="s2">it. Time to get some rest.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.223" end="00:48:58.223" style="s2">I hear something. Is someone here trying</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.523" end="00:48:58.223" style="s2">to steal from me?</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.422" end="00:49:03.424" style="s2">What&#39;s she doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.293" end="00:49:04.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.424" end="00:49:06.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.924" end="00:49:07.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anfengjiao, why are you here in the</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.524" end="00:49:09.224" style="s2">middle of the night?</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.524" end="00:49:10.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe I wasn&#39;t clear last time.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.224" end="00:49:12.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s sweet deal you got today,</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.824" end="00:49:14.824" style="s2">kneeling for bones.</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.524" end="00:49:17.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a one-time offer.</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.824" end="00:49:18.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not here to beg for bones.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.124" end="00:49:19.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And why are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.669" end="00:49:21.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.724" end="00:49:23.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, Liu Ruyan and her little clique</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.924" end="00:49:26.224" style="s2">have completely shut me out. They keep</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.924" end="00:49:28.624" style="s2">picking on me, especially Shen Manqing.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.224" end="00:49:31.124" style="s2">She can&#39;t stand me. I can see it now. If</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.624" end="00:49:32.924" style="s2">I stay with them, I&#39;ll be eliminated. So</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.124" end="00:49:34.924" style="s2">I want to join you and stay by your</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.924" end="00:49:36.924" style="s2">side. I&#39;ll do whatever chores you need</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.924" end="00:49:38.724" style="s2">and follow your orders. Trust me, an</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.924" end="00:49:40.724" style="s2">extra pair of hands will make life</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.724" end="00:49:41.624" style="s2">easier. We can take turns on night</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.724" end="00:49:43.024" style="s2">watch.</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.624" end="00:49:44.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure, having help would make things</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.024" end="00:49:46.024" style="s2">easier if I could trust you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.424" end="00:49:47.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I trust you? You helped kick</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.024" end="00:49:48.724" style="s2">me out. Don&#39;t deny it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.524" end="00:49:50.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never objected when they kicked me</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.724" end="00:49:50.724" style="s2">out, did you? Now you want me to take</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.224" end="00:49:52.024" style="s2">you in?</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.724" end="00:49:53.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I really do want to join you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.024" end="00:49:54.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t buy it. Who knows what you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.424" end="00:49:56.024" style="s2">really after?</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.624" end="00:49:57.224" style="s2">You might grab all my supplies and run</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.024" end="00:49:58.324" style="s2">off one day</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.224" end="00:49:59.724" style="s2">or stab me in my sleep and take</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.324" end="00:50:01.124" style="s2">everything I have</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.724" end="00:50:01.724" style="s2">or celebrate if a wrong answer gets me</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.124" end="00:50:02.624" style="s2">eliminated.</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.724" end="00:50:04.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not like that.</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.624" end="00:50:06.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You seem exactly like that.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.224" end="00:50:07.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The first two never crossed my mind. The</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.024" end="00:50:09.324" style="s2">third one did. If she stayed with Ye</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.524" end="00:50:10.524" style="s2">Feng, she could inherit his stuff if he</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.324" end="00:50:11.724" style="s2">died.</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.524" end="00:50:14.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So leave.</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.724" end="00:50:16.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, I&#39;ll be honest with you. I like</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.124" end="00:50:18.424" style="s2">you. I want to show you I mean it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.024" end="00:50:19.724" style="s2">You&#39;re so full of life. It really makes</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.424" end="00:50:21.724" style="s2">my heart race.</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.724" end="00:50:23.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liar.</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.724" end="00:50:25.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me try another way.</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.224" end="00:50:27.224" style="s2">Let&#39;s take it slow. I want a full meal</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.524" end="00:50:28.524" style="s2">just like Zhou Nianxue. What would I</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.224" end="00:50:30.224" style="s2">need to offer?</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.524" end="00:50:31.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You you want the same deal as Zhou</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.224" end="00:50:32.524" style="s2">Nianxue?</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.224" end="00:50:33.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhou Nianxue was the only one who stood</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.524" end="00:50:33.924" style="s2">up for me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.224" end="00:50:35.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you?</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.924" end="00:50:36.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything Zhou Nianxue can do, I can do</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.824" end="00:50:38.924" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.824" end="00:50:39.524" style="s2">And whatever she can&#39;t do, I can do that</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.924" end="00:50:40.824" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.524" end="00:50:42.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.824" end="00:50:44.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How far are you willing to go?</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.524" end="00:50:46.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll do anything you ask.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.724" end="00:50:48.624" style="s2">Ever since you saved me today, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.524" end="00:50:50.524" style="s2">all I can think about. I know you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.624" end="00:50:53.124" style="s2">believe me. Come feel my heart for</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.524" end="00:50:54.324" style="s2">yourself. Feel how fast it&#39;s beating.</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.124" end="00:50:55.624" style="s2">See if it&#39;s lying.</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.324" end="00:50:57.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s bold, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.624" end="00:50:58.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you feel it? A heartbeat doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.124" end="00:51:00.424" style="s2">lie, right? Can you hear what my heart&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.724" end="00:51:01.624" style="s2">saying? Am I worth it?</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.424" end="00:51:02.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I definitely felt it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.624" end="00:51:03.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But is that heart</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.725" end="00:51:05.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; or scheming?</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.525" end="00:51:07.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I couldn&#39;t quite make it out.</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.125" end="00:51:08.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then, let&#39;s discuss a little billion</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.125" end="00:51:10.725" style="s2">dollar deal.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.425" end="00:51:11.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who knew a big star like her could be so</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.725" end="00:51:13.025" style="s2">wild?</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.725" end="00:51:15.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you staring at?</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.025" end="00:51:16.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are a naughty boy.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.025" end="00:51:17.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the naughty one.</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.125" end="00:51:18.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who made the first move in this little</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.325" end="00:51:19.925" style="s2">deal?</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.325" end="00:51:21.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know, you were huge when I was in</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.925" end="00:51:22.925" style="s2">high school. I grew up watching your</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.625" end="00:51:24.025" style="s2">shows.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.925" end="00:51:25.125" style="s2">Never thought we&#39;d end up working</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.025" end="00:51:27.925" style="s2">together like this.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.125" end="00:51:30.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m only 30. You make me sound ancient.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.925" end="00:51:32.225" style="s2">Honestly, that Ye Feng, still, if he</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.625" end="00:51:35.125" style="s2">didn&#39;t have a weakness for women, I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.225" end="00:51:38.825" style="s2">have no idea how to get through to him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.125" end="00:51:38.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yi Bo, you must be starving.</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.625" end="00:51:46.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is so good. I never knew food could</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.325" end="00:51:46.625" style="s2">make me this happy.</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.625" end="00:51:51.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You must have some fruit, too. I want</p>
<p begin="00:51:50.725" end="00:51:53.225" style="s2">grapes.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.525" end="00:51:55.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I barely have [snorts] any fruit. If you</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.225" end="00:51:58.025" style="s2">eat it all, what will I eat tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.025" end="00:51:59.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need food to keep my strength up.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.025" end="00:52:01.225" style="s2">Pretty please.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.325" end="00:52:02.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s so forward. I don&#39;t know how to</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.225" end="00:52:03.325" style="s2">handle her.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.125" end="00:52:08.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty please.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.325" end="00:52:08.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, all right, all right. You win.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.125" end="00:52:13.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s so warm in here.</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.725" end="00:52:14.325" style="s2">Ye Feng, let me stay here tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.725" end="00:52:15.125" style="s2">please.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.325" end="00:52:16.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I could</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.125" end="00:52:18.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.025" end="00:52:20.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s freezing outside. The wind blows</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.225" end="00:52:22.725" style="s2">right through our camp. We have no</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.125" end="00:52:23.425" style="s2">blankets. I can&#39;t sleep. Let me squeeze</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.725" end="00:52:24.225" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.425" end="00:52:25.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said no.</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.225" end="00:52:28.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I better stop pushing.</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.925" end="00:52:30.625" style="s2">Deep down, he still doesn&#39;t trust me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.525" end="00:52:32.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, I head back then.</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.625" end="00:52:33.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, can I take some supplies with</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.825" end="00:52:34.625" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.425" end="00:52:37.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please.</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.625" end="00:52:37.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like what?</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.725" end="00:52:43.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Food, fruit, anything.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.025" end="00:52:45.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got quite an appetite.</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.925" end="00:52:48.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.525" end="00:52:48.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Ye Feng.</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.825" end="00:52:59.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where should I hide it?</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.725" end="00:53:03.325" style="s2">Right here.</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.827" end="00:53:18.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m so full.</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.927" end="00:53:18.227" style="s2">It feels so good to have a full stomach.</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.627" end="00:53:30.327" style="s2">Were you just over at Ye Feng&#39;s? You</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.327" end="00:53:30.327" style="s2">gave up your chance. Stay out of it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.527" end="00:53:36.927" style="s2">She definitely went. She even did it.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.327" end="00:53:38.127" style="s2">Shameless. And Feng Jiao, did you bring</p>
<p begin="00:53:36.927" end="00:53:40.727" style="s2">back food?</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.127" end="00:53:42.527" style="s2">She clearly I said no.</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.727" end="00:53:44.602" style="s2">If you won&#39;t do it yourself, quit eyeing</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.527" end="00:53:46.622" style="s2">what I got.</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.602" end="00:53:46.622" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.727" end="00:53:51.227" style="s2">And Feng Jiao got fed.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.327" end="00:53:53.227" style="s2">She has no shame. I kept my dignity, but</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.227" end="00:53:54.827" style="s2">I&#39;m dizzy with hunger. How much bread is</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.227" end="00:53:56.927" style="s2">my dignity worth? Ye Feng&#39;s pretty</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.827" end="00:54:01.127" style="s2">handsome, and he&#39;s loaded. He&#39;s got hot</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.927" end="00:54:01.127" style="s2">pot, barbecue, a tent, a down comforter.</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.727" end="00:54:06.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I overdid the barbecue last night. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.827" end="00:54:07.327" style="s2">need some digestive tablets at this</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.227" end="00:54:09.327" style="s2">rate.</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.327" end="00:54:10.527" style="s2">Another day. Wonder what choice quest</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.327" end="00:54:11.927" style="s2">the system has in store.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.527" end="00:54:13.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; System announcement. The Sky Island now</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.927" end="00:54:14.627" style="s2">covers three square kilometers. Edible</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.527" end="00:54:16.027" style="s2">wild fruit yields have increased</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.627" end="00:54:17.627" style="s2">slightly. Effective today, fishing</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.027" end="00:54:19.427" style="s2">attempts will fail less often. Chests</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.627" end="00:54:21.227" style="s2">and food will be easier to catch. Chests</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.427" end="00:54:22.627" style="s2">will no longer contain beasts. The cabin</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.227" end="00:54:24.427" style="s2">system is now unlocked. Without the</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.627" end="00:54:25.627" style="s2">owner&#39;s permission, no one may enter.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.427" end="00:54:27.227" style="s2">Within the cabin&#39;s protected area,</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.627" end="00:54:28.727" style="s2">salmon recovers much faster. It also</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.227" end="00:54:29.127" style="s2">provides shelter from wind, rain, and</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.727" end="00:54:31.027" style="s2">cold.</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.127" end="00:54:32.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more beasts in white chests, cabins,</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.027" end="00:54:33.227" style="s2">and survival coins, too.</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.327" end="00:54:33.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But there was no mention of a choice</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.227" end="00:54:34.927" style="s2">quest.</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.727" end="00:54:36.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Survival coins can be obtained by</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.927" end="00:54:38.727" style="s2">killing beasts, fishing in pools or</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.627" end="00:54:40.627" style="s2">clouds, and opening chests. They also</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.727" end="00:54:42.427" style="s2">spawn randomly across the Sky Island. As</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.627" end="00:54:43.727" style="s2">a first update bonus, one survival coin</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.427" end="00:54:45.427" style="s2">is guaranteed to spawn on the island</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.727" end="00:54:47.027" style="s2">shortly. Its location will be marked on</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.427" end="00:54:48.627" style="s2">the newly unlocked map.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.027" end="00:54:50.527" style="s2">Today&#39;s daily choice quest begins at</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.627" end="00:54:52.227" style="s2">4:00 p.m. Be prepared.</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.527" end="00:54:54.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have to build a cabin, so survival</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.227" end="00:54:56.427" style="s2">coins are crucial. A guaranteed survival</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.427" end="00:54:57.827" style="s2">coin as a bonus plus a map.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.427" end="00:54:59.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like the survival system unlocks</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.827" end="00:55:00.927" style="s2">its features gradually.</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.227" end="00:55:03.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The system gave me the cabin blueprint</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.927" end="00:55:07.227" style="s2">for free, but I&#39;m short on both survival</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.027" end="00:55:07.227" style="s2">coins and wood. I need to act fast.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.627" end="00:55:13.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The islands of</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.828" end="00:55:15.628" style="s2">keeps changing and expanding too.</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.928" end="00:55:18.028" style="s2">There&#39;s the survival coin.</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.628" end="00:55:20.328" style="s2">Building a cabin takes 10 survival coins</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.028" end="00:55:21.928" style="s2">and 50 units of wood. I&#39;ve got a long</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.328" end="00:55:23.728" style="s2">way to go.</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.928" end="00:55:24.928" style="s2">I got one from killing that giant python</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.728" end="00:55:27.228" style="s2">yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.928" end="00:55:29.328" style="s2">I have to get this newly spawned coin.</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.228" end="00:55:32.828" style="s2">Liu Ruyan is closer to it. She&#39;s no</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.328" end="00:55:32.828" style="s2">fool. She&#39;ll go for it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.928" end="00:55:39.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our fishing odds went up. The island&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:55:37.128" end="00:55:41.528" style="s2">bigger again. There must be more fruit.</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.628" end="00:55:43.228" style="s2">Best of all, we can open chests without</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.528" end="00:55:44.928" style="s2">worrying about beasts. Once we build a</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.228" end="00:55:46.928" style="s2">cabin, we&#39;ll be completely safe and</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.928" end="00:55:49.928" style="s2">recover our energy faster. No more</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.928" end="00:55:52.428" style="s2">freezing. Well, we&#39;ve got some wood, but</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.928" end="00:55:55.328" style="s2">we need 10 survival coins. We don&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.428" end="00:55:56.828" style="s2">a single one, do we?</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.328" end="00:55:58.428" style="s2">Look at the map. The system marked where</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.828" end="00:55:59.628" style="s2">a survival coin will spawn. It&#39;s right</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.428" end="00:56:01.128" style="s2">nearby.</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.628" end="00:56:03.128" style="s2">We&#39;re close to the spawn point. That&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.128" end="00:56:05.028" style="s2">huge advantage. Getting that coin will</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.128" end="00:56:07.028" style="s2">be our first step.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.028" end="00:56:09.428" style="s2">Let&#39;s go. That survival coin has to be</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.028" end="00:56:09.428" style="s2">ours.</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.128" end="00:56:12.528" style="s2">Split up.</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.528" end="00:56:19.628" style="s2">Could this be it?</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.228" end="00:56:19.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Found it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:20.628" end="00:56:24.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liu Ruyan, give me that survival coin.</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.428" end="00:56:25.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why should I?</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.528" end="00:56:28.728" style="s2">Can you be reasonable?</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.928" end="00:56:31.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got it first. Finders keepers.</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.728" end="00:56:34.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a survival world. Getting here</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.028" end="00:56:37.728" style="s2">first means nothing. As for reason,</p>
<p begin="00:56:34.228" end="00:56:40.028" style="s2">whoever hits hardest makes the rules.</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.728" end="00:56:40.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.128" end="00:56:43.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come take it then.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.228" end="00:56:44.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that supposed to mean?</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.528" end="00:56:46.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Think I won&#39;t?</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.228" end="00:56:48.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think we were wrong to kick you out?</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.228" end="00:56:51.228" style="s2">If you take it by force, you&#39;ll prove I</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.228" end="00:56:52.728" style="s2">was right all along. You&#39;re just a thug,</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.228" end="00:56:54.528" style="s2">but leaving me the coin would prove</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.728" end="00:56:56.628" style="s2">you&#39;re a decent man.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.528" end="00:56:58.628" style="s2">I&#39;ll consider apologizing and giving you</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.628" end="00:57:01.228" style="s2">a chance to rejoin us. Here&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.628" end="00:57:04.228" style="s2">chance to prove yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.228" end="00:57:05.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I don&#39;t have to prove anything to you.</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.228" end="00:57:08.028" style="s2">Hand it over.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.728" end="00:57:10.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Bu, you actually took it?</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.028" end="00:57:10.929" style="s2">What kind of man are you?</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.828" end="00:57:14.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.929" end="00:57:16.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I a real man? Want to find out?</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.329" end="00:57:17.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you?</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.229" end="00:57:19.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare I?</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.529" end="00:57:22.529" style="s2">This is a survival game. No one&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.529" end="00:57:22.529" style="s2">to pamper you here.</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.229" end="00:57:29.829" style="s2">You brought this on yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.429" end="00:57:32.429" style="s2">You should have just handed over the</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.829" end="00:57:32.429" style="s2">coin.</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.329" end="00:57:43.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You fool. How could you shove her?</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.929" end="00:57:44.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do whatever I want.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.329" end="00:57:46.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He could unleash his power at any</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.929" end="00:57:48.829" style="s2">moment.</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.329" end="00:57:51.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His presence is as intimidating as any</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.829" end="00:57:53.129" style="s2">elite fighters. Maybe even more.</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.529" end="00:57:55.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re not going to fight, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.129" end="00:57:55.529" style="s2">leaving.</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.129" end="00:58:00.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you fight him?</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.729" end="00:58:03.229" style="s2">Just let him treat me like that?</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.729" end="00:58:04.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, but I&#39;m no match for him. I</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.229" end="00:58:06.629" style="s2">don&#39;t know how he did it, but Ye Feng&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.729" end="00:58:08.229" style="s2">explosive power, body control, and</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.629" end="00:58:10.029" style="s2">intimidating presence are beyond human</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.229" end="00:58:11.529" style="s2">limits. He feels more dangerous than any</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.029" end="00:58:13.229" style="s2">fighter I&#39;ve ever met.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.529" end="00:58:14.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How? Why?</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.229" end="00:58:17.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know either. Maybe it&#39;s his</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.729" end="00:58:17.029" style="s2">talent.</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.829" end="00:58:20.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s head back.</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.729" end="00:58:27.329" style="s2">Ru Yan, did you get it?</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.729" end="00:58:30.329" style="s2">The map marker&#39;s gone. Did you get it?</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.329" end="00:58:33.029" style="s2">Ru Yan, what&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.329" end="00:58:34.729" style="s2">I did get it.</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.029" end="00:58:36.029" style="s2">Ru Yan Feng stole it and shoved me to</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.729" end="00:58:37.329" style="s2">the ground.</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.029" end="00:58:38.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s outrageous.</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.329" end="00:58:40.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could he?</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.429" end="00:58:41.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now you see what he&#39;s like. I was right</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.429" end="00:58:43.629" style="s2">to kick him out.</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.729" end="00:58:46.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s just like every other man.</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.629" end="00:58:48.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Violent and vile to the core.</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.329" end="00:58:49.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He robbed me today. Tomorrow he could</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.529" end="00:58:52.029" style="s2">attack any of you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.729" end="00:58:54.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ru Yan&#39;s right. Ye Feng is a violent</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.029" end="00:58:54.829" style="s2">psycho. I even think if we get the</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.129" end="00:58:56.529" style="s2">chance</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.829" end="00:58:57.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He being him around would be dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.529" end="00:58:59.129" style="s2">We can&#39;t tolerate him.</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.729" end="00:59:00.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Ye Feng was still with us, that</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.129" end="00:59:01.929" style="s2">survival coin would belong to all of us.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.529" end="00:59:03.029" style="s2">If we hadn&#39;t kicked him out, there&#39;d be</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.929" end="00:59:05.229" style="s2">nothing to fight over.</p>
<p begin="00:59:03.029" end="00:59:06.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we just done as he said, why would he</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.229" end="00:59:08.029" style="s2">hit anyone?</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.029" end="00:59:11.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no point in this. We all agreed</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.029" end="00:59:13.331" style="s2">to kick him out. We can&#39;t undo it now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.129" end="00:59:14.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So now some of you regret it?</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.331" end="00:59:16.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me a break.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.731" end="00:59:17.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We did nothing wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.031" end="00:59:20.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t count on men.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.631" end="00:59:20.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop arguing.</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.331" end="00:59:26.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Girls, we only lost one survival coin. A</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.431" end="00:59:28.631" style="s2">cabin takes 10 coins and 50 units of</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.831" end="00:59:30.131" style="s2">wood. There are over 20 of us. The</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.631" end="00:59:32.331" style="s2">system raised our fishing odds again</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.131" end="00:59:34.531" style="s2">today and the maps refreshed.</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.331" end="00:59:36.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have to build our cabin before</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.531" end="00:59:38.931" style="s2">Then we&#39;ll prove that we women, even</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.331" end="00:59:40.531" style="s2">without he can still do just fine.</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.931" end="00:59:42.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The system says today&#39;s choice task</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.531" end="00:59:45.831" style="s2">starts at 4:00 p.m.</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.931" end="00:59:45.831" style="s2">Let&#39;s go fishing first.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.831" end="00:59:59.431" style="s2">Is some evil spirit out to get me?</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.331" end="01:00:06.731" style="s2">Disgrace.</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.031" end="01:00:11.431" style="s2">Why can&#39;t I fish up a chest? How am I</p>
<p begin="01:00:09.131" end="01:00:15.631" style="s2">supposed to keep everyone alive if this</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.431" end="01:00:15.631" style="s2">is all we ever catch? We&#39;re doomed.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.131" end="01:00:23.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two chests at once. Our luck really is</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.331" end="01:00:24.931" style="s2">better today. Didn&#39;t the system say</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.131" end="01:00:28.531" style="s2">chest odds are up and there&#39;s more food</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.931" end="01:00:30.531" style="s2">than yesterday? Come on, open them.</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.531" end="01:00:32.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 portions of bread, 10 bottles of</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.531" end="01:00:34.731" style="s2">water, and ration bars.</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.431" end="01:00:36.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO USELESS JUNK.</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.731" end="01:00:41.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WE FINALLY GET MORE to eat.</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.831" end="01:00:41.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. We won&#39;t have to go hungry.</p>
<p begin="01:00:41.531" end="01:00:45.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today everyone gets one and a half</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.331" end="01:00:46.831" style="s2">portions and a bottle of water. The rest</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.931" end="01:00:48.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One and a half.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.831" end="01:00:51.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But we have so much food today.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.931" end="01:00:53.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve been starving for days, barely</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.131" end="01:00:55.131" style="s2">surviving on scraps.</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.131" end="01:00:56.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; please, let us have a little more.</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.131" end="01:00:57.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, my stomach burns with hunger at</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.931" end="01:00:59.331" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.431" end="01:01:00.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At this rate, we won&#39;t even have the</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.331" end="01:01:02.531" style="s2">strength to walk.</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.731" end="01:01:03.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How will we gather fruit or collect</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.531" end="01:01:05.431" style="s2">firewood?</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.631" end="01:01:08.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m starving too.</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.431" end="01:01:08.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s never enough.</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.531" end="01:01:13.231" style="s2">They&#39;re turning on me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.031" end="01:01:15.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m saving food for your own good.</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.231" end="01:01:17.732" style="s2">Fine. Everyone gets two portions and a</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.332" end="01:01:19.232" style="s2">bottle of water.</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.732" end="01:01:20.532" style="s2">But that&#39;ll use up almost everything we</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.232" end="01:01:22.732" style="s2">got today.</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.532" end="01:01:23.632" style="s2">If we catch less tomorrow, be prepared</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.732" end="01:01:26.832" style="s2">to go hungry.</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.632" end="01:01:29.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yay! Thanks for for tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:01:26.832" end="01:01:32.532" style="s2">Let&#39;s eat first. Finally. Hurry, hand it</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.032" end="01:01:32.532" style="s2">out. I&#39;m faint with hunger.</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.032" end="01:01:39.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go find some fruit and firewood.</p>
<p begin="01:01:40.732" end="01:01:43.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Time to fish.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.932" end="01:01:49.232" style="s2">Not a bad start.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.332" end="01:01:51.432" style="s2">More water is always welcome. It keeps</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.232" end="01:01:53.732" style="s2">us alive. The more, the better. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.432" end="01:01:56.832" style="s2">need it later. Materials are good, too.</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.732" end="01:01:56.832" style="s2">They&#39;ll come in handy. Got one.</p>
<p begin="01:01:58.432" end="01:02:03.232" style="s2">I won&#39;t eat much bread with hot pot and</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.332" end="01:02:03.232" style="s2">barbecue on hand.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.332" end="01:02:09.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A green clam.</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.032" end="01:02:09.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A fine chest. Keep fishing.</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.932" end="01:02:15.932" style="s2">Today&#39;s haul is even bigger, especially</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.032" end="01:02:17.132" style="s2">these four chests. Better put them to</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.932" end="01:02:18.432" style="s2">good use.</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.132" end="01:02:20.632" style="s2">Ultimate Ascension.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.432" end="01:02:21.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ascension complete. You obtained a rare</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.632" end="01:02:23.332" style="s2">chest.</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.932" end="01:02:27.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A rare chest.</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.332" end="01:02:27.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once you&#39;re above five, keep upgrading.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.732" end="01:02:30.532" style="s2">Wonder what I&#39;ll get today. The common</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.732" end="01:02:32.532" style="s2">chest first.</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.532" end="01:02:34.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You obtained 10 chocolates.</p>
<p begin="01:02:32.532" end="01:02:37.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even white chests have chocolate?</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.732" end="01:02:37.132" style="s2">Nice.</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.032" end="01:02:41.032" style="s2">Now for a fine chest.</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.532" end="01:02:47.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You obtained a basic combat scroll.</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.232" end="01:02:49.332" style="s2">Combat basic combat scroll, fine</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.332" end="01:02:51.132" style="s2">quality. Grants basic combat skills,</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.332" end="01:02:54.132" style="s2">punch and kick damage plus 5%.</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.132" end="01:02:54.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This will help me fight better.</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.232" end="01:03:05.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This feels amazing.</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.332" end="01:03:07.132" style="s2">I feel like I could beat Bruce Lee. I</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.232" end="01:03:09.932" style="s2">could take on 10 guys.</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.132" end="01:03:11.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You obtained a KFC family bucket.</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.932" end="01:03:13.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KFC.</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.032" end="01:03:13.432" style="s2">This much.</p>
<p begin="01:03:13.832" end="01:03:17.432" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how it tastes.</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.232" end="01:03:19.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So good.</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.432" end="01:03:21.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Climate Stone blueprint. Use this and 30</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.733" end="01:03:24.133" style="s2">survival coins to craft the climate</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.533" end="01:03:25.433" style="s2">stone. Climate stone, a rare item, keeps</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.133" end="01:03:27.933" style="s2">indoor temperatures at a comfortable</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.433" end="01:03:30.333" style="s2">22.26° Celsius year round.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.933" end="01:03:32.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A rare climate stone blueprint. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.333" end="01:03:35.633" style="s2">just for comfort. I don&#39;t need it yet.</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.733" end="01:03:35.633" style="s2">I&#39;ll save it for later.</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.633" end="01:03:44.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wonder what today&#39;s choice quest will</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.933" end="01:03:46.433" style="s2">be. If it&#39;s dangerous, I&#39;m sitting it</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.733" end="01:03:48.533" style="s2">out. Something like day one would be</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.433" end="01:03:49.933" style="s2">nice. At least we&#39;d get some food.</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.533" end="01:03:51.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; System announcement. System</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.933" end="01:03:53.033" style="s2">announcement. Today&#39;s mandatory choice</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.333" end="01:03:54.933" style="s2">quest begins. You have 100 seconds to</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.033" end="01:03:56.733" style="s2">choose. A lost young man asked the sage</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.933" end="01:03:58.333" style="s2">how to succeed. The sage suddenly held</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.733" end="01:04:00.133" style="s2">him underwater, releasing him just</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.333" end="01:04:01.833" style="s2">before he suffocated. He said, when you</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.133" end="01:04:02.533" style="s2">crave success as much as air, you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.833" end="01:04:03.633" style="s2">succeed.</p>
<p begin="01:04:02.533" end="01:04:06.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would you do if you were held</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.633" end="01:04:09.333" style="s2">underwater? One, curse at the sage. [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.933" end="01:04:12.133" style="s2">you. Two, thank the sage. Gee, thanks.</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.333" end="01:04:14.633" style="s2">Three, hold the sage underwater. Glug,</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.133" end="01:04:17.033" style="s2">glug. Four, leave quietly and think for</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.633" end="01:04:17.033" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.339" end="01:04:19.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.733" end="01:04:22.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The choice quest is here. What&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.733" end="01:04:23.533" style="s2">on? Oh my god, it&#39;s mandatory today? Why</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.433" end="01:04:24.133" style="s2">can&#39;t we opt out?</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.533" end="01:04:26.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now what?</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.133" end="01:04:27.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our choice could get us eliminated. I</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.133" end="01:04:28.633" style="s2">don&#39;t want to go.</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.233" end="01:04:30.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe no one gets eliminated today.</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.633" end="01:04:31.933" style="s2">There are four options. Let&#39;s talk it</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.233" end="01:04:33.433" style="s2">over and see which seems safest. Two and</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.933" end="01:04:35.033" style="s2">four seem pretty strange. Thanking him</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.433" end="01:04:36.533" style="s2">might earn a reward for being positive.</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.033" end="01:04:38.333" style="s2">Leaving quietly seems safe, too.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.533" end="01:04:39.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be naive. Remember yesterday?</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.333" end="01:04:41.833" style="s2">Sensible choices are probably traps. The</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.733" end="01:04:43.533" style="s2">crazier, the safer. It&#39;s one or three.</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.833" end="01:04:44.733" style="s2">Stop arguing. Let Ruyan decide.</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.533" end="01:04:45.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to decide?</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.733" end="01:04:48.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How the hell would I know?</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.933" end="01:04:50.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wrong choice gets you eliminated.</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.133" end="01:04:51.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The safest choice could be a trap. But</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.033" end="01:04:52.133" style="s2">what if the system switches things up</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.433" end="01:04:53.133" style="s2">today?</p>
<p begin="01:04:52.133" end="01:04:54.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do I do?</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.133" end="01:04:56.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one&#39;s interesting. Judging by the</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.833" end="01:04:58.833" style="s2">last two days, the more sensible a</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.833" end="01:04:59.633" style="s2">choice seems, the more likely it&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.833" end="01:05:01.133" style="s2">trap.</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.633" end="01:05:02.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Curse out the sage.</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.133" end="01:05:05.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sounds risky.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.533" end="01:05:07.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank the sage. That seems safe enough.</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.033" end="01:05:09.933" style="s2">Hold the sage underwater. The most</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.133" end="01:05:10.833" style="s2">extreme choice. Leave in silence. Seems</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.933" end="01:05:12.733" style="s2">sensible.</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.833" end="01:05:14.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eye of Revelation, activate.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.733" end="01:05:16.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option one hint. If you curse out the</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.433" end="01:05:19.033" style="s2">sage, he will punish you with a debuff.</p>
<p begin="01:05:16.833" end="01:05:20.935" style="s2">Its severity varies by person. Severe</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.033" end="01:05:21.935" style="s2">cases may result in elimination.</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.935" end="01:05:24.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That one&#39;s out.</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.935" end="01:05:26.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option two hint. If you thank the sage,</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.535" end="01:05:28.335" style="s2">you will lose one random item you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.335" end="01:05:29.035" style="s2">carrying and receive another random</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.335" end="01:05:30.035" style="s2">item.</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.035" end="01:05:32.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So so.</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.035" end="01:05:33.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option three hint. If you hold the sage</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.135" end="01:05:36.535" style="s2">underwater, he will assess your</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.935" end="01:05:38.635" style="s2">strength. If your four core stats total</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.535" end="01:05:40.435" style="s2">25 or more, the sage will give you a</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.635" end="01:05:42.535" style="s2">fine quality stat artifact as an</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.435" end="01:05:44.735" style="s2">apology. If your total falls short, the</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.535" end="01:05:46.135" style="s2">penalty is a permanent loss of one point</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.735" end="01:05:48.235" style="s2">from each core stat.</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.135" end="01:05:50.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that&#39;s interesting. My total stats</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.235" end="01:05:51.735" style="s2">are well over 25. I can easily take this</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.735" end="01:05:53.435" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.735" end="01:05:55.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option four hint. If you leave in</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.435" end="01:05:57.635" style="s2">silence, you will be rendered mute for</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.735" end="01:06:00.035" style="s2">the rest of the day.</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.635" end="01:06:03.335" style="s2">Until midnight tonight. No additional</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.035" end="01:06:03.335" style="s2">rewards or penalties.</p>
<p begin="01:06:03.535" end="01:06:09.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see. Option one&#39;s a total trap. Option</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.235" end="01:06:10.535" style="s2">two&#39;s a random trade. Option four leaves</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.035" end="01:06:12.935" style="s2">me mute all day.</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.535" end="01:06:17.435" style="s2">Only option three depends on strength.</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.935" end="01:06:19.335" style="s2">The highest stakes. Two. In that case,</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.435" end="01:06:20.935" style="s2">I choose three. Push the sage</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.335" end="01:06:23.435" style="s2">underwater.</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.935" end="01:06:24.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t decide for everyone this time.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.435" end="01:06:26.535" style="s2">As you can see,</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.735" end="01:06:28.535" style="s2">there&#39;s no option to sit this one out.</p>
<p begin="01:06:26.535" end="01:06:30.835" style="s2">Every choice carries a risk.</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.535" end="01:06:33.435" style="s2">No one can choose for you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.835" end="01:06:35.535" style="s2">Make your own choice. I&#39;ll tell you mine</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.435" end="01:06:38.335" style="s2">to help you decide.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.535" end="01:06:39.935" style="s2">I&#39;ll go with option two.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.335" end="01:06:41.835" style="s2">Thank the sage.</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.935" end="01:06:44.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m with you. That seems like the safest</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.835" end="01:06:44.235" style="s2">bet.</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.535" end="01:06:52.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I choose four. Leave in silence.</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.435" end="01:06:54.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Screw it. No risk, no reward. I choose</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.835" end="01:06:55.735" style="s2">one. Curse out the sage.</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.835" end="01:06:58.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll pick one.</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.735" end="01:06:58.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too.</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.735" end="01:07:03.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave in silence.</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.735" end="01:07:03.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh? Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.535" end="01:07:10.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Push the sage underwater.</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.935" end="01:07:12.035" style="s2">The most unlikely option</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.135" end="01:07:14.335" style="s2">is often the right answer.</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.035" end="01:07:18.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t keep being such a coward. Screw</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.335" end="01:07:21.635" style="s2">it. No risk, no reward. I choose three.</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.135" end="01:07:23.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Man, you&#39;ve got guts.</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.635" end="01:07:24.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got my respect.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.935" end="01:07:27.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.036" end="01:07:29.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; survival game is for the brave.</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.136" end="01:07:29.936" style="s2">I can do this.</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.036" end="01:07:36.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Time&#39;s up. Choices locked in. Option</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.536" end="01:07:36.836" style="s2">two.</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.536" end="01:07:46.236" style="s2">Option four. Qin Shuang, Bai Li Chu and</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.536" end="01:07:48.736" style="s2">others.</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.236" end="01:07:50.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, Ye Feng picked three two. He got</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.736" end="01:07:52.336" style="s2">it right yesterday and he picked three</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.436" end="01:07:53.536" style="s2">today. So three really could be the</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.336" end="01:07:55.036" style="s2">right answer.</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.536" end="01:07:57.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? How does he always dare pick the</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.036" end="01:07:58.636" style="s2">craziest option? Damn it. I should have</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.036" end="01:08:00.736" style="s2">picked three two.</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.636" end="01:08:02.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng could still be wrong. He just</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.736" end="01:08:03.736" style="s2">got lucky once.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.036" end="01:08:06.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got this, Xiao Man.</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.736" end="01:08:10.536" style="s2">Xiao Man, you&#39;re so brave.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.536" end="01:08:10.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Time&#39;s up. Revealing results.</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.636" end="01:08:16.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You chose to thank the sage. Your random</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.536" end="01:08:18.936" style="s2">penalty is to lose one item on your</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.436" end="01:08:20.236" style="s2">person. Your random reward is to receive</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.936" end="01:08:22.936" style="s2">one random item.</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.236" end="01:08:22.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lose an item.</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.736" end="01:08:28.136" style="s2">What? My my underwear is gone.</p>
<p begin="01:08:29.236" end="01:08:34.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An apple. Apples are a rare source of</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.836" end="01:08:37.536" style="s2">food on this Sky Island. I lost my</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.436" end="01:08:41.236" style="s2">underwear but got an apple in return.</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.536" end="01:08:41.236" style="s2">Looks like I made the right choice.</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.736" end="01:08:46.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.136" end="01:08:47.836" style="s2">My stats. I lost four stat points.</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.536" end="01:08:49.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My strength.</p>
<p begin="01:08:47.836" end="01:08:50.536" style="s2">It&#39;s dropped.</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.036" end="01:08:51.936" style="s2">Why do I feel so weak?</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.536" end="01:08:53.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lost a stat points?</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.936" end="01:08:55.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She picked option three. Xiao Man, are</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.736" end="01:08:57.136" style="s2">you okay? I got penalized and lost four</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.436" end="01:08:59.136" style="s2">stat points. But that means Ye Feng</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.136" end="01:09:00.736" style="s2">chose wrong too. He lost stat points</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.136" end="01:09:03.036" style="s2">too. Then he&#39;ll be a lot weaker.</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.736" end="01:09:04.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; However strong he was, losing four</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.036" end="01:09:06.136" style="s2">points gives us an advantage.</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.936" end="01:09:07.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So Ye Feng&#39;s nothing special.</p>
<p begin="01:09:06.136" end="01:09:08.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We were right.</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.036" end="01:09:10.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was just guessing. That creep&#39;s going</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.936" end="01:09:14.736" style="s2">down hard sooner or later. Once he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.736" end="01:09:14.736" style="s2">eliminated, we&#39;ll take all his supplies.</p>
<p begin="01:09:15.236" end="01:09:18.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Qin Shuang, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.436" end="01:09:24.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just can&#39;t talk?</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.136" end="01:09:25.538" style="s2">Oh, what a relief.</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.636" end="01:09:27.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay. At</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.538" end="01:09:27.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; least you&#39;re not hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.237" end="01:09:28.838" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:09:27.938" end="01:09:31.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.838" end="01:09:33.137" style="s2">I picked option one and got a debuff.</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.237" end="01:09:36.838" style="s2">The debuff is</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.137" end="01:09:39.237" style="s2">it&#39;s it makes me feel aroused. It&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.838" end="01:09:41.538" style="s2">it&#39;ll wear off after a while. Hang in</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.237" end="01:09:44.137" style="s2">there. Stay put. At least it&#39;s nothing</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.538" end="01:09:44.137" style="s2">serious.</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.338" end="01:09:48.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on? What&#39;s wrong with them?</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.808" end="01:09:48.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.938" end="01:09:51.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.938" end="01:09:53.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What going on?</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.637" end="01:09:55.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was next to her and heard her mumble.</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.838" end="01:09:57.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her debuff is drowsiness. She&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:09:55.637" end="01:09:59.238" style="s2">probably sleep all day.</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.238" end="01:10:02.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And my debuff is a toothache.</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.238" end="01:10:03.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow! My teeth are killing me.</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.137" end="01:10:05.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is Wang Yan feeling it too?</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.637" end="01:10:06.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wang Yan? She&#39;s not breathing.</p>
<p begin="01:10:05.738" end="01:10:09.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.738" end="01:10:09.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wang Yan&#39;s been eliminated.</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.738" end="01:10:18.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You okay?</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.637" end="01:10:20.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right.</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.538" end="01:10:21.137" style="s2">Option one. You&#39;ll get a random debuff</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.637" end="01:10:22.038" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.137" end="01:10:22.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are you feeling?</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.038" end="01:10:25.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poison.</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.938" end="01:10:27.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I don&#39;t want to be eliminated. Someone</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.238" end="01:10:27.438" style="s2">help me!</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.538" end="01:10:30.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That poison&#39;s deadly.</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.238" end="01:10:32.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who knew the same choice could have such</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.938" end="01:10:36.338" style="s2">different outcomes?</p>
<p begin="01:10:32.538" end="01:10:36.338" style="s2">We only got ordinary debuffs.</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.938" end="01:10:40.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t even know what killed the one</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.238" end="01:10:42.938" style="s2">before him.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.438" end="01:10:45.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sai two more eliminated. I lost a pair</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.938" end="01:10:47.538" style="s2">of socks and got a bottle of water.</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.738" end="01:10:50.538" style="s2">I think I lost a single hair and got a</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.538" end="01:10:51.938" style="s2">sausage. I&#39;m so lucky. Girl, can I trade</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.538" end="01:10:54.637" style="s2">some water for a bite?</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.938" end="01:10:56.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I lost a hair clip and got some bread.</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.637" end="01:10:58.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good thing I picked option two. But if</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.637" end="01:11:01.038" style="s2">this keeps up,</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.538" end="01:11:02.938" style="s2">that woman&#39;s brave. But bravery doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.038" end="01:11:04.738" style="s2">guarantee a happy ending. Losing four</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.938" end="01:11:07.438" style="s2">stat points will only make survival</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.738" end="01:11:09.137" style="s2">harder. Everyone&#39;s barely surviving. Who</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.438" end="01:11:11.738" style="s2">can spare a thought for Wang Xiao Man?</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.137" end="01:11:13.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hear you want to dunk me in the water.</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.738" end="01:11:16.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.338" end="01:11:18.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You arrogant brat. This old man knows a</p>
<p begin="01:11:16.137" end="01:11:20.137" style="s2">few moves. You dare?</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.538" end="01:11:22.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In you go, old geezer.</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.137" end="01:11:24.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop. You passed.</p>
<p begin="01:11:22.338" end="01:11:25.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET ME GO. I&#39;LL GIVE YOU A GIFT TO MAKE</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.738" end="01:11:27.938" style="s2">AMENDS.</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.637" end="01:11:30.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mandatory daily choice quest complete.</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.938" end="01:11:31.839" style="s2">Reward obtained. Constitution fruit, a</p>
<p begin="01:11:30.339" end="01:11:33.839" style="s2">stat boosting artifact.</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.839" end="01:11:36.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An artifact? A fruit that directly</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.839" end="01:11:38.239" style="s2">boosts constitution. Four stat points?</p>
<p begin="01:11:36.539" end="01:11:40.339" style="s2">Pretty generous. I&#39;ve used up today&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:11:38.239" end="01:11:42.839" style="s2">sublimation uses. I&#39;ll eat it tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.339" end="01:11:45.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This choice quest is seriously twisted.</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.839" end="01:11:46.439" style="s2">Who knows what tomorrow will bring? This</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.339" end="01:11:47.539" style="s2">is brutal.</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.439" end="01:11:49.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.539" end="01:11:51.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re making me feel even colder.</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.539" end="01:11:53.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are we out of firewood again?</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.539" end="01:11:55.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is it even colder than last night?</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.339" end="01:11:56.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My hands and feet are numb. It&#39;s too</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.439" end="01:11:59.639" style="s2">cold to stay asleep.</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.839" end="01:12:00.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyone with a tent has it so good.</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.639" end="01:12:03.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So cold.</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.439" end="01:12:06.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll try again today. I&#39;m starving.</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.639" end="01:12:08.439" style="s2">I wonder what Ye Feng is eating.</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.339" end="01:12:10.339" style="s2">She&#39;s going to see Ye Feng.</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.439" end="01:12:13.439" style="s2">I want to go too.</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.339" end="01:12:15.139" style="s2">I can&#39;t take this anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:12:13.439" end="01:12:18.939" style="s2">This place</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.139" end="01:12:18.939" style="s2">How has it changed so much?</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.239" end="01:12:26.539" style="s2">So many supplies. That guy, Ye Feng.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.339" end="01:12:28.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How on earth did he pull this off? Did</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.539" end="01:12:30.539" style="s2">he get lucky somehow? Or is it his</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.439" end="01:12:32.939" style="s2">talent? Did he find some hidden treasure</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.539" end="01:12:32.939" style="s2">spot?</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.739" end="01:12:37.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There you are.</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.639" end="01:12:43.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god. We&#39;re freezing and starving</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.839" end="01:12:43.139" style="s2">and you&#39;re eating fried chicken?</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.339" end="01:12:47.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All I&#39;ve had today is a little bread.</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.939" end="01:12:49.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want? Fried chicken?</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.939" end="01:12:51.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This, those grilled wings, and some egg</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.839" end="01:12:53.539" style="s2">tarts. Oh, and a Coke.</p>
<p begin="01:12:51.739" end="01:12:55.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can have some, but everyone here</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.539" end="01:12:58.139" style="s2">earns their keep. You&#39;ll have to give me</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.339" end="01:12:58.139" style="s2">something in return.</p>
<p begin="01:12:59.939" end="01:13:02.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last time was nice. How about the same</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.939" end="01:13:04.239" style="s2">deal?</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.639" end="01:13:05.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure, but I want more.</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.239" end="01:13:07.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I could do that,</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.739" end="01:13:09.739" style="s2">but I want to eat that first.</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.939" end="01:13:10.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show me you mean it first. You really</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.739" end="01:13:12.939" style="s2">want that drumstick.</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.839" end="01:13:15.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me have a bite first. Just one. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.939" end="01:13:17.139" style="s2">been starving for ages. You&#39;d really</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.239" end="01:13:18.339" style="s2">make me work on an empty stomach?</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.139" end="01:13:20.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Won&#39;t you be a good girl?</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.339" end="01:13:22.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I want original recipe chicken. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.939" end="01:13:24.339" style="s2">starving to death.</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.239" end="01:13:26.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.339" end="01:13:28.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re full now. Time to get to work,</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.239" end="01:13:29.139" style="s2">right? I&#39;ve got another business venture</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.139" end="01:13:30.740" style="s2">I could use your help with.</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.139" end="01:13:32.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, will you let me stay?</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.740" end="01:13:35.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That depends on how you behave.</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.740" end="01:13:36.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No rush. We&#39;ve got plenty of time.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.540" end="01:13:38.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng chose wrong today, too. He</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.940" end="01:13:40.640" style="s2">should have lost four stat points, but</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.540" end="01:13:41.940" style="s2">he looks fine unlike Wang Xiao Man.</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.640" end="01:13:43.840" style="s2">What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.940" end="01:13:44.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did today&#39;s choice earn you a reward or</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.840" end="01:13:46.140" style="s2">a penalty?</p>
<p begin="01:13:44.740" end="01:13:48.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A reward, of course.</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.140" end="01:13:50.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But Wang Xiao Man lost four stat points.</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.540" end="01:13:51.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s none of your business. Oh, can I</p>
<p begin="01:13:50.440" end="01:13:53.540" style="s2">have some more fruit?</p>
<p begin="01:13:51.640" end="01:13:55.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So many questions.</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.540" end="01:13:56.440" style="s2">And now all these demands.</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.140" end="01:13:57.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got to let me take some extra</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.440" end="01:13:59.440" style="s2">when I leave.</p>
<p begin="01:13:57.540" end="01:14:01.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got so much. Surely you can spare</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.440" end="01:14:03.140" style="s2">a little more. Oh, you&#39;ve got chocolate,</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.540" end="01:14:04.340" style="s2">too. I want some.</p>
<p begin="01:14:03.140" end="01:14:06.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Feng Jiao.</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.340" end="01:14:08.340" style="s2">Do you think I&#39;m begging you?</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.640" end="01:14:10.840" style="s2">You need to know your place.</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.340" end="01:14:12.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are the one who came begging.</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.840" end="01:14:14.740" style="s2">You give me something of value. I give</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.740" end="01:14:17.840" style="s2">you food. It&#39;s a simple deal.</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.740" end="01:14:19.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you to make all these demands?</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.840" end="01:14:21.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Think that pretty face entitles you?</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.540" end="01:14:22.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who do you think you are?</p>
<p begin="01:14:21.140" end="01:14:24.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I didn&#39;t mean it like that.</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.840" end="01:14:26.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save it. That&#39;s exactly what you meant.</p>
<p begin="01:14:24.940" end="01:14:27.540" style="s2">You want to string me along and control</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.640" end="01:14:29.840" style="s2">me, right?</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.540" end="01:14:31.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You even want me to beg. You want to</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.840" end="01:14:32.940" style="s2">walk all over me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:31.540" end="01:14:34.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have me suck up to you?</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.940" end="01:14:35.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dream on.</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.440" end="01:14:37.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave.</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.540" end="01:14:38.340" style="s2">Don&#39;t come back. You&#39;re not welcome</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.640" end="01:14:40.940" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.340" end="01:14:42.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Ye Feng, I I didn&#39;t mean that. I</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.940" end="01:14:45.140" style="s2">just wanted you to treat me better.</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.440" end="01:14:47.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t trying to use you. I swear.</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.140" end="01:14:49.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too late. That&#39;s how you ask for help.</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.340" end="01:14:50.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m glad you came, but your attitude</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.040" end="01:14:51.440" style="s2">tonight disappointed me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.840" end="01:14:53.040" style="s2">Leave.</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.440" end="01:14:53.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was wrong. Give me another chance,</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.040" end="01:14:54.640" style="s2">please.</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.640" end="01:14:56.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.640" end="01:14:58.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He actually resisted me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.040" end="01:14:59.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just go. The longer you stay, the more</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.240" end="01:15:00.840" style="s2">you annoy me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.940" end="01:15:02.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng,</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.840" end="01:15:03.940" style="s2">do I still have a chance with you?</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.240" end="01:15:07.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Depends on how you behave.</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.940" end="01:15:07.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew it. He still can&#39;t let me go.</p>
<p begin="01:15:13.940" end="01:15:17.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t I tell you to leave? Why did you</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.740" end="01:15:20.240" style="s2">come back?</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.040" end="01:15:20.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feng, it&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.340" end="01:15:27.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.540" end="01:15:33.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feng,</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.640" end="01:15:34.042" style="s2">I&#39;ve come to join you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.740" end="01:15:34.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.042" end="01:15:36.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; like that.</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.942" end="01:15:40.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I won&#39;t string you along like An</p>
<p begin="01:15:36.842" end="01:15:41.642" style="s2">Feng Jiao. I&#39;ll do anything for you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.242" end="01:15:43.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you heard everything?</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.642" end="01:15:45.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Just let me stay here and work for</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.642" end="01:15:48.142" style="s2">you. All I ask is a little food. Even</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.842" end="01:15:49.942" style="s2">your leftovers will do.</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.142" end="01:15:51.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Interesting. Didn&#39;t you say you had too</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.942" end="01:15:53.942" style="s2">much dignity to take my food?</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.942" end="01:15:55.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My principles are flexible. These past</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.942" end="01:15:57.542" style="s2">two days have made it clear. Niu Ru</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.542" end="01:15:58.942" style="s2">Yan&#39;s team is going nowhere. Stay and</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.542" end="01:16:00.942" style="s2">I&#39;ll be eliminated. But you&#39;re so</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.942" end="01:16:03.142" style="s2">capable, Feng. You&#39;ve got it better than</p>
<p begin="01:16:00.942" end="01:16:05.542" style="s2">anyone here. You&#39;ve clearly got a bright</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.142" end="01:16:05.542" style="s2">future.</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.142" end="01:16:08.942" style="s2">Feng, I&#39;m serious. I want to join you</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.342" end="01:16:10.742" style="s2">for good.</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.942" end="01:16:12.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to promise me anything.</p>
<p begin="01:16:10.742" end="01:16:14.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, just take me in.</p>
<p begin="01:16:12.342" end="01:16:16.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call me boss. Boss.</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.542" end="01:16:17.242" style="s2">Actually, call me Feng. I like that</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.642" end="01:16:19.142" style="s2">better.</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.242" end="01:16:20.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. I&#39;ll call you whatever you like,</p>
<p begin="01:16:19.142" end="01:16:21.842" style="s2">Feng.</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.142" end="01:16:23.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hungry. Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.842" end="01:16:25.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got more bread today, but it still</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.742" end="01:16:27.242" style="s2">wasn&#39;t enough to fill me up.</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.242" end="01:16:28.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat up. We&#39;ll talk once you&#39;re full.</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.242" end="01:16:31.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So good.</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.842" end="01:16:35.242" style="s2">This is delicious.</p>
<p begin="01:16:31.542" end="01:16:35.242" style="s2">Feng, you&#39;re amazing.</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.542" end="01:16:38.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.242" end="01:16:40.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just so touched, Feng. You&#39;re so</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.342" end="01:16:42.042" style="s2">good to me, and I haven&#39;t given you</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.042" end="01:16:44.542" style="s2">anything yet. You even let me eat my</p>
<p begin="01:16:42.042" end="01:16:46.842" style="s2">fill for free today. No one but my dad</p>
<p begin="01:16:44.542" end="01:16:48.942" style="s2">has ever treated me this well.</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.842" end="01:16:52.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you make a deal for this?</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.942" end="01:16:55.442" style="s2">Trying to sweet talk me eat.</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.342" end="01:16:56.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hmm, Ye Feng, I&#39;m stuffed. Time for plan</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.442" end="01:16:57.742" style="s2">B.</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.342" end="01:16:59.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What plan B?</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.742" end="01:17:01.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t An Feng Jiao just get you all</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.142" end="01:17:02.842" style="s2">worked up? Let me help you blow off some</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.142" end="01:17:04.642" style="s2">steam. I just wanted to keep Ye Feng</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.842" end="01:17:06.442" style="s2">wrapped around my finger. I would have</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.642" end="01:17:08.242" style="s2">done it. What&#39;s wrong with taking things</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.442" end="01:17:09.242" style="s2">slow? Why did he have to snap and insult</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.242" end="01:17:10.842" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.242" end="01:17:12.642" style="s2">You&#39;re getting none of this. Let&#39;s see</p>
<p begin="01:17:10.842" end="01:17:14.342" style="s2">how long you last. I&#39;ll come back in a</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.642" end="01:17:15.642" style="s2">couple of days when you&#39;re desperate for</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.342" end="01:17:17.242" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.642" end="01:17:19.842" style="s2">Something&#39;s off about where Su Qing Chen</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.242" end="01:17:19.842" style="s2">is lying.</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.342" end="01:17:28.142" style="s2">There&#39;s nothing under these leaves. Su</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.042" end="01:17:29.742" style="s2">Qing Chen isn&#39;t here. Where did she go?</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.142" end="01:17:31.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She went to see Ye Feng.</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.742" end="01:17:33.242" style="s2">She went to see Ye Feng.</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.242" end="01:17:34.842" style="s2">She swooped in behind my back.</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.242" end="01:17:36.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Su Qing Chen went to see Ye Feng, and</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.842" end="01:17:37.443" style="s2">she still hasn&#39;t come back. He let her</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.643" end="01:17:38.643" style="s2">stay.</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.443" end="01:17:40.243" style="s2">What happened to his so-called</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.643" end="01:17:42.043" style="s2">standards? Didn&#39;t he say he had some</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.243" end="01:17:44.843" style="s2">self-respect? One negative mood effect</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.043" end="01:17:46.743" style="s2">today, and he acts like this? Shameless.</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.843" end="01:17:48.343" style="s2">If Su Qing Chen gets to stay, where does</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.743" end="01:17:50.243" style="s2">that leave me? I swallowed my pride</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.343" end="01:17:52.843" style="s2">first. I WAS THE FIRST TO TURN to Ye</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.243" end="01:17:56.043" style="s2">Feng. She acts so innocent, but she</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.843" end="01:17:56.043" style="s2">knows how to work an angle.</p>
<p begin="01:17:58.943" end="01:18:02.943" style="s2">Ye Feng, I&#39;ve got a present for you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.943" end="01:18:07.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did you get this?</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.943" end="01:18:09.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I fished it up on day two. I reeled in a</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.743" end="01:18:11.343" style="s2">little cloud. It faded without any</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.543" end="01:18:13.043" style="s2">notification, leaving just this coin on</p>
<p begin="01:18:11.343" end="01:18:14.443" style="s2">the ground. Everyone was busy, so I</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.043" end="01:18:15.743" style="s2">tucked it away.</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.443" end="01:18:17.943" style="s2">I only realized it mattered when the</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.743" end="01:18:19.643" style="s2">system announced survival coins. I was</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.943" end="01:18:21.843" style="s2">afraid to tell anyone. Liu Ru Yan would</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.643" end="01:18:23.643" style="s2">make me hand it over if she found out.</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.843" end="01:18:24.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Qing Chen, this means a lot to me.</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.643" end="01:18:26.843" style="s2">Building a cabin costs 10 survival</p>
<p begin="01:18:24.943" end="01:18:29.743" style="s2">coins, and I&#39;m still well short.</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.843" end="01:18:29.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just glad it helps you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.843" end="01:18:34.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you think anyone else is hiding</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.143" end="01:18:35.843" style="s2">survival coins?</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.143" end="01:18:37.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hard to say. We had a chance during the</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.843" end="01:18:39.943" style="s2">first two days. Everyone was doing their</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.643" end="01:18:41.643" style="s2">own thing. If anyone fished some up,</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.943" end="01:18:44.243" style="s2">they could easily have hidden them.</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.643" end="01:18:47.643" style="s2">After that, we barely had a chance. Liu</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.243" end="01:18:48.943" style="s2">Ru Yan&#39;s people watched us constantly.</p>
<p begin="01:18:47.643" end="01:18:50.943" style="s2">But the odds of fishing up survival</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.943" end="01:18:52.343" style="s2">coins must be pretty low. I haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.943" end="01:18:55.643" style="s2">caught any since.</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.343" end="01:18:55.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Su Qing Chen, come out here.</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.243" end="01:19:01.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shan Feng Jiao?</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.343" end="01:19:01.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I recognized her voice. Why is she back?</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.543" end="01:19:06.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Su Qing Chen, what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.543" end="01:19:07.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An Feng Jiao? You&#39;re here this late too,</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.943" end="01:19:09.443" style="s2">aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.543" end="01:19:11.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What exactly are you two talking about?</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.443" end="01:19:12.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re discussing something important.</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.043" end="01:19:14.243" style="s2">Unlike you, I don&#39;t leave things</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.543" end="01:19:15.843" style="s2">half-said and make people guess.</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.243" end="01:19:17.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Su Qing Chen, don&#39;t you have a mind of</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.843" end="01:19:18.143" style="s2">your own? Why are you sucking up to Ye</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.443" end="01:19:19.843" style="s2">Feng now?</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.143" end="01:19:21.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough, An Feng Jiao. What goes</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.843" end="01:19:23.243" style="s2">on between Qing Chen and me is none of</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.343" end="01:19:25.343" style="s2">your business. Why come here this late</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.243" end="01:19:28.843" style="s2">just to cause trouble?</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.343" end="01:19:30.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, it&#39;s cold out. Let&#39;s go inside.</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.843" end="01:19:31.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t I already tell you to leave? Go</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.743" end="01:19:34.043" style="s2">on, leave.</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.943" end="01:19:35.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, I know I was wrong. I&#39;ll do as</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.043" end="01:19:37.143" style="s2">you say and make it up to you. Please</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.843" end="01:19:38.743" style="s2">give me another chance.</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.143" end="01:19:39.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An Feng Jiao, are you saying this</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.743" end="01:19:41.144" style="s2">because you really want to</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.545" end="01:19:41.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; work with us? Or can you just not accept</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.144" end="01:19:43.144" style="s2">being left out?</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.844" end="01:19:45.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s none of your business. I was</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.144" end="01:19:46.344" style="s2">engaged. But my family arranged it. I</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.445" end="01:19:47.744" style="s2">barely knew him.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.344" end="01:19:49.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those rumors aren&#39;t true either.</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.744" end="01:19:50.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng can decide for himself what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.144" end="01:19:52.144" style="s2">true. No need to rush to defend</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.744" end="01:19:53.244" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.144" end="01:19:54.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop making things worse.</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.244" end="01:19:56.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll join you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.445" end="01:19:59.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more heirs, no more demands.</p>
<p begin="01:19:56.844" end="01:19:59.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please take me in.</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.744" end="01:20:04.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. I&#39;ll give you one more chance.</p>
<p begin="01:20:02.445" end="01:20:06.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then can I stay?</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.144" end="01:20:07.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t stay here yet. Go back to Liu</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.045" end="01:20:09.945" style="s2">Ruyue&#39;s camp and look for leads on</p>
<p begin="01:20:07.644" end="01:20:12.144" style="s2">survival coins. If anyone fishes up</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.945" end="01:20:13.844" style="s2">survival coins, tell me right away and</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.144" end="01:20:17.844" style="s2">keep an eye out. Are items with</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.844" end="01:20:17.844" style="s2">supernatural properties from chests too?</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.045" end="01:20:23.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll keep close tabs on things there.</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.344" end="01:20:25.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Survival coins are important to me. Find</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.945" end="01:20:27.144" style="s2">me a lead</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.144" end="01:20:30.744" style="s2">and you&#39;re officially in.</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.144" end="01:20:30.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay. I understand.</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.445" end="01:20:34.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you think of my plan? Does it</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.844" end="01:20:36.744" style="s2">upset you?</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.844" end="01:20:38.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course not, Ye Feng. I&#39;ll support</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.744" end="01:20:42.644" style="s2">whatever you have planned. As long as we</p>
<p begin="01:20:38.744" end="01:20:42.644" style="s2">all work well together, I&#39;m happy.</p>
<p begin="01:20:43.445" end="01:20:45.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She really knows how to handle Ye Feng</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.945" end="01:20:47.144" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.344" end="01:20:49.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Head back. Keep tabs on things there</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.144" end="01:20:49.644" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.545" end="01:20:57.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was here first. How did it come to</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.644" end="01:20:58.244" style="s2">this? There&#39;s nothing I can do now.</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.244" end="01:20:59.244" style="s2">I&#39;ll have to find a lead on survival</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.244" end="01:21:01.144" style="s2">coins fast.</p>
<p begin="01:20:59.244" end="01:21:03.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; System announcement. The Sky Island has</p>
<p begin="01:21:01.144" end="01:21:05.445" style="s2">expanded to 4 square kilometers. Day 4</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.445" end="01:21:07.545" style="s2">has begun. Your 7-day protection period</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.445" end="01:21:09.144" style="s2">is over halfway through. Survivors, use</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.545" end="01:21:09.844" style="s2">this time to build up your strength and</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.144" end="01:21:11.844" style="s2">prepare.</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.844" end="01:21:13.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Day 4 already. Time flies.</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.844" end="01:21:14.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Sky Island&#39;s grown another square</p>
<p begin="01:21:13.244" end="01:21:15.945" style="s2">kilometer. What happens once we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.445" end="01:21:17.344" style="s2">halfway through the protection period?</p>
<p begin="01:21:15.945" end="01:21:19.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The quest&#39;s been pushed back again. It</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.344" end="01:21:20.844" style="s2">starts at 8:00 p.m. It&#39;s hard enough</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.144" end="01:21:22.545" style="s2">already. People get eliminated every</p>
<p begin="01:21:20.844" end="01:21:23.744" style="s2">day. Who knows what&#39;s coming next?</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.545" end="01:21:25.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re short on food and the nights keep</p>
<p begin="01:21:23.744" end="01:21:27.545" style="s2">getting colder. Stay calm. We still have</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.445" end="01:21:31.144" style="s2">3 days. Keep fishing. Let&#39;s get enough</p>
<p begin="01:21:27.545" end="01:21:31.144" style="s2">survival coins to build a cabin soon.</p>
<p begin="01:21:33.244" end="01:21:37.844" style="s2">Someone&#39;s missing. Where&#39;s Su Qingxiao?</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.644" end="01:21:39.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who saw her last night?</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.844" end="01:21:40.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was here when I went to bed. Could</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.545" end="01:21:41.345" style="s2">she be in trouble?</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.545" end="01:21:43.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What danger is there</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.345" end="01:21:44.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; right now besides the choice quests?</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.146" end="01:21:46.345" style="s2">Could she have gone to Ye Feng? Did Su</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.845" end="01:21:47.946" style="s2">Qing Xue go to join him? Maybe she</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.345" end="01:21:49.745" style="s2">wanted somewhere safer. Ye Feng has</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.946" end="01:21:52.146" style="s2">supplies. At least she&#39;d be okay with</p>
<p begin="01:21:49.745" end="01:21:53.546" style="s2">him. We don&#39;t know what happened yet.</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.146" end="01:21:55.046" style="s2">Stop guessing.</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.546" end="01:21:57.745" style="s2">We still don&#39;t know where Su Qing Xue</p>
<p begin="01:21:55.046" end="01:21:59.345" style="s2">went. Even if she did go to Ye Feng,</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.745" end="01:22:01.146" style="s2">that&#39;s her choice.</p>
<p begin="01:21:59.345" end="01:22:03.745" style="s2">Let&#39;s focus on ourselves. Get ready to</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.146" end="01:22:03.745" style="s2">go fishing.</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.345" end="01:22:08.745" style="s2">She probably went to Ye Feng. I know</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.446" end="01:22:10.245" style="s2">what happened,</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.745" end="01:22:11.745" style="s2">but I can&#39;t tell them.</p>
<p begin="01:22:10.245" end="01:22:14.745" style="s2">Ye Feng said I could come to him for</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.745" end="01:22:16.946" style="s2">help. I turned him down. Now Su Qing Xue</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.745" end="01:22:18.546" style="s2">may have joined him. We&#39;re short on food</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.946" end="01:22:20.546" style="s2">and badly need shelter.</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.546" end="01:22:22.345" style="s2">Things aren&#39;t as simple as I thought.</p>
<p begin="01:22:20.546" end="01:22:24.652" style="s2">Let&#39;s aim for a good catch today. Keep</p>
<p begin="01:22:22.345" end="01:22:26.672" style="s2">fishing in groups.</p>
<p begin="01:22:24.652" end="01:22:26.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:22:28.146" end="01:22:32.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lu Yan, that&#39;s great. Now we&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.245" end="01:22:32.745" style="s2">food.</p>
<p begin="01:22:33.745" end="01:22:40.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ugh. The quests keep starting later.</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.245" end="01:22:42.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng ge ge, I want to sleep a little</p>
<p begin="01:22:40.745" end="01:22:43.845" style="s2">longer.</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.646" end="01:22:45.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="01:22:43.845" end="01:22:46.946" style="s2">Then why do you seem 10 times more</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.646" end="01:22:49.345" style="s2">energetic than me?</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.946" end="01:22:51.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, I love playing games.</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.345" end="01:22:53.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wa in wa wa le is wa with a hand</p>
<p begin="01:22:51.745" end="01:22:56.146" style="s2">radical on the left and wa on the right.</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.745" end="01:22:58.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Constitution fruit. Fine quality.</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.146" end="01:23:01.745" style="s2">Increases constitution by 4 points when</p>
<p begin="01:22:58.345" end="01:23:01.745" style="s2">consumed. Ultimate ascension.</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.845" end="01:23:06.446" style="s2">Prize defect.</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.446" end="01:23:08.546" style="s2">Pretty good.</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.446" end="01:23:10.146" style="s2">Stack fruits can&#39;t stack forever. Makes</p>
<p begin="01:23:08.546" end="01:23:12.745" style="s2">sense, but I should still be able to eat</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.146" end="01:23:14.946" style="s2">one unenhanced constitution fruit.</p>
<p begin="01:23:12.745" end="01:23:17.046" style="s2">Su Qing Xue, come on. Let&#39;s go fishing.</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.946" end="01:23:20.845" style="s2">Here we are.</p>
<p begin="01:23:17.046" end="01:23:20.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, you&#39;re amazing.</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.245" end="01:23:27.146" style="s2">Ye Feng, you got a fourth cast and a</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.046" end="01:23:29.646" style="s2">fifth.</p>
<p begin="01:23:27.146" end="01:23:31.946" style="s2">A second white chest. How many casts do</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.646" end="01:23:32.946" style="s2">you get?</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.946" end="01:23:35.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A survival coin.</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.946" end="01:23:38.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, you fished out a survival coin.</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.745" end="01:23:38.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a lucky catch.</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.646" end="01:23:44.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the third white chest.</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.546" end="01:23:46.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.547" end="01:23:48.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I seeing things? Ye Feng called two</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.347" end="01:23:51.047" style="s2">white chests in one cast.</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.747" end="01:23:53.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two chests.</p>
<p begin="01:23:51.047" end="01:23:54.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five chests. Ye Feng,</p>
<p begin="01:23:53.147" end="01:23:56.747" style="s2">how is this possible?</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.547" end="01:23:58.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For starters, these fishing pools vary</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.747" end="01:23:59.747" style="s2">in quality. This one&#39;s about as good as</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.447" end="01:24:02.047" style="s2">it gets.</p>
<p begin="01:23:59.747" end="01:24:05.247" style="s2">Each pool has different odds of yielding</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.047" end="01:24:06.947" style="s2">good loot. As for why I get 10 casts,</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.247" end="01:24:08.947" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell you later.</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.947" end="01:24:10.547" style="s2">With Su Qing Chen around me every day, I</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.947" end="01:24:12.947" style="s2">can&#39;t keep my chest upgrade secret</p>
<p begin="01:24:10.547" end="01:24:12.947" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.347" end="01:24:16.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This chest contains a huge supply of</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.347" end="01:24:18.047" style="s2">fruit.</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.447" end="01:24:21.447" style="s2">This chest contains something that</p>
<p begin="01:24:18.047" end="01:24:21.447" style="s2">boosts physical fitness.</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.447" end="01:24:26.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ultimate ascension.</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.647" end="01:24:27.747" style="s2">The bonus effect kicked in.</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.147" end="01:24:28.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, you can actually upgrade</p>
<p begin="01:24:27.747" end="01:24:30.547" style="s2">chests.</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.547" end="01:24:31.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep it down. This is a secret. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.547" end="01:24:33.647" style="s2">tell anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.347" end="01:24:35.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t tell a soul. Ye Feng, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.647" end="01:24:36.747" style="s2">incredible.</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.147" end="01:24:38.547" style="s2">Ye Feng actually trusts me with his</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.747" end="01:24:39.347" style="s2">secret.</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.547" end="01:24:41.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open it.</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.347" end="01:24:43.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtained one deluxe double mattress.</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.647" end="01:24:46.447" style="s2">Obtained 20 packs of survival biscuits</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.747" end="01:24:48.747" style="s2">and one bunny outfit.</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.447" end="01:24:51.947" style="s2">Ye Feng, this mattress is so comfy.</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.747" end="01:24:53.047" style="s2">Let&#39;s sleep on it tonight, okay?</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.947" end="01:24:55.147" style="s2">How does this look?</p>
<p begin="01:24:53.047" end="01:24:56.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice. It really suits you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:55.147" end="01:24:59.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtained one bottle of 100 stamina</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.947" end="01:25:01.047" style="s2">pills. Stamina pills, fine quality.</p>
<p begin="01:24:59.347" end="01:25:03.347" style="s2">Greatly boost combat power for a short</p>
<p begin="01:25:01.047" end="01:25:05.447" style="s2">time with no side effects. Each pill</p>
<p begin="01:25:03.347" end="01:25:07.947" style="s2">also grants a small permanent boost to</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.447" end="01:25:09.347" style="s2">your abilities. Ye Feng, what&#39;s that?</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.947" end="01:25:11.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing important.</p>
<p begin="01:25:09.347" end="01:25:14.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtained two crates each of assorted</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.047" end="01:25:19.047" style="s2">fruit. 20 10 kilo crates total.</p>
<p begin="01:25:14.947" end="01:25:19.047" style="s2">Ye Feng Ge Ge, are you a god?</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.747" end="01:25:22.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just got lucky.</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.347" end="01:25:25.347" style="s2">Your turn.</p>
<p begin="01:25:22.747" end="01:25:25.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.647" end="01:25:31.547" style="s2">How come you&#39;re so much luckier than me?</p>
<p begin="01:25:28.847" end="01:25:33.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. Some of that&#39;s still useful.</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.547" end="01:25:36.247" style="s2">Now we need to haul all this back.</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.547" end="01:25:38.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, look how tiny I am. If I carry</p>
<p begin="01:25:36.247" end="01:25:39.147" style="s2">too much, I&#39;ll have no energy left for</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.347" end="01:25:42.647" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:25:39.147" end="01:25:42.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, I&#39;ve got an idea.</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.747" end="01:25:46.749" style="s2">Are picking wild fruit nearby. I could</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.647" end="01:25:48.049" style="s2">get them to help carry this. Just give</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.749" end="01:25:50.549" style="s2">them a few bread rolls or something as</p>
<p begin="01:25:48.049" end="01:25:51.749" style="s2">payment. They&#39;ll jump at the chance.</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.549" end="01:25:52.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wouldn&#39; that be letting them off too</p>
<p begin="01:25:51.749" end="01:25:54.948" style="s2">easy?</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.849" end="01:25:56.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, try looking at it another way.</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.948" end="01:25:58.448" style="s2">This Sky Island Survival Game has only</p>
<p begin="01:25:56.649" end="01:26:00.049" style="s2">just begun. We&#39;re still under beginner</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.448" end="01:26:01.149" style="s2">protection. Who knows what will happen</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.049" end="01:26:02.349" style="s2">next?</p>
<p begin="01:26:01.149" end="01:26:04.549" style="s2">We might have to compete with other</p>
<p begin="01:26:02.349" end="01:26:06.349" style="s2">islands. Even if we don&#39;t, we still need</p>
<p begin="01:26:04.549" end="01:26:07.549" style="s2">to build up our own fate. That takes</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.349" end="01:26:09.448" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="01:26:07.549" end="01:26:11.749" style="s2">Everyone on this island is a valuable</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.448" end="01:26:14.448" style="s2">pair of hands. Wouldn&#39;t losing them all</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.749" end="01:26:14.448" style="s2">be a waste?</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.948" end="01:26:18.549" style="s2">Better people than</p>
<p begin="01:26:17.049" end="01:26:20.249" style="s2">The system said we need at least 10</p>
<p begin="01:26:18.549" end="01:26:22.149" style="s2">people on the island.</p>
<p begin="01:26:20.249" end="01:26:23.948" style="s2">These women wronged me, but most just</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.149" end="01:26:25.149" style="s2">went along with the crowd.</p>
<p begin="01:26:23.948" end="01:26:26.649" style="s2">I suppose</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.149" end="01:26:29.049" style="s2">I can put them to work.</p>
<p begin="01:26:26.649" end="01:26:31.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Besides, they&#39;re all gorgeous,</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.049" end="01:26:34.849" style="s2">especially Bai Li Chu. I&#39;d love to see</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.249" end="01:26:36.749" style="s2">her drop that celebrity attitude.</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.849" end="01:26:37.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got a point. All right, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.749" end="01:26:41.948" style="s2">leave it to you.</p>
<p begin="01:26:37.849" end="01:26:41.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave it to me, Ye Feng. You just relax.</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.049" end="01:26:49.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you really join Ye Feng?</p>
<p begin="01:26:47.349" end="01:26:51.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I&#39;m his girl now.</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.549" end="01:26:53.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sound awfully close. What&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.649" end="01:26:56.448" style="s2">game? Did you come here to rub it in?</p>
<p begin="01:26:53.749" end="01:26:57.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Do I look that shallow? I&#39;m here</p>
<p begin="01:26:56.448" end="01:26:59.749" style="s2">with a good offer for you.</p>
<p begin="01:26:57.948" end="01:27:01.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng holding so much while fishing</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.749" end="01:27:03.749" style="s2">today. He needs a few people to help</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.749" end="01:27:06.049" style="s2">move and sort it all. I thought of you</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.749" end="01:27:07.948" style="s2">first. So, are you in?</p>
<p begin="01:27:06.049" end="01:27:09.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For moving the supplies, you each get</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.948" end="01:27:11.749" style="s2">two packs of bread and a bottle of</p>
<p begin="01:27:09.649" end="01:27:13.749" style="s2">water. Easy work, paid on completion.</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.749" end="01:27:16.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two packs of bread and a bottle of</p>
<p begin="01:27:13.749" end="01:27:17.149" style="s2">water? Wow, that&#39;s more than we get in a</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.249" end="01:27:19.549" style="s2">whole day.</p>
<p begin="01:27:17.149" end="01:27:21.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no shame in working for food.</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.549" end="01:27:23.349" style="s2">I went out of my way to get you this</p>
<p begin="01:27:21.249" end="01:27:26.948" style="s2">chance. You won&#39;t find another job on</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.349" end="01:27:26.948" style="s2">this island that pays this well.</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.749" end="01:27:34.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="01:27:31.149" end="01:27:36.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All this How did he fish all this up?</p>
<p begin="01:27:34.149" end="01:27:38.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew Ye Feng had plenty of supplies,</p>
<p begin="01:27:36.249" end="01:27:40.948" style="s2">but this is beyond anything I imagined.</p>
<p begin="01:27:38.448" end="01:27:41.948" style="s2">He got all this in one fishing session?</p>
<p begin="01:27:40.948" end="01:27:44.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Insane.</p>
<p begin="01:27:41.948" end="01:27:46.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All this from just one day of fishing?</p>
<p begin="01:27:44.349" end="01:27:48.149" style="s2">That&#39;s insane.</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.649" end="01:27:49.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve You&#39;ve told the terms, right?</p>
<p begin="01:27:48.149" end="01:27:51.950" style="s2">Take everything to my camp and sort it</p>
<p begin="01:27:49.850" end="01:27:53.850" style="s2">onto the shelves. Once you&#39;re done, you</p>
<p begin="01:27:51.950" end="01:27:56.250" style="s2">each get two packs of bread and a bottle</p>
<p begin="01:27:53.850" end="01:27:56.250" style="s2">of water.</p>
<p begin="01:27:59.650" end="01:28:04.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not fair.</p>
<p begin="01:28:01.950" end="01:28:06.350" style="s2">No snooping around, and don&#39;t try</p>
<p begin="01:28:04.150" end="01:28:07.250" style="s2">anything. I&#39;ll be watching you the whole</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.350" end="01:28:08.550" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.250" end="01:28:12.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax.</p>
<p begin="01:28:08.550" end="01:28:12.350" style="s2">We have far more integrity than you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.950" end="01:28:17.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s your payment.</p>
<p begin="01:28:14.950" end="01:28:17.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So good.</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.350" end="01:28:23.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that</p>
<p begin="01:28:23.550" end="01:28:29.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yep. He fished it up yesterday. My Ye</p>
<p begin="01:28:26.350" end="01:28:31.550" style="s2">Feng is amazing.</p>
<p begin="01:28:29.450" end="01:28:33.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should be the one eating that if I</p>
<p begin="01:28:31.550" end="01:28:35.750" style="s2">hadn&#39;t been scheming last night.</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.850" end="01:28:38.550" style="s2">I&#39;d be sitting next to Ye Feng eating</p>
<p begin="01:28:35.750" end="01:28:38.550" style="s2">wings right now.</p>
<p begin="01:28:39.750" end="01:28:45.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng ge, your fried chicken looks so</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.250" end="01:28:47.550" style="s2">good. Can I have a tiny bite? Just a</p>
<p begin="01:28:45.050" end="01:28:49.750" style="s2">tiny one.</p>
<p begin="01:28:47.550" end="01:28:51.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want some?</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.750" end="01:28:53.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too bad.</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.350" end="01:28:54.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, I know you&#39;re upset with me. I</p>
<p begin="01:28:53.450" end="01:28:56.550" style="s2">was against it from the start, but I</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.850" end="01:28:59.550" style="s2">wanted to fit in. I felt I had to go</p>
<p begin="01:28:56.550" end="01:29:01.550" style="s2">along. I was wrong. Please, I&#39;ll do any</p>
<p begin="01:28:59.550" end="01:29:03.750" style="s2">job. How about a massage?</p>
<p begin="01:29:01.550" end="01:29:05.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m really good at it. My dad always</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.750" end="01:29:06.050" style="s2">loved my massages.</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.250" end="01:29:09.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:29:06.050" end="01:29:09.450" style="s2">Massage my shoulders then.</p>
<p begin="01:29:11.150" end="01:29:13.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now do my feet.</p>
<p begin="01:29:13.950" end="01:29:17.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re pretty good.</p>
<p begin="01:29:15.450" end="01:29:18.250" style="s2">Here, you&#39;ve earned this.</p>
<p begin="01:29:17.050" end="01:29:21.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng,</p>
<p begin="01:29:18.250" end="01:29:22.750" style="s2">so good. 100 times better than bread.</p>
<p begin="01:29:21.350" end="01:29:25.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Weren&#39;t we supposed to kneel and beg for</p>
<p begin="01:29:22.750" end="01:29:26.350" style="s2">scraps? She got a drumstick just for</p>
<p begin="01:29:25.050" end="01:29:28.950" style="s2">rubbing his feet.</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.350" end="01:29:30.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe if I did that too, I could</p>
<p begin="01:29:28.950" end="01:29:32.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m starving.</p>
<p begin="01:29:30.950" end="01:29:34.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Um, Ye Feng</p>
<p begin="01:29:32.150" end="01:29:36.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shameless.</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.650" end="01:29:39.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, want a shoulder massage?</p>
<p begin="01:29:36.950" end="01:29:41.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Moving all those supplies wore me out.</p>
<p begin="01:29:39.950" end="01:29:44.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you won&#39;t massage me, let me massage</p>
<p begin="01:29:41.850" end="01:29:44.450" style="s2">your hands.</p>
<p begin="01:29:44.550" end="01:29:47.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, can I come give you massages</p>
<p begin="01:29:46.650" end="01:29:48.850" style="s2">again?</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.650" end="01:29:52.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll see.</p>
<p begin="01:29:48.850" end="01:29:52.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a few things to say.</p>
<p begin="01:29:52.450" end="01:29:54.052" style="s2">You really know</p>
<p begin="01:29:53.151" end="01:29:56.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to work it.</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.052" end="01:29:58.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. I was just so hungry, and</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.651" end="01:30:00.951" style="s2">seeing all that food, even fried</p>
<p begin="01:29:58.552" end="01:30:03.451" style="s2">chicken, I just couldn&#39;t help myself.</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.951" end="01:30:04.851" style="s2">I&#39;m really sorry I upset you.</p>
<p begin="01:30:03.451" end="01:30:07.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t play innocent with me, little</p>
<p begin="01:30:04.851" end="01:30:09.052" style="s2">girl. It won&#39;t work. Forget it. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:30:07.552" end="01:30:11.151" style="s2">not what I wanted to discuss. What I</p>
<p begin="01:30:09.052" end="01:30:13.151" style="s2">mean is what happened here today stays</p>
<p begin="01:30:11.151" end="01:30:13.951" style="s2">between us. No one else can know.</p>
<p begin="01:30:13.151" end="01:30:15.751" style="s2">Understood?</p>
<p begin="01:30:13.951" end="01:30:16.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. I promise I won&#39;t tell</p>
<p begin="01:30:15.751" end="01:30:18.651" style="s2">anyone.</p>
<p begin="01:30:16.552" end="01:30:20.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, these are Ye Feng&#39;s leftover chicken</p>
<p begin="01:30:18.651" end="01:30:22.451" style="s2">bones. Anyone want them? Take them with</p>
<p begin="01:30:20.751" end="01:30:23.451" style="s2">you. They&#39;re free.</p>
<p begin="01:30:22.451" end="01:30:25.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:30:23.451" end="01:30:27.951" style="s2">I&#39;m Bai Li Chu, a superstar.</p>
<p begin="01:30:25.951" end="01:30:29.651" style="s2">I&#39;ll work for food, but I won&#39;t eat</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.951" end="01:30:31.151" style="s2">someone else&#39;s scraps.</p>
<p begin="01:30:29.651" end="01:30:34.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me neither.</p>
<p begin="01:30:31.151" end="01:30:34.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, what a shame.</p>
<p begin="01:30:34.651" end="01:30:37.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:30:35.552" end="01:30:40.151" style="s2">Awesome. Yay.</p>
<p begin="01:30:37.651" end="01:30:41.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:30:40.151" end="01:30:43.167" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come here.</p>
<p begin="01:30:41.147" end="01:30:43.167" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:30:43.251" end="01:30:47.151" style="s2">Someone saw you coming back from Ye</p>
<p begin="01:30:44.951" end="01:30:49.351" style="s2">Feng&#39;s camp this afternoon. Did you go</p>
<p begin="01:30:47.151" end="01:30:51.052" style="s2">see Ye Feng?</p>
<p begin="01:30:49.351" end="01:30:52.651" style="s2">She left without a word. We had to go</p>
<p begin="01:30:51.052" end="01:30:54.851" style="s2">find out why, didn&#39;t we?</p>
<p begin="01:30:52.651" end="01:30:56.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, we asked. Su Qing Qian has joined</p>
<p begin="01:30:54.851" end="01:30:59.052" style="s2">Ye Feng for good. We all suspected as</p>
<p begin="01:30:56.851" end="01:31:01.151" style="s2">much. We just went to confirm it.</p>
<p begin="01:30:59.052" end="01:31:02.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if we wanted to join him, Ye Feng</p>
<p begin="01:31:01.151" end="01:31:04.851" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t take us.</p>
<p begin="01:31:02.552" end="01:31:06.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who knows how Su Qing Qian managed</p>
<p begin="01:31:04.851" end="01:31:08.151" style="s2">to get Ye Feng to let her stay?</p>
<p begin="01:31:06.651" end="01:31:09.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We couldn&#39;t stop Su Qing Qian from</p>
<p begin="01:31:08.151" end="01:31:12.151" style="s2">leaving, but the rest of you had better</p>
<p begin="01:31:09.851" end="01:31:13.651" style="s2">think carefully. Here, we get to keep</p>
<p begin="01:31:12.151" end="01:31:16.052" style="s2">our dignity.</p>
<p begin="01:31:13.651" end="01:31:16.951" style="s2">If we join Ye Feng, we&#39;ll end up as his</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.052" end="01:31:18.251" style="s2">dogs.</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.951" end="01:31:19.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re just going through the worst of</p>
<p begin="01:31:18.251" end="01:31:20.251" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:31:19.151" end="01:31:21.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;ll be over soon.</p>
<p begin="01:31:20.251" end="01:31:22.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are we really giving up this close to</p>
<p begin="01:31:21.751" end="01:31:25.351" style="s2">the finish line?</p>
<p begin="01:31:22.751" end="01:31:28.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gu Yan&#39;s right. We&#39;ll get through this.</p>
<p begin="01:31:25.351" end="01:31:29.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can&#39;t sink as low as Su Qing Qian.</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.052" end="01:31:31.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pull yourself together.</p>
<p begin="01:31:29.651" end="01:31:33.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another death choice quest is starting.</p>
<p begin="01:31:31.552" end="01:31:35.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The mandatory daily choice quest has</p>
<p begin="01:31:33.151" end="01:31:37.552" style="s2">begun. Make your choice within 100</p>
<p begin="01:31:35.151" end="01:31:39.651" style="s2">seconds. Midnight, a bathroom in an old</p>
<p begin="01:31:37.552" end="01:31:40.851" style="s2">house, a mirror. You will stand alone</p>
<p begin="01:31:39.651" end="01:31:42.451" style="s2">before the mirror and perform a</p>
<p begin="01:31:40.851" end="01:31:43.951" style="s2">specified ritual. Something in the</p>
<p begin="01:31:42.451" end="01:31:45.052" style="s2">mirror seems to be watching you in</p>
<p begin="01:31:43.951" end="01:31:47.251" style="s2">silence.</p>
<p begin="01:31:45.052" end="01:31:48.751" style="s2">Now make your choice. Option one, at</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.251" end="01:31:50.851" style="s2">midnight, peel an apple before the</p>
<p begin="01:31:48.751" end="01:31:53.251" style="s2">mirror without breaking the peel. Option</p>
<p begin="01:31:50.851" end="01:31:55.852" style="s2">two, at midnight, comb your hair 100</p>
<p begin="01:31:53.251" end="01:31:57.552" style="s2">times before the mirror.</p>
<p begin="01:31:55.852" end="01:32:00.252" style="s2">Countdown begins.</p>
<p begin="01:31:57.552" end="01:32:01.852" style="s2">100, 99, 98.</p>
<p begin="01:32:00.252" end="01:32:03.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can opt out this time, but the</p>
<p begin="01:32:01.852" end="01:32:05.252" style="s2">penalty is severe.</p>
<p begin="01:32:03.153" end="01:32:07.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Peel an apple or comb your hair 100</p>
<p begin="01:32:05.252" end="01:32:08.952" style="s2">times in front of a mirror at midnight.</p>
<p begin="01:32:07.352" end="01:32:10.352" style="s2">Doesn&#39;t this sound like some ritual from</p>
<p begin="01:32:08.952" end="01:32:12.352" style="s2">a horror movie?</p>
<p begin="01:32:10.352" end="01:32:14.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve heard an urban legend about combing</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.352" end="01:32:17.352" style="s2">your hair in a mirror at midnight. They</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.852" end="01:32:18.552" style="s2">say after 100 strokes, another face</p>
<p begin="01:32:17.352" end="01:32:21.653" style="s2">appears in the mirror.</p>
<p begin="01:32:18.552" end="01:32:24.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop it! You&#39;re giving me goosebumps.</p>
<p begin="01:32:21.653" end="01:32:25.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both options sound deadly. One wrong</p>
<p begin="01:32:24.352" end="01:32:28.052" style="s2">move and you&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="01:32:25.952" end="01:32:29.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Opting out costs more than just stats.</p>
<p begin="01:32:28.052" end="01:32:32.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at the fine print. Repeatedly</p>
<p begin="01:32:29.952" end="01:32:34.252" style="s2">opting out may trigger a punishment.</p>
<p begin="01:32:32.752" end="01:32:35.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who can guarantee they&#39;ll peel an apple</p>
<p begin="01:32:34.252" end="01:32:37.452" style="s2">without breaking the peel?</p>
<p begin="01:32:35.653" end="01:32:38.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One nervous twitch, the peel breaks, and</p>
<p begin="01:32:37.452" end="01:32:40.952" style="s2">you&#39;re done for.</p>
<p begin="01:32:38.552" end="01:32:42.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Combing your hair 100 times seems pretty</p>
<p begin="01:32:40.952" end="01:32:44.752" style="s2">easy, though.</p>
<p begin="01:32:42.153" end="01:32:45.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy? The easier it looks, the deadlier</p>
<p begin="01:32:44.752" end="01:32:47.252" style="s2">it could be.</p>
<p begin="01:32:45.552" end="01:32:48.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not risking it. I&#39;m sitting this</p>
<p begin="01:32:47.252" end="01:32:50.452" style="s2">out. Staying here.</p>
<p begin="01:32:48.552" end="01:32:52.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m out. Wang Xiaoman lost four stat</p>
<p begin="01:32:50.452" end="01:32:55.552" style="s2">points. She seems fine.</p>
<p begin="01:32:52.752" end="01:32:57.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Peeling an apple, brushing your hair.</p>
<p begin="01:32:55.552" end="01:32:59.252" style="s2">These tasks are terrifying. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:32:57.352" end="01:33:01.653" style="s2">betting our lives. These choices are</p>
<p begin="01:32:59.252" end="01:33:03.752" style="s2">seriously creepy. Unlike fighting a wolf</p>
<p begin="01:33:01.653" end="01:33:05.653" style="s2">dog or answering a sage&#39;s questions.</p>
<p begin="01:33:03.752" end="01:33:06.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This feels like a full-on haunting.</p>
<p begin="01:33:05.653" end="01:33:08.052" style="s2">Choose wrong</p>
<p begin="01:33:06.653" end="01:33:08.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and you might never know what killed</p>
<p begin="01:33:08.052" end="01:33:10.352" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:33:08.852" end="01:33:11.552" style="s2">But losing a stat point</p>
<p begin="01:33:10.352" end="01:33:12.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I choose three.</p>
<p begin="01:33:11.552" end="01:33:14.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sitting this out.</p>
<p begin="01:33:12.653" end="01:33:15.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Ruan&#39;s sitting it out, so am I.</p>
<p begin="01:33:14.752" end="01:33:17.252" style="s2">Option three.</p>
<p begin="01:33:15.653" end="01:33:18.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I choose one.</p>
<p begin="01:33:17.252" end="01:33:20.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option one.</p>
<p begin="01:33:18.952" end="01:33:21.752" style="s2">I&#39;m doing it.</p>
<p begin="01:33:20.153" end="01:33:24.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re all scared because peeling an</p>
<p begin="01:33:21.752" end="01:33:25.552" style="s2">apple seems hard, but the harder choices</p>
<p begin="01:33:24.252" end="01:33:27.252" style="s2">are often safer.</p>
<p begin="01:33:25.552" end="01:33:28.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brushing your hair looks easiest, but it</p>
<p begin="01:33:27.252" end="01:33:29.952" style="s2">must be a death trap.</p>
<p begin="01:33:28.552" end="01:33:32.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you fail</p>
<p begin="01:33:29.952" end="01:33:33.653" style="s2">Wang Xiaoman, think this through. Can</p>
<p begin="01:33:32.052" end="01:33:35.653" style="s2">you handle it in your condition?</p>
<p begin="01:33:33.653" end="01:33:36.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That thing in the mirror is dangerous.</p>
<p begin="01:33:35.653" end="01:33:38.052" style="s2">Don&#39;t be stupid.</p>
<p begin="01:33:36.852" end="01:33:39.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save your breath.</p>
<p begin="01:33:38.052" end="01:33:40.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take my chances.</p>
<p begin="01:33:39.153" end="01:33:43.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Peeling apples or brushing your hair at</p>
<p begin="01:33:40.952" end="01:33:45.653" style="s2">midnight, facing a mirror? Creepy.</p>
<p begin="01:33:43.752" end="01:33:47.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we should all sit this out. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:33:45.653" end="01:33:48.752" style="s2">too dangerous.</p>
<p begin="01:33:47.552" end="01:33:51.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t give up.</p>
<p begin="01:33:48.752" end="01:33:52.752" style="s2">Let me. Eye of Revelation, activate.</p>
<p begin="01:33:51.252" end="01:33:54.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option one. You&#39;re safe as long as the</p>
<p begin="01:33:52.752" end="01:33:55.952" style="s2">apple peel doesn&#39;t break,</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.352" end="01:33:57.554" style="s2">but it&#39;s dim, and ghostly images and</p>
<p begin="01:33:55.952" end="01:33:59.154" style="s2">sounds from the mirror will distract</p>
<p begin="01:33:57.554" end="01:34:00.454" style="s2">Still, both the sights and sounds are</p>
<p begin="01:33:59.154" end="01:34:02.154" style="s2">purely physical. There&#39;s no psychic</p>
<p begin="01:34:00.454" end="01:34:03.954" style="s2">attack. Stay brave and focused, and you</p>
<p begin="01:34:02.154" end="01:34:05.754" style="s2">can do it. Peel it perfectly to gain one</p>
<p begin="01:34:03.954" end="01:34:08.554" style="s2">point in all four stats.</p>
<p begin="01:34:05.754" end="01:34:10.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Peel an apple. This will be easy for me.</p>
<p begin="01:34:08.554" end="01:34:11.754" style="s2">The ghosts in the mirror only use sights</p>
<p begin="01:34:10.054" end="01:34:14.254" style="s2">and sounds to scare you. No mental</p>
<p begin="01:34:11.754" end="01:34:15.654" style="s2">attacks. This one&#39;s easy.</p>
<p begin="01:34:14.254" end="01:34:16.654" style="s2">How good are you at peeling apples?</p>
<p begin="01:34:15.654" end="01:34:18.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Peeling apples?</p>
<p begin="01:34:16.654" end="01:34:19.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m really good at it,</p>
<p begin="01:34:18.354" end="01:34:22.254" style="s2">I used to peel them for my mom all the</p>
<p begin="01:34:19.854" end="01:34:23.954" style="s2">time. I get one long, thin strip that</p>
<p begin="01:34:22.254" end="01:34:25.654" style="s2">never breaks. I can peel the whole thing</p>
<p begin="01:34:23.954" end="01:34:29.954" style="s2">in one piece with my eyes closed.</p>
<p begin="01:34:25.654" end="01:34:29.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Times up. Those who chose option one are</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.254" end="01:34:34.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh? Ye Feng chose to peel an apple?</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.754" end="01:34:35.754" style="s2">Su Qing Qian even followed his lead.</p>
<p begin="01:34:34.354" end="01:34:37.654" style="s2">Does she have a death wish?</p>
<p begin="01:34:35.754" end="01:34:38.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s scared of dying, too. She just</p>
<p begin="01:34:37.654" end="01:34:40.354" style="s2">trusts Ye Feng.</p>
<p begin="01:34:38.554" end="01:34:40.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng picks option one. So did Su Qing</p>
<p begin="01:34:40.354" end="01:34:42.554" style="s2">Qian.</p>
<p begin="01:34:40.754" end="01:34:44.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I definitely chose right. I knew</p>
<p begin="01:34:42.554" end="01:34:46.554" style="s2">brushing our hair was a trap. I can peel</p>
<p begin="01:34:44.654" end="01:34:49.354" style="s2">an apple. This is my chance to turn</p>
<p begin="01:34:46.554" end="01:34:49.354" style="s2">things around.</p>
<p begin="01:34:49.554" end="01:34:52.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, there they are.</p>
<p begin="01:34:51.454" end="01:34:54.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How will this turn out?</p>
<p begin="01:34:52.654" end="01:34:57.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The game is about to begin. A friendly</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.654" end="01:34:58.754" style="s2">reminder, keep the peel thin. We</p>
<p begin="01:34:57.154" end="01:34:59.954" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t want any waste.</p>
<p begin="01:34:58.754" end="01:35:02.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s starting.</p>
<p begin="01:34:59.954" end="01:35:05.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s really started. This is so creepy.</p>
<p begin="01:35:02.554" end="01:35:06.754" style="s2">I&#39;ve got goosebumps.</p>
<p begin="01:35:05.254" end="01:35:08.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something creepy is bound to happen.</p>
<p begin="01:35:06.754" end="01:35:09.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, in the mirror.</p>
<p begin="01:35:08.454" end="01:35:10.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="01:35:09.354" end="01:35:11.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is that thing?</p>
<p begin="01:35:10.554" end="01:35:13.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a ghost.</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.754" end="01:35:15.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My legs are shaking.</p>
<p begin="01:35:13.254" end="01:35:17.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He he&#39;s peeling it with his eyes closed.</p>
<p begin="01:35:15.754" end="01:35:19.754" style="s2">He&#39;s plugged his ears, too.</p>
<p begin="01:35:17.554" end="01:35:22.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s genius. Now the ghosts can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:35:19.754" end="01:35:25.954" style="s2">scare him. His hands are so steady. Can</p>
<p begin="01:35:22.654" end="01:35:27.254" style="s2">he actually pull this off?</p>
<p begin="01:35:25.954" end="01:35:28.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a few tricks with sights and</p>
<p begin="01:35:27.254" end="01:35:30.254" style="s2">sounds.</p>
<p begin="01:35:28.454" end="01:35:30.854" style="s2">Trying to scare me? You&#39;ll have to do</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.254" end="01:35:32.654" style="s2">better.</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.854" end="01:35:33.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng&#39;s so calm. He&#39;s facing that</p>
<p begin="01:35:32.654" end="01:35:35.954" style="s2">thing and still smiling.</p>
<p begin="01:35:33.954" end="01:35:39.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does this guy have nerves of steel?</p>
<p begin="01:35:35.954" end="01:35:42.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s amazing. He&#39;ll definitely make it.</p>
<p begin="01:35:39.454" end="01:35:43.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, stop shaking. I can do this. I know</p>
<p begin="01:35:42.354" end="01:35:44.954" style="s2">I can.</p>
<p begin="01:35:43.054" end="01:35:47.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s about to lose it, isn&#39;t he? His</p>
<p begin="01:35:44.954" end="01:35:49.154" style="s2">hands are shaking so badly. The peel&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:35:47.354" end="01:35:50.554" style="s2">nearly snapped several times.</p>
<p begin="01:35:49.154" end="01:35:54.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s not going to die, is he?</p>
<p begin="01:35:50.554" end="01:35:54.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop it. You&#39;re scaring me.</p>
<p begin="01:35:57.154" end="01:36:00.055" style="s2">No,</p>
<p begin="01:35:58.254" end="01:36:02.101" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to die.</p>
<p begin="01:36:00.055" end="01:36:04.555" style="s2">Let go of me. NO.</p>
<p begin="01:36:02.101" end="01:36:04.555" style="s2">[screaming] HELP.</p>
<p begin="01:36:07.555" end="01:36:11.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WANG XIAOMAN GOT DRAGGED INTO THE</p>
<p begin="01:36:09.055" end="01:36:13.656" style="s2">MIRROR. LOOK, THE player counts down by</p>
<p begin="01:36:11.156" end="01:36:16.756" style="s2">one. Wang Xiaoman really is out.</p>
<p begin="01:36:13.656" end="01:36:18.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One slip and you&#39;re dead. Wang Xiaoman</p>
<p begin="01:36:16.756" end="01:36:21.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re gambling with your life on these</p>
<p begin="01:36:18.356" end="01:36:22.756" style="s2">choices. If I&#39;d picked that option too.</p>
<p begin="01:36:21.156" end="01:36:26.756" style="s2">The mirror ghost really dragged her</p>
<p begin="01:36:22.756" end="01:36:26.756" style="s2">away. What about Ye Feng and Su Qinghan?</p>
<p begin="01:36:28.555" end="01:36:30.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect.</p>
<p begin="01:36:37.055" end="01:36:40.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I seeing things?</p>
<p begin="01:36:38.555" end="01:36:41.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng and Su Qinghan did it.</p>
<p begin="01:36:40.055" end="01:36:43.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That golden light teleported them away.</p>
<p begin="01:36:41.955" end="01:36:45.356" style="s2">They really passed.</p>
<p begin="01:36:43.356" end="01:36:46.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The rewards for a task like that must be</p>
<p begin="01:36:45.356" end="01:36:47.856" style="s2">huge.</p>
<p begin="01:36:46.156" end="01:36:49.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should have picked option one. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:36:47.856" end="01:36:51.156" style="s2">pretty good at peeling apples.</p>
<p begin="01:36:49.356" end="01:36:52.756" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, please. You dropped your knife at</p>
<p begin="01:36:51.156" end="01:36:55.356" style="s2">the first glimpse of a ghost.</p>
<p begin="01:36:52.756" end="01:36:57.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, I was just saying. Survive that and</p>
<p begin="01:36:55.356" end="01:36:58.955" style="s2">the rewards must be amazing.</p>
<p begin="01:36:57.356" end="01:37:01.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Su Qinghan got rewarded by sticking with</p>
<p begin="01:36:58.955" end="01:37:02.856" style="s2">Ye Feng. That should have been me.</p>
<p begin="01:37:01.055" end="01:37:03.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I&#39;d stayed with Ye Feng, she wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:37:02.856" end="01:37:05.756" style="s2">have stood a chance.</p>
<p begin="01:37:03.856" end="01:37:07.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Penalty applies a one-point loss to one</p>
<p begin="01:37:05.756" end="01:37:08.555" style="s2">of your four stats. Random selection in</p>
<p begin="01:37:07.656" end="01:37:09.356" style="s2">three seconds.</p>
<p begin="01:37:08.555" end="01:37:11.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here goes.</p>
<p begin="01:37:09.356" end="01:37:15.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re losing stats and I&#39;m already weak.</p>
<p begin="01:37:11.955" end="01:37:15.156" style="s2">Now I&#39;ll be even weaker.</p>
<p begin="01:37:15.955" end="01:37:20.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lost one point of spirit.</p>
<p begin="01:37:17.656" end="01:37:22.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Agility down one. I can live with that.</p>
<p begin="01:37:20.356" end="01:37:26.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I lost one point of strength.</p>
<p begin="01:37:22.856" end="01:37:26.455" style="s2">I feel so weak.</p>
<p begin="01:37:29.756" end="01:37:33.656" style="s2">I&#39;m back. I did it. Ye Feng, I really</p>
<p begin="01:37:32.856" end="01:37:35.856" style="s2">did it.</p>
<p begin="01:37:33.656" end="01:37:38.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mandatory daily choice quest complete.</p>
<p begin="01:37:35.856" end="01:37:40.356" style="s2">All four stats increased by one.</p>
<p begin="01:37:38.656" end="01:37:41.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m a little stronger again. I can</p>
<p begin="01:37:40.356" end="01:37:44.555" style="s2">really feel every increase.</p>
<p begin="01:37:41.955" end="01:37:45.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m so much stronger. My whole body</p>
<p begin="01:37:44.555" end="01:37:48.055" style="s2">feels stronger.</p>
<p begin="01:37:45.555" end="01:37:49.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And my mind is so much clearer. Stat</p>
<p begin="01:37:48.055" end="01:37:51.555" style="s2">points are amazing.</p>
<p begin="01:37:49.356" end="01:37:52.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Ye Feng. I&#39;d never have dared</p>
<p begin="01:37:51.555" end="01:37:55.256" style="s2">to choose that without you.</p>
<p begin="01:37:52.955" end="01:37:55.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. You&#39;ve got your reward. Let</p>
<p begin="01:37:55.256" end="01:37:58.555" style="s2">go of me.</p>
<p begin="01:37:55.955" end="01:37:59.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I want to test out my new stats.</p>
<p begin="01:37:58.555" end="01:38:01.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s try them out.</p>
<p begin="01:37:59.656" end="01:38:02.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. Let&#39;s give it a go.</p>
<p begin="01:38:01.955" end="01:38:03.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:38:02.757" end="01:38:05.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; something&#39;s happening to me.</p>
<p begin="01:38:03.957" end="01:38:07.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All four stats exceed 50.</p>
<p begin="01:38:05.857" end="01:38:09.056" style="s2">Congratulations. You&#39;ve become a tier</p>
<p begin="01:38:07.857" end="01:38:11.656" style="s2">one transcendent.</p>
<p begin="01:38:09.056" end="01:38:13.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A tier one transcendent. So higher stats</p>
<p begin="01:38:11.656" end="01:38:15.156" style="s2">mean a higher level of existence. My</p>
<p begin="01:38:13.556" end="01:38:16.857" style="s2">very being has evolved.</p>
<p begin="01:38:15.156" end="01:38:18.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve truly transcended mortality.</p>
<p begin="01:38:16.857" end="01:38:20.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Regional announcement. Ye Feng has</p>
<p begin="01:38:18.656" end="01:38:23.056" style="s2">become a tier one transcendent. As the</p>
<p begin="01:38:20.757" end="01:38:25.357" style="s2">first to achieve this, he receives five</p>
<p begin="01:38:23.056" end="01:38:28.556" style="s2">bonus stat points to allocate freely.</p>
<p begin="01:38:25.357" end="01:38:30.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? A tier one transcendent? The raid</p>
<p begin="01:38:28.556" end="01:38:32.556" style="s2">is first achievement. Wasn&#39;t he an</p>
<p begin="01:38:30.357" end="01:38:33.857" style="s2">ordinary person just like us? How did he</p>
<p begin="01:38:32.556" end="01:38:35.957" style="s2">become a transcendent?</p>
<p begin="01:38:33.857" end="01:38:38.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And he gets five bonus stat points.</p>
<p begin="01:38:35.957" end="01:38:40.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why him? What makes Ye Feng worthy?</p>
<p begin="01:38:38.357" end="01:38:42.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He doesn&#39;t deserve it because we were</p>
<p begin="01:38:40.457" end="01:38:43.757" style="s2">too scared to take part, but Ye Feng</p>
<p begin="01:38:42.757" end="01:38:46.056" style="s2">did.</p>
<p begin="01:38:43.757" end="01:38:47.556" style="s2">He completed it and got stronger. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:38:46.056" end="01:38:49.857" style="s2">left us far behind.</p>
<p begin="01:38:47.556" end="01:38:50.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure, we lack the guts. But what about</p>
<p begin="01:38:49.857" end="01:38:51.757" style="s2">Wang Xiao Man?</p>
<p begin="01:38:50.857" end="01:38:53.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She had guts.</p>
<p begin="01:38:51.757" end="01:38:54.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s already been eliminated.</p>
<p begin="01:38:53.156" end="01:38:56.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng,</p>
<p begin="01:38:54.056" end="01:38:57.357" style="s2">I was wrong to kick him out.</p>
<p begin="01:38:56.056" end="01:38:59.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn you, Ye Feng.</p>
<p begin="01:38:57.357" end="01:39:00.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sticking with Ye Feng is my only chance</p>
<p begin="01:38:59.156" end="01:39:02.757" style="s2">of survival. I have to find a lead on</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.857" end="01:39:05.757" style="s2">survival coins. I&#39;ll prove I&#39;m more</p>
<p begin="01:39:02.757" end="01:39:05.757" style="s2">useful than Su Ting Yi.</p>
<p begin="01:39:08.757" end="01:39:11.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bonus reward. Five unassigned stat</p>
<p begin="01:39:11.156" end="01:39:13.357" style="s2">points.</p>
<p begin="01:39:11.957" end="01:39:15.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice.</p>
<p begin="01:39:13.357" end="01:39:16.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, you&#39;re a tier one transcendent</p>
<p begin="01:39:15.457" end="01:39:18.457" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:39:16.056" end="01:39:20.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sounds so awesome. The regional</p>
<p begin="01:39:18.457" end="01:39:21.857" style="s2">announcement says you&#39;re the first.</p>
<p begin="01:39:20.957" end="01:39:25.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hang on.</p>
<p begin="01:39:21.857" end="01:39:25.357" style="s2">Let me assign my stat points first.</p>
<p begin="01:39:26.156" end="01:39:30.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are now a tier one transcendent.</p>
<p begin="01:39:28.457" end="01:39:32.556" style="s2">Trait automatically awakened.</p>
<p begin="01:39:30.257" end="01:39:34.457" style="s2">Transcendent body. With a transcendent</p>
<p begin="01:39:32.556" end="01:39:36.656" style="s2">body, you have evolved into a higher</p>
<p begin="01:39:34.457" end="01:39:38.556" style="s2">form of life. Your body&#39;s resilience and</p>
<p begin="01:39:36.656" end="01:39:41.257" style="s2">healing far surpass those of ordinary</p>
<p begin="01:39:38.556" end="01:39:44.556" style="s2">humans. All but the most severe injuries</p>
<p begin="01:39:41.257" end="01:39:44.556" style="s2">will heal over time.</p>
<p begin="01:39:45.457" end="01:39:47.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="01:39:46.556" end="01:39:50.257" style="s2">Transcendent body.</p>
<p begin="01:39:47.857" end="01:39:52.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be a lot harder to kill now.</p>
<p begin="01:39:50.257" end="01:39:53.757" style="s2">Where should I put these points?</p>
<p begin="01:39:52.056" end="01:39:55.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Strength is crucial.</p>
<p begin="01:39:53.757" end="01:39:56.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll put them all into that.</p>
<p begin="01:39:55.556" end="01:39:59.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feels good.</p>
<p begin="01:39:56.757" end="01:40:00.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve gotten a lot stronger again. Plus,</p>
<p begin="01:39:59.156" end="01:40:02.757" style="s2">I have transcendent body. I&#39;m no</p>
<p begin="01:40:00.757" end="01:40:05.156" style="s2">ordinary human anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:40:02.757" end="01:40:06.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want a transcendent body, too.</p>
<p begin="01:40:05.156" end="01:40:07.558" style="s2">Ye</p>
<p begin="01:40:06.058" end="01:40:08.258" style="s2">will you help me become a transcendent</p>
<p begin="01:40:07.558" end="01:40:10.658" style="s2">someday?</p>
<p begin="01:40:08.258" end="01:40:14.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe. Depends on how well you behave.</p>
<p begin="01:40:10.658" end="01:40:14.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Ye Feng. I&#39;ll go get changed.</p>
<p begin="01:40:18.358" end="01:40:23.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today&#39;s mandatory choice quest has</p>
<p begin="01:40:20.358" end="01:40:23.958" style="s2">begun. Make your choice within 100</p>
<p begin="01:40:23.158" end="01:40:25.758" style="s2">seconds.</p>
<p begin="01:40:23.958" end="01:40:27.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on? Why is today&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:40:25.758" end="01:40:29.358" style="s2">announcement so early?</p>
<p begin="01:40:27.358" end="01:40:31.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It started with no warning. Everyone,</p>
<p begin="01:40:29.358" end="01:40:33.458" style="s2">wake up. Another deadly choice.</p>
<p begin="01:40:31.358" end="01:40:34.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Question. As the saying goes, one hand</p>
<p begin="01:40:33.458" end="01:40:36.958" style="s2">can&#39;t clap. How would you refute this</p>
<p begin="01:40:34.958" end="01:40:38.858" style="s2">excuse for blaming both sides?</p>
<p begin="01:40:36.958" end="01:40:41.058" style="s2">Option one, let me slap you and see if</p>
<p begin="01:40:38.858" end="01:40:43.158" style="s2">that makes a sound. Option two, slapping</p>
<p begin="01:40:41.058" end="01:40:45.258" style="s2">a wall makes a sound too. Option three,</p>
<p begin="01:40:43.158" end="01:40:47.758" style="s2">slap yourself. It still makes a sound.</p>
<p begin="01:40:45.258" end="01:40:49.558" style="s2">Option four, you&#39;re just too weak.</p>
<p begin="01:40:47.758" end="01:40:51.258" style="s2">Special notice. To celebrate the</p>
<p begin="01:40:49.558" end="01:40:53.558" style="s2">emergence of a transcendent, there will</p>
<p begin="01:40:51.258" end="01:40:55.358" style="s2">be no penalties this round. Each option</p>
<p begin="01:40:53.558" end="01:40:57.958" style="s2">offers a different reward. Countdown</p>
<p begin="01:40:55.358" end="01:41:00.558" style="s2">begins. 10, 9, 8.</p>
<p begin="01:40:57.958" end="01:41:02.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no, we can&#39;t even sit this one out.</p>
<p begin="01:41:00.558" end="01:41:04.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Girl, you missed the part about no</p>
<p begin="01:41:02.158" end="01:41:06.058" style="s2">penalties. This round&#39;s a freebie.</p>
<p begin="01:41:04.558" end="01:41:06.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like we have Ye Feng to thank for</p>
<p begin="01:41:06.058" end="01:41:10.158" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="01:41:06.558" end="01:41:11.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even so, don&#39;t expect me to thank him.</p>
<p begin="01:41:10.158" end="01:41:14.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, a round we don&#39;t have to be</p>
<p begin="01:41:11.858" end="01:41:16.758" style="s2">scared of.</p>
<p begin="01:41:14.158" end="01:41:18.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyway, which answer is right?</p>
<p begin="01:41:16.758" end="01:41:18.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s think it through and get a good</p>
<p begin="01:41:18.158" end="01:41:21.758" style="s2">reward.</p>
<p begin="01:41:18.858" end="01:41:24.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option one, slap you across the face.</p>
<p begin="01:41:21.758" end="01:41:25.858" style="s2">That sounds pretty satisfying. Slapping</p>
<p begin="01:41:24.058" end="01:41:27.658" style="s2">a wall makes a sound too, and slap</p>
<p begin="01:41:25.858" end="01:41:30.858" style="s2">yourself seem less promising.</p>
<p begin="01:41:27.658" end="01:41:32.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As for option four, honor your parents.</p>
<p begin="01:41:30.858" end="01:41:33.958" style="s2">What&#39;s that supposed to mean?</p>
<p begin="01:41:32.258" end="01:41:35.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That doesn&#39;t seem to make sense.</p>
<p begin="01:41:33.958" end="01:41:37.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There may be no penalties, but the</p>
<p begin="01:41:35.658" end="01:41:38.558" style="s2">rewards will vary. We need to think</p>
<p begin="01:41:37.758" end="01:41:40.258" style="s2">carefully.</p>
<p begin="01:41:38.558" end="01:41:41.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is our chance. We can&#39;t miss this</p>
<p begin="01:41:40.258" end="01:41:43.958" style="s2">chance to get stronger.</p>
<p begin="01:41:41.758" end="01:41:45.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I pick one. Slap him across the face.</p>
<p begin="01:41:43.958" end="01:41:46.258" style="s2">That it feels so good.</p>
<p begin="01:41:45.258" end="01:41:48.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just go for it.</p>
<p begin="01:41:46.258" end="01:41:50.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. I&#39;m picking one too.</p>
<p begin="01:41:48.158" end="01:41:51.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember, this is a survival world.</p>
<p begin="01:41:50.158" end="01:41:52.058" style="s2">Taking things lying down will get us</p>
<p begin="01:41:51.458" end="01:41:54.358" style="s2">killed.</p>
<p begin="01:41:52.058" end="01:41:56.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ruan Yan, I want to pick three. Slapping</p>
<p begin="01:41:54.358" end="01:41:58.558" style="s2">yourself may seem pathetic, but going</p>
<p begin="01:41:56.358" end="01:41:59.758" style="s2">against the grain might earn us a bigger</p>
<p begin="01:41:58.558" end="01:42:02.258" style="s2">reward.</p>
<p begin="01:41:59.758" end="01:42:04.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option one could actually be a trap.</p>
<p begin="01:42:02.258" end="01:42:06.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe you&#39;re overthinking it.</p>
<p begin="01:42:04.158" end="01:42:06.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe it means exactly what it says.</p>
<p begin="01:42:06.258" end="01:42:07.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; True.</p>
<p begin="01:42:06.858" end="01:42:08.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It all comes down</p>
<p begin="01:42:07.559" end="01:42:10.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to luck anyway.</p>
<p begin="01:42:08.659" end="01:42:12.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever. I&#39;ll take a chance on three.</p>
<p begin="01:42:10.359" end="01:42:14.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Slapping a wall makes a sound, too.</p>
<p begin="01:42:12.459" end="01:42:16.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s true. It definitely would. Two</p>
<p begin="01:42:14.559" end="01:42:17.759" style="s2">seems the most unexpected. It should</p>
<p begin="01:42:16.559" end="01:42:19.759" style="s2">give a good reward.</p>
<p begin="01:42:17.759" end="01:42:21.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, stupid brain. Think.</p>
<p begin="01:42:19.759" end="01:42:22.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which answer is right?</p>
<p begin="01:42:21.459" end="01:42:24.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go with three.</p>
<p begin="01:42:22.759" end="01:42:25.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Four might be the answer. There are</p>
<p begin="01:42:24.359" end="01:42:27.759" style="s2">several ways to read it.</p>
<p begin="01:42:25.959" end="01:42:29.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hit hard enough and even the air makes a</p>
<p begin="01:42:27.759" end="01:42:31.359" style="s2">sound. With enough strength, who says</p>
<p begin="01:42:29.859" end="01:42:32.759" style="s2">one hand can&#39;t clap?</p>
<p begin="01:42:31.359" end="01:42:33.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That makes sense, Li Chu.</p>
<p begin="01:42:32.759" end="01:42:35.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I agree.</p>
<p begin="01:42:33.559" end="01:42:38.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In an apocalypse, only the weak need to</p>
<p begin="01:42:35.859" end="01:42:40.959" style="s2">reason. The strong just need power.</p>
<p begin="01:42:38.559" end="01:42:42.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll pick four, too.</p>
<p begin="01:42:40.959" end="01:42:43.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today&#39;s choice.</p>
<p begin="01:42:42.459" end="01:42:46.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a dirty trick.</p>
<p begin="01:42:43.959" end="01:42:49.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One hand can&#39;t clap. This question feels</p>
<p begin="01:42:46.359" end="01:42:52.359" style="s2">different from the previous ones.</p>
<p begin="01:42:49.959" end="01:42:54.359" style="s2">At least there&#39;s no penalty this time.</p>
<p begin="01:42:52.359" end="01:42:55.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, which one should we pick?</p>
<p begin="01:42:54.359" end="01:42:56.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option one.</p>
<p begin="01:42:55.059" end="01:42:58.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grants a random common quality weapon.</p>
<p begin="01:42:56.859" end="01:42:58.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option two. Grants a random everyday</p>
<p begin="01:42:58.359" end="01:43:00.359" style="s2">item.</p>
<p begin="01:42:58.859" end="01:43:02.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option three. Grants either bread or</p>
<p begin="01:43:00.359" end="01:43:05.359" style="s2">bottled water at random. Option four.</p>
<p begin="01:43:02.659" end="01:43:06.659" style="s2">Permanently increases strength by one.</p>
<p begin="01:43:05.359" end="01:43:08.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No penalties?</p>
<p begin="01:43:06.659" end="01:43:10.559" style="s2">They&#39;re all rewards. Trust me. Pick</p>
<p begin="01:43:08.559" end="01:43:12.659" style="s2">four. We&#39;ve got plenty of supplies,</p>
<p begin="01:43:10.559" end="01:43:14.659" style="s2">food, and water. But stat points make</p>
<p begin="01:43:12.659" end="01:43:17.159" style="s2">you permanently stronger. That&#39;s a real</p>
<p begin="01:43:14.659" end="01:43:17.159" style="s2">prize.</p>
<p begin="01:43:17.459" end="01:43:20.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:43:18.759" end="01:43:21.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option one. Qin Shuang, Shen Man Qing,</p>
<p begin="01:43:20.759" end="01:43:21.959" style="s2">Zhu Li Li</p>
<p begin="01:43:21.459" end="01:43:23.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and others.</p>
<p begin="01:43:21.959" end="01:43:25.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option two. Xiao An Na, Wen Nuan, Ji Ruo</p>
<p begin="01:43:23.859" end="01:43:27.159" style="s2">Yin, Ming Xiao Yu, Duo Ren</p>
<p begin="01:43:25.259" end="01:43:27.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option three. Liu Ru Yan, An Feng Jiao,</p>
<p begin="01:43:27.159" end="01:43:28.759" style="s2">Zhong Nian Xue</p>
<p begin="01:43:27.959" end="01:43:30.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and others.</p>
<p begin="01:43:28.759" end="01:43:33.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Option four. Ye Feng, Su Qing Qian, Bai</p>
<p begin="01:43:30.959" end="01:43:34.659" style="s2">Li Chu, Lu Ke Ke and others.</p>
<p begin="01:43:33.059" end="01:43:36.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lu Ke Ke and Bai Li Chu.</p>
<p begin="01:43:34.659" end="01:43:40.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Picked four, just like us. Stat points</p>
<p begin="01:43:36.959" end="01:43:42.359" style="s2">are easily the most valuable reward.</p>
<p begin="01:43:40.359" end="01:43:44.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They actually picked the same option as</p>
<p begin="01:43:42.359" end="01:43:46.559" style="s2">us. They probably just guessed.</p>
<p begin="01:43:44.459" end="01:43:48.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You selected option four. Reward</p>
<p begin="01:43:46.559" end="01:43:49.659" style="s2">granted. Strength permanently increased</p>
<p begin="01:43:48.959" end="01:43:52.059" style="s2">by one.</p>
<p begin="01:43:49.659" end="01:43:53.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My strength went up, too. I really do</p>
<p begin="01:43:52.059" end="01:43:54.759" style="s2">feel stronger.</p>
<p begin="01:43:53.059" end="01:43:56.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng, you&#39;re amazing.</p>
<p begin="01:43:54.759" end="01:43:59.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As long as you&#39;re here, these so-called</p>
<p begin="01:43:56.659" end="01:44:03.759" style="s2">death choices won&#39;t scare me anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:43:59.559" end="01:44:04.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got a loaf of bread. I got a weapon.</p>
<p begin="01:44:03.759" end="01:44:06.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A frying pan.</p>
<p begin="01:44:04.759" end="01:44:08.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got dish soap. What&#39;s that good for on</p>
<p begin="01:44:06.759" end="01:44:09.959" style="s2">a sky island?</p>
<p begin="01:44:08.059" end="01:44:10.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I actually got massage oil.</p>
<p begin="01:44:09.959" end="01:44:12.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey,</p>
<p begin="01:44:10.561" end="01:44:15.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; it was free. Better than nothing. Is</p>
<p begin="01:44:12.661" end="01:44:18.161" style="s2">this a watermelon knife?</p>
<p begin="01:44:15.561" end="01:44:19.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice. I&#39;ve got a weapon now.</p>
<p begin="01:44:18.161" end="01:44:21.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got a dagger.</p>
<p begin="01:44:19.761" end="01:44:23.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice. Perfect for self-defense.</p>
<p begin="01:44:21.661" end="01:44:24.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got a hand crossbow.</p>
<p begin="01:44:23.561" end="01:44:27.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A weapon.</p>
<p begin="01:44:24.961" end="01:44:28.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want one too. What rewards did you all</p>
<p begin="01:44:27.861" end="01:44:31.061" style="s2">get?</p>
<p begin="01:44:28.561" end="01:44:32.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A permanent one point strength boost.</p>
<p begin="01:44:31.061" end="01:44:34.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I picked right.</p>
<p begin="01:44:32.361" end="01:44:36.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I feel so much stronger.</p>
<p begin="01:44:34.861" end="01:44:39.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can actually get strength points.</p>
<p begin="01:44:36.461" end="01:44:40.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That has to be today&#39;s best reward.</p>
<p begin="01:44:39.161" end="01:44:42.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want stat boosts.</p>
<p begin="01:44:40.961" end="01:44:45.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should have picked four too.</p>
<p begin="01:44:42.961" end="01:44:47.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was torn between one and four, then</p>
<p begin="01:44:45.261" end="01:44:50.661" style="s2">picked two. I suck.</p>
<p begin="01:44:47.361" end="01:44:52.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, I&#39;m kicking myself.</p>
<p begin="01:44:50.661" end="01:44:53.961" style="s2">I picked wrong again.</p>
<p begin="01:44:52.361" end="01:44:56.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Ye Feng got it right again.</p>
<p begin="01:44:53.961" end="01:44:57.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if I have to swallow my pride, I</p>
<p begin="01:44:56.161" end="01:44:58.461" style="s2">have to get back to Ye Feng as soon as</p>
<p begin="01:44:57.861" end="01:44:59.761" style="s2">possible.</p>
<p begin="01:44:58.461" end="01:45:02.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="01:44:59.761" end="01:45:03.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The task. I have to finish the task.</p>
<p begin="01:45:02.561" end="01:45:05.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gross.</p>
<p begin="01:45:03.461" end="01:45:07.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today&#39;s our lucky day.</p>
<p begin="01:45:05.161" end="01:45:09.661" style="s2">Today&#39;s task shows the survival system&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:45:07.061" end="01:45:12.161" style="s2">daily choices aren&#39;t all deadly.</p>
<p begin="01:45:09.661" end="01:45:14.161" style="s2">Some tasks only require a choice. You</p>
<p begin="01:45:12.161" end="01:45:16.461" style="s2">don&#39;t get teleported anywhere.</p>
<p begin="01:45:14.161" end="01:45:17.661" style="s2">Some choices even offer rewards with no</p>
<p begin="01:45:16.461" end="01:45:18.761" style="s2">penalties.</p>
<p begin="01:45:17.661" end="01:45:20.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:45:18.761" end="01:45:21.661" style="s2">We&#39;ll be this lucky every day from now</p>
<p begin="01:45:20.761" end="01:45:23.461" style="s2">on.</p>
<p begin="01:45:21.661" end="01:45:25.361" style="s2">It&#39;s our time to rise.</p>
<p begin="01:45:23.461" end="01:45:27.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; System announcement. Sky Island</p>
<p begin="01:45:25.361" end="01:45:30.561" style="s2">expanded. The island now covers five</p>
<p begin="01:45:27.561" end="01:45:30.561" style="s2">square kilometers.</p>
<p begin="01:45:31.861" end="01:45:36.361" style="s2">Today&#39;s bonus event boosts treasure</p>
<p begin="01:45:33.561" end="01:45:37.561" style="s2">chest drop rates and supply drop rates</p>
<p begin="01:45:36.361" end="01:45:40.061" style="s2">today only.</p>
<p begin="01:45:37.561" end="01:45:42.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bonus event. Higher chest drop rates</p>
<p begin="01:45:40.061" end="01:45:44.261" style="s2">today. More good news. I&#39;ve got to reel</p>
<p begin="01:45:42.661" end="01:45:46.661" style="s2">in more chests today.</p>
<p begin="01:45:44.261" end="01:45:46.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:45:55.461" end="01:45:59.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should get more to eat today.</p>
<p begin="01:45:57.661" end="01:46:00.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Finally caught something. It&#39;s my</p>
<p begin="01:45:59.661" end="01:46:02.961" style="s2">lucky day.</p>
<p begin="01:46:00.761" end="01:46:04.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Survival coins. Will anyone fish up</p>
<p begin="01:46:02.961" end="01:46:06.561" style="s2">survival coins today?</p>
<p begin="01:46:04.461" end="01:46:07.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could it be survival coins? Or did Liu</p>
<p begin="01:46:06.561" end="01:46:10.161" style="s2">Ruoyan secretly stash away something</p>
<p begin="01:46:07.961" end="01:46:13.462" style="s2">else?</p>
<p begin="01:46:10.161" end="01:46:15.062" style="s2">Either way, something&#39;s definitely off.</p>
<p begin="01:46:13.462" end="01:46:17.363" style="s2">Anything&#39;s possible.</p>
<p begin="01:46:15.062" end="01:46:19.762" style="s2">I need to find out for sure.</p>
<p begin="01:46:17.363" end="01:46:22.262" style="s2">My best bet is to talk to Lin Xiaoyu in</p>
<p begin="01:46:19.762" end="01:46:22.262" style="s2">private.</p>
<p begin="01:46:22.363" end="01:46:26.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OH MY GOD.</p>
<p begin="01:46:25.363" end="01:46:27.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SERIOUSLY?</p>
<p begin="01:46:26.162" end="01:46:28.363" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THIS TIME,</p>
<p begin="01:46:27.162" end="01:46:30.162" style="s2">Su Qingqian volunteered to guard the</p>
<p begin="01:46:28.363" end="01:46:32.462" style="s2">camp supplies. If the others lost their</p>
<p begin="01:46:30.162" end="01:46:34.062" style="s2">minds and tried to raid the camp,</p>
<p begin="01:46:32.462" end="01:46:36.962" style="s2">she could alert him right away to keep</p>
<p begin="01:46:34.062" end="01:46:36.962" style="s2">losses to a minimum.</p>
<p begin="01:46:40.662" end="01:46:44.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This bonus event sure delivers. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:46:42.562" end="01:46:47.562" style="s2">really in luck today.</p>
<p begin="01:46:44.162" end="01:46:47.562" style="s2">Let&#39;s hope I hit the jackpot.</p>
<p begin="01:46:48.262" end="01:46:50.662" style="s2">A blue chest.</p>
<p begin="01:46:49.762" end="01:46:52.462" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="01:46:50.662" end="01:46:54.562" style="s2">Give me something good.</p>
<p begin="01:46:52.462" end="01:46:56.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtained one portion of rock bee golden</p>
<p begin="01:46:54.562" end="01:46:58.962" style="s2">honey. What&#39;s this? Rock bee golden</p>
<p begin="01:46:56.562" end="01:47:00.863" style="s2">honey, rare quality. A stat-boosting</p>
<p begin="01:46:58.962" end="01:47:01.762" style="s2">item. Grants eight constitution when</p>
<p begin="01:47:00.863" end="01:47:05.262" style="s2">consumed.</p>
<p begin="01:47:01.762" end="01:47:08.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweet. A treasure that boosts my stats.</p>
<p begin="01:47:05.262" end="01:47:10.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hope this chest has something good, too.</p>
<p begin="01:47:08.662" end="01:47:12.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtained one wild bull light armor and</p>
<p begin="01:47:10.562" end="01:47:15.162" style="s2">one beast. Warning, a beast has emerged</p>
<p begin="01:47:12.962" end="01:47:16.762" style="s2">from the chest.</p>
<p begin="01:47:15.162" end="01:47:19.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A wild bull?</p>
<p begin="01:47:16.762" end="01:47:20.762" style="s2">Nothing I can&#39;t handle.</p>
<p begin="01:47:19.162" end="01:47:23.162" style="s2">It&#39;s barely stronger than that giant</p>
<p begin="01:47:20.762" end="01:47:25.762" style="s2">python.</p>
<p begin="01:47:23.162" end="01:47:27.762" style="s2">No survival coins. That&#39;s a shame.</p>
<p begin="01:47:25.762" end="01:47:28.363" style="s2">Luckily, besides the beast, there&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:47:27.762" end="01:47:31.062" style="s2">gear, too.</p>
<p begin="01:47:28.363" end="01:47:33.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bull light armor, rare. Constitution +5,</p>
<p begin="01:47:31.062" end="01:47:35.062" style="s2">strength +4, defense +5%.</p>
<p begin="01:47:33.662" end="01:47:37.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty good for rare gear.</p>
<p begin="01:47:35.062" end="01:47:39.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Let&#39;s see if I can upgrade</p>
<p begin="01:47:37.162" end="01:47:42.562" style="s2">loot from a chest, too. Ultimate</p>
<p begin="01:47:39.262" end="01:47:44.562" style="s2">Ascension. Holy crap. It actually works.</p>
<p begin="01:47:42.562" end="01:47:47.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mithril light armor, exceptional.</p>
<p begin="01:47:44.562" end="01:47:50.762" style="s2">Constitution +10, agility +10, defense</p>
<p begin="01:47:47.562" end="01:47:51.962" style="s2">+10%, max HP +10%.</p>
<p begin="01:47:50.762" end="01:47:52.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Common,</p>
<p begin="01:47:51.962" end="01:47:53.863" style="s2">fine,</p>
<p begin="01:47:52.863" end="01:47:54.762" style="s2">rare,</p>
<p begin="01:47:53.863" end="01:47:56.863" style="s2">exceptional.</p>
<p begin="01:47:54.762" end="01:47:58.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s already the fourth quality tier.</p>
<p begin="01:47:56.863" end="01:48:01.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those stat bonuses are insane.</p>
<p begin="01:47:58.863" end="01:48:03.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even the stats it boosts have changed.</p>
<p begin="01:48:01.863" end="01:48:03.962" style="s2">It&#39;s like a whole different piece of</p>
<p begin="01:48:03.262" end="01:48:06.062" style="s2">gear.</p>
<p begin="01:48:03.962" end="01:48:08.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Requires tier two to equip.</p>
<p begin="01:48:06.062" end="01:48:10.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why does it have a requirement now?</p>
<p begin="01:48:08.562" end="01:48:12.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So upgrading its quality.</p>
<p begin="01:48:10.162" end="01:48:13.363" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Added an equip requirement.</p>
<p begin="01:48:12.162" end="01:48:16.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tier two.</p>
<p begin="01:48:13.363" end="01:48:18.464" style="s2">I&#39;m only a tier one transcendent.</p>
<p begin="01:48:16.263" end="01:48:20.163" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In other words, in this survival game,</p>
<p begin="01:48:18.464" end="01:48:22.063" style="s2">ordinary people and tier one</p>
<p begin="01:48:20.163" end="01:48:24.263" style="s2">transcendents can use two grades of</p>
<p begin="01:48:22.063" end="01:48:26.163" style="s2">magical gear, green fine gear and blue</p>
<p begin="01:48:24.263" end="01:48:28.364" style="s2">rare gear.</p>
<p begin="01:48:26.163" end="01:48:30.964" style="s2">The next grade up, cyan exceptional</p>
<p begin="01:48:28.364" end="01:48:32.563" style="s2">gear, requires a tier two transcendent.</p>
<p begin="01:48:30.964" end="01:48:34.464" style="s2">Guess I can&#39;t use this exceptional armor</p>
<p begin="01:48:32.563" end="01:48:36.364" style="s2">yet.</p>
<p begin="01:48:34.464" end="01:48:39.464" style="s2">Following that logic, if exceptional</p>
<p begin="01:48:36.364" end="01:48:41.263" style="s2">gear requires a tier two transcendent,</p>
<p begin="01:48:39.464" end="01:48:43.763" style="s2">exceptional stat boosting artifacts</p>
<p begin="01:48:41.263" end="01:48:45.464" style="s2">probably do too. That makes sense. All</p>
<p begin="01:48:43.763" end="01:48:47.364" style="s2">the gear in this survival game boosts</p>
<p begin="01:48:45.464" end="01:48:49.063" style="s2">stats. The higher the quality, the</p>
<p begin="01:48:47.364" end="01:48:50.964" style="s2">bigger the stat boost, I guess.</p>
<p begin="01:48:49.063" end="01:48:52.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Without any restrictions, any mortal in</p>
<p begin="01:48:50.964" end="01:48:55.163" style="s2">divine gear could easily kill high level</p>
<p begin="01:48:52.964" end="01:48:57.163" style="s2">transcendents. So here&#39;s the question.</p>
<p begin="01:48:55.163" end="01:48:59.663" style="s2">How should I use this rare grade stat</p>
<p begin="01:48:57.163" end="01:49:01.964" style="s2">boosting item?</p>
<p begin="01:48:59.663" end="01:49:04.263" style="s2">I can only get a stat boost once, but I</p>
<p begin="01:49:01.964" end="01:49:06.063" style="s2">can always find another one later. I can</p>
<p begin="01:49:04.263" end="01:49:08.563" style="s2">upgrade the next one I get. Why hold</p>
<p begin="01:49:06.063" end="01:49:10.364" style="s2">back? The sooner I eat it, the sooner I</p>
<p begin="01:49:08.563" end="01:49:12.563" style="s2">get the benefits. Getting stronger</p>
<p begin="01:49:10.364" end="01:49:13.763" style="s2">sooner is what matters.</p>
<p begin="01:49:12.563" end="01:49:15.964" style="s2">That feels good.</p>
<p begin="01:49:13.763" end="01:49:16.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your constitution has increased by eight</p>
<p begin="01:49:15.964" end="01:49:18.464" style="s2">points.</p>
<p begin="01:49:16.663" end="01:49:20.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pretty good.</p>
<p begin="01:49:18.464" end="01:49:22.563" style="s2">Look at those amazing stats. I should be</p>
<p begin="01:49:20.864" end="01:49:24.063" style="s2">able to handle any threat on this Sky</p>
<p begin="01:49:22.563" end="01:49:25.864" style="s2">Island now, right?</p>
<p begin="01:49:24.063" end="01:49:27.563" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, right. I&#39;ve still got a few white</p>
<p begin="01:49:25.864" end="01:49:29.864" style="s2">chests. Let&#39;s open them all.</p>
<p begin="01:49:27.563" end="01:49:32.563" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtained 10 bags of chips, 20 ham</p>
<p begin="01:49:29.864" end="01:49:34.163" style="s2">sausages, 10 self-heating rice meals,</p>
<p begin="01:49:32.563" end="01:49:36.964" style="s2">and one cream cake.</p>
<p begin="01:49:34.163" end="01:49:39.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a pretty decent haul.</p>
<p begin="01:49:36.964" end="01:49:42.163" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Green fine grade. We actually fished up</p>
<p begin="01:49:39.864" end="01:49:46.263" style="s2">a fine grade chest. But you remember</p>
<p begin="01:49:42.163" end="01:49:49.163" style="s2">Nian&#39;s white chest last time, right?</p>
<p begin="01:49:46.263" end="01:49:51.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t remind me. That giant python still</p>
<p begin="01:49:49.163" end="01:49:53.964" style="s2">makes my knees shake. This is our first</p>
<p begin="01:49:51.864" end="01:49:55.464" style="s2">chest of such a high grade. What if it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:49:53.964" end="01:49:58.364" style="s2">another lethao</p>
<p begin="01:49:55.464" end="01:50:00.163" style="s2">with a beast inside?</p>
<p begin="01:49:58.364" end="01:50:01.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Surely we can&#39;t be that unlucky.</p>
<p begin="01:50:00.163" end="01:50:02.763" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The system said the odds of getting a</p>
<p begin="01:50:01.663" end="01:50:06.864" style="s2">monster are low.</p>
<p begin="01:50:02.763" end="01:50:06.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s probably something good this time.</p>
<p begin="01:50:09.464" end="01:50:13.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a bunch of low lifes.</p>
<p begin="01:50:11.364" end="01:50:14.163" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open it, Ruya. There might be something</p>
<p begin="01:50:13.263" end="01:50:15.864" style="s2">good inside.</p>
<p begin="01:50:14.163" end="01:50:18.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, the system said the odds of a</p>
<p begin="01:50:15.864" end="01:50:21.865" style="s2">beast are extremely low. If it&#39;s packed</p>
<p begin="01:50:18.265" end="01:50:23.265" style="s2">with food, we&#39;ll hit the jackpot.</p>
<p begin="01:50:21.865" end="01:50:25.565" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not opening it.</p>
<p begin="01:50:23.265" end="01:50:26.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You all ran off, and you expect me to</p>
<p begin="01:50:25.565" end="01:50:28.365" style="s2">open it?</p>
<p begin="01:50:26.865" end="01:50:30.165" style="s2">Nice try.</p>
<p begin="01:50:28.365" end="01:50:32.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if there&#39;s a beast inside? Could I</p>
<p begin="01:50:30.165" end="01:50:32.765" style="s2">even beat it?</p>
<p begin="01:50:34.965" end="01:50:40.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; can open it, and it has to be opened</p>
<p begin="01:50:37.065" end="01:50:40.765" style="s2">today, or it&#39;ll disappear.</p>
<p begin="01:50:40.965" end="01:50:43.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Zhu Lili,</p>
<p begin="01:50:42.165" end="01:50:46.365" style="s2">that&#39;s easy for you to say.</p>
<p begin="01:50:43.965" end="01:50:49.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why don&#39;t you come stand in front of me?</p>
<p begin="01:50:46.365" end="01:50:49.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll feel safe enough to open it.</p>
<p begin="01:50:53.565" end="01:50:56.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He killed that giant python with one</p>
<p begin="01:50:55.565" end="01:51:00.165" style="s2">spear thrust.</p>
<p begin="01:50:56.765" end="01:51:00.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would Ye Feng help us?</p>
<p begin="01:51:00.265" end="01:51:03.665" style="s2">You know how we treated him.</p>
<p begin="01:51:02.065" end="01:51:06.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We won&#39;t know unless we try.</p>
<p begin="01:51:03.665" end="01:51:06.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;d be easy for him.</p>
<p begin="01:51:09.565" end="01:51:15.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not opening that chest unless you</p>
<p begin="01:51:11.865" end="01:51:15.365" style="s2">can guarantee my safety.</p>
<p begin="01:51:15.865" end="01:51:20.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a plan. It&#39;ll keep you safe.</p>
<p begin="01:51:19.365" end="01:51:22.565" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:51:20.465" end="01:51:25.065" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can set a trap, dig a deep pit around</p>
<p begin="01:51:22.565" end="01:51:27.065" style="s2">the chest, and line it with spikes.</p>
<p begin="01:51:25.065" end="01:51:29.165" style="s2">If a beast comes out, it&#39;ll fall right</p>
<p begin="01:51:27.065" end="01:51:31.465" style="s2">in. Then we can use the high ground and</p>
<p begin="01:51:29.165" end="01:51:33.365" style="s2">drop rocks on it until it&#39;s dead.</p>
<p begin="01:51:31.465" end="01:51:34.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s still too risky.</p>
<p begin="01:51:33.365" end="01:51:37.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do you want?</p>
<p begin="01:51:34.765" end="01:51:39.365" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go beg Ye Feng to come protect me.</p>
<p begin="01:51:37.165" end="01:51:40.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely not. I&#39;d rather die than beg</p>
<p begin="01:51:39.365" end="01:51:42.165" style="s2">Ye Feng.</p>
<p begin="01:51:40.465" end="01:51:44.365" style="s2">Besides, what if there&#39;s something good</p>
<p begin="01:51:42.165" end="01:51:45.865" style="s2">inside? If he takes it, we&#39;d lose out</p>
<p begin="01:51:44.365" end="01:51:47.165" style="s2">big time.</p>
<p begin="01:51:45.865" end="01:51:48.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then get someone to stand in front of</p>
<p begin="01:51:47.165" end="01:51:50.465" style="s2">me. That&#39;s my condition.</p>
<p begin="01:51:48.765" end="01:51:54.565" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Otherwise, I&#39;m not opening it.</p>
<p begin="01:51:50.465" end="01:51:54.565" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll do it. I&#39;ll stand in front of you.</p>
<p begin="01:51:56.365" end="01:52:01.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. I&#39;ll be fine.</p>
<p begin="01:51:59.665" end="01:52:03.665" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. If you&#39;re in front of me, I&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="01:52:01.865" end="01:52:06.965" style="s2">safe.</p>
<p begin="01:52:03.665" end="01:52:06.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, that&#39;s settled.</p>
<p begin="01:52:10.765" end="01:52:14.065" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will this trap really work?</p>
<p begin="01:52:12.465" end="01:52:15.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The traps are my first line of defense,</p>
<p begin="01:52:14.065" end="01:52:17.365" style="s2">and Qin Shuang is my backup.</p>
<p begin="01:52:15.465" end="01:52:19.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should I try something else, too?</p>
<p begin="01:52:17.365" end="01:52:22.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll try asking Ye Feng. Maybe I can</p>
<p begin="01:52:19.165" end="01:52:22.366" style="s2">convince to come protect me.</p>
<p begin="01:52:26.966" end="01:52:32.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my God, am I dreaming? How can an</p>
<p begin="01:52:29.766" end="01:52:33.766" style="s2">ordinary guy have this many supplies?</p>
<p begin="01:52:32.466" end="01:52:34.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m starving.</p>
<p begin="01:52:33.766" end="01:52:36.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:52:34.466" end="01:52:38.066" style="s2">Has our precious heiress turned to</p>
<p begin="01:52:36.166" end="01:52:41.766" style="s2">stealing?</p>
<p begin="01:52:38.066" end="01:52:41.766" style="s2">Did you come over here to steal from us?</p>
<p begin="01:52:42.066" end="01:52:45.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you to judge me?</p>
<p begin="01:52:43.466" end="01:52:47.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong with me?</p>
<p begin="01:52:45.766" end="01:52:50.666" style="s2">I&#39;m better than some heiress sneaking</p>
<p begin="01:52:47.466" end="01:52:50.666" style="s2">around trying to steal.</p>
<p begin="01:52:51.266" end="01:52:55.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re here to steal my food.</p>
<p begin="01:52:53.066" end="01:52:58.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, am I seeing things? That&#39;s a huge</p>
<p begin="01:52:55.866" end="01:53:00.166" style="s2">cream cake. It smells amazing.</p>
<p begin="01:52:58.866" end="01:53:01.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing to say?</p>
<p begin="01:53:00.166" end="01:53:03.966" style="s2">You better have a good explanation.</p>
<p begin="01:53:01.666" end="01:53:06.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or else. I fished up a fine quality</p>
<p begin="01:53:03.966" end="01:53:08.866" style="s2">chest. I&#39;m afraid there&#39;s a beast</p>
<p begin="01:53:06.066" end="01:53:10.066" style="s2">inside. I came to ask for your help.</p>
<p begin="01:53:08.866" end="01:53:11.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With what?</p>
<p begin="01:53:10.066" end="01:53:13.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s what you&#39;ll do.</p>
<p begin="01:53:11.466" end="01:53:15.766" style="s2">Stand in front of me while I open it. If</p>
<p begin="01:53:13.566" end="01:53:18.666" style="s2">a beast comes out, just kill it. It&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:53:15.766" end="01:53:18.666" style="s2">be easy for you.</p>
<p begin="01:53:21.066" end="01:53:23.766" style="s2">Why are you looking at me like that?</p>
<p begin="01:53:22.766" end="01:53:25.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Qi,</p>
<p begin="01:53:23.766" end="01:53:26.666" style="s2">there&#39;s one problem with your plan. Why</p>
<p begin="01:53:25.566" end="01:53:28.566" style="s2">should I help you?</p>
<p begin="01:53:26.666" end="01:53:29.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You might get survival coins for killing</p>
<p begin="01:53:28.566" end="01:53:30.666" style="s2">a beast.</p>
<p begin="01:53:29.466" end="01:53:31.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:53:30.666" end="01:53:32.766" style="s2">I might.</p>
<p begin="01:53:31.466" end="01:53:33.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So why won&#39;t you help me?</p>
<p begin="01:53:32.766" end="01:53:36.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re strong enough.</p>
<p begin="01:53:33.966" end="01:53:37.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So because I can, I have to help you.</p>
<p begin="01:53:36.466" end="01:53:38.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Says who?</p>
<p begin="01:53:37.166" end="01:53:40.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t give me that with great power</p>
<p begin="01:53:38.466" end="01:53:41.166" style="s2">comes great responsibility crap.</p>
<p begin="01:53:40.366" end="01:53:43.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="01:53:41.166" end="01:53:45.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back home, every capable person wanted</p>
<p begin="01:53:43.566" end="01:53:47.966" style="s2">to get in with my family. But this</p>
<p begin="01:53:45.366" end="01:53:49.466" style="s2">survival world is different.</p>
<p begin="01:53:47.966" end="01:53:50.766" style="s2">I&#39;ll have to offer Ye Feng something to</p>
<p begin="01:53:49.466" end="01:53:52.466" style="s2">get his help.</p>
<p begin="01:53:50.766" end="01:53:54.066" style="s2">Ye Feng, I&#39;ll leave you two to talk.</p>
<p begin="01:53:52.466" end="01:53:55.166" style="s2">I&#39;ll go gather some firewood.</p>
<p begin="01:53:54.066" end="01:53:56.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="01:53:55.166" end="01:53:58.266" style="s2">Ye Feng,</p>
<p begin="01:53:56.366" end="01:53:59.966" style="s2">I can offer you an opportunity.</p>
<p begin="01:53:58.266" end="01:54:02.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What opportunity?</p>
<p begin="01:53:59.966" end="01:54:04.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll give you a chance to win me over.</p>
<p begin="01:54:02.366" end="01:54:05.566" style="s2">You can spoil me every day if I&#39;m in a</p>
<p begin="01:54:04.566" end="01:54:07.366" style="s2">good mood.</p>
<p begin="01:54:05.566" end="01:54:08.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I might consider letting you be my</p>
<p begin="01:54:07.366" end="01:54:10.266" style="s2">boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="01:54:08.766" end="01:54:11.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone like him never would have been</p>
<p begin="01:54:10.266" end="01:54:13.266" style="s2">worth my time.</p>
<p begin="01:54:11.666" end="01:54:14.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I&#39;m actually lowering myself to</p>
<p begin="01:54:13.266" end="01:54:16.166" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="01:54:14.366" end="01:54:19.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A chance to win you over? Are you</p>
<p begin="01:54:16.166" end="01:54:20.666" style="s2">delusional? Who do you think you are?</p>
<p begin="01:54:19.466" end="01:54:22.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng.</p>
<p begin="01:54:20.666" end="01:54:23.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you say that?</p>
<p begin="01:54:22.966" end="01:54:25.568" style="s2">Do you</p>
<p begin="01:54:23.867" end="01:54:26.968" style="s2">what an honor I&#39;m doing you?</p>
<p begin="01:54:25.568" end="01:54:29.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have any idea?</p>
<p begin="01:54:26.968" end="01:54:30.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many men wanted me back home?</p>
<p begin="01:54:29.367" end="01:54:32.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone like you.</p>
<p begin="01:54:30.968" end="01:54:34.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A few days ago, I wouldn&#39;t even have</p>
<p begin="01:54:32.968" end="01:54:36.168" style="s2">spoken to you.</p>
<p begin="01:54:34.068" end="01:54:38.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re nowhere near my league.</p>
<p begin="01:54:36.168" end="01:54:39.568" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I&#39;m asking you to protect me and</p>
<p begin="01:54:38.268" end="01:54:42.367" style="s2">giving you a shot with me.</p>
<p begin="01:54:39.568" end="01:54:44.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you dare turn me down?</p>
<p begin="01:54:42.367" end="01:54:47.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. That was a few days ago.</p>
<p begin="01:54:44.668" end="01:54:49.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Times have changed, princess.</p>
<p begin="01:54:47.168" end="01:54:50.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How pathetic. You still don&#39;t get it.</p>
<p begin="01:54:49.867" end="01:54:51.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get lost.</p>
<p begin="01:54:50.668" end="01:54:53.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now</p>
<p begin="01:54:51.668" end="01:54:56.168" style="s2">I&#39;ll make you.</p>
<p begin="01:54:53.768" end="01:54:57.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re telling me to get lost. How dare</p>
<p begin="01:54:56.168" end="01:54:59.867" style="s2">you treat me like this?</p>
<p begin="01:54:57.668" end="01:55:01.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you know what this will cost you?</p>
<p begin="01:54:59.867" end="01:55:02.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re finished.</p>
<p begin="01:55:01.168" end="01:55:03.867" style="s2">You&#39;ve got too much food to guard it</p>
<p begin="01:55:02.968" end="01:55:05.968" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="01:55:03.867" end="01:55:08.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I tell everyone how much food you</p>
<p begin="01:55:05.968" end="01:55:11.668" style="s2">have, just sitting out here in the open,</p>
<p begin="01:55:08.768" end="01:55:14.168" style="s2">what do you think they&#39;ll do?</p>
<p begin="01:55:11.668" end="01:55:17.367" style="s2">You have to sleep sometime. You have to</p>
<p begin="01:55:14.168" end="01:55:19.268" style="s2">leave camp. You can&#39;t stop everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:55:17.367" end="01:55:21.268" style="s2">Someone will get hungry enough to risk</p>
<p begin="01:55:19.268" end="01:55:23.268" style="s2">it. Plenty of people have weapons now,</p>
<p begin="01:55:21.268" end="01:55:25.568" style="s2">too. Losing your supplies could be the</p>
<p begin="01:55:23.268" end="01:55:26.468" style="s2">least of your worries. You might end up</p>
<p begin="01:55:25.568" end="01:55:29.168" style="s2">dead.</p>
<p begin="01:55:26.468" end="01:55:31.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that a threat?</p>
<p begin="01:55:29.168" end="01:55:33.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Depends how you take it.</p>
<p begin="01:55:31.268" end="01:55:35.468" style="s2">If you help me this once and give me a</p>
<p begin="01:55:33.268" end="01:55:36.768" style="s2">decent meal, I&#39;ll keep all this to</p>
<p begin="01:55:35.468" end="01:55:39.268" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="01:55:36.768" end="01:55:41.568" style="s2">And you&#39;ll have my gratitude, too.</p>
<p begin="01:55:39.268" end="01:55:43.367" style="s2">My earlier offer still stands.</p>
<p begin="01:55:41.568" end="01:55:44.168" style="s2">You&#39;re getting a great deal.</p>
<p begin="01:55:43.367" end="01:55:47.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Otherwise?</p>
<p begin="01:55:44.168" end="01:55:47.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:55:47.668" end="01:55:52.468" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please spare me. I was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:55:49.968" end="01:55:54.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a delusional little princess. How</p>
<p begin="01:55:52.468" end="01:55:57.468" style="s2">fate again. Watch how you talk to me.</p>
<p begin="01:55:54.768" end="01:55:58.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a talent. I can be useful.</p>
<p begin="01:55:57.468" end="01:55:59.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A talent?</p>
<p begin="01:55:58.268" end="01:56:01.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Explain.</p>
<p begin="01:55:59.268" end="01:56:04.568" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your talent can wait. First, learn how</p>
<p begin="01:56:01.867" end="01:56:04.568" style="s2">to address me.</p>
<p begin="01:56:04.668" end="01:56:07.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="01:56:05.768" end="01:56:09.768" style="s2">I&#39;ve thought it through.</p>
<p begin="01:56:07.268" end="01:56:12.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yefeng, I was wrong. Everything I used</p>
<p begin="01:56:09.768" end="01:56:13.268" style="s2">to take pride in, my self-respect, my</p>
<p begin="01:56:12.367" end="01:56:15.367" style="s2">pride,</p>
<p begin="01:56:13.268" end="01:56:18.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; none of it means anything here. Power is</p>
<p begin="01:56:15.367" end="01:56:19.768" style="s2">all that matters.</p>
<p begin="01:56:18.367" end="01:56:21.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re pretty slow,</p>
<p begin="01:56:19.768" end="01:56:23.568" style="s2">but at least you get it now.</p>
<p begin="01:56:21.668" end="01:56:26.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just said we were in different</p>
<p begin="01:56:23.568" end="01:56:28.669" style="s2">social classes. Back back home, I wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:56:26.269" end="01:56:31.369" style="s2">even worthy of speaking to you.</p>
<p begin="01:56:28.669" end="01:56:34.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, you&#39;re more than worthy. No one in</p>
<p begin="01:56:31.369" end="01:56:38.269" style="s2">the world is more worthy than you.</p>
<p begin="01:56:34.969" end="01:56:38.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I need to be worthy?</p>
<p begin="01:56:38.469" end="01:56:42.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m the one who needs to be worthy in</p>
<p begin="01:56:40.869" end="01:56:46.269" style="s2">this survival world.</p>
<p begin="01:56:42.969" end="01:56:46.269" style="s2">I&#39;m the one beneath you.</p>
<p begin="01:56:46.969" end="01:56:51.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When will you open the chest?</p>
<p begin="01:56:49.469" end="01:56:54.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Around 1:00 or 2:00 this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="01:56:51.969" end="01:56:58.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll watch from hiding when you open it.</p>
<p begin="01:56:54.369" end="01:56:59.969" style="s2">If a beast comes out, I&#39;ll step in.</p>
<p begin="01:56:58.269" end="01:57:01.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:56:59.969" end="01:57:02.569" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What for?</p>
<p begin="01:57:01.269" end="01:57:04.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As payment.</p>
<p begin="01:57:02.569" end="01:57:06.969" style="s2">If there&#39;s anything in the chest I want,</p>
<p begin="01:57:04.969" end="01:57:09.569" style="s2">it&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="01:57:06.969" end="01:57:11.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. According to Liu Ruyan&#39;s rules, the</p>
<p begin="01:57:09.569" end="01:57:13.369" style="s2">loot belongs to the whole group. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:57:11.869" end="01:57:14.469" style="s2">not my call.</p>
<p begin="01:57:13.369" end="01:57:18.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What rules?</p>
<p begin="01:57:14.469" end="01:57:18.369" style="s2">Around here, I call the shots.</p>
<p begin="01:57:18.569" end="01:57:23.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How about this? Let&#39;s agree upfront. If</p>
<p begin="01:57:21.169" end="01:57:24.169" style="s2">a beast comes out of the chest, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:57:23.169" end="01:57:26.069" style="s2">kill it for you.</p>
<p begin="01:57:24.169" end="01:57:27.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If the chest contains ordinary food, you</p>
<p begin="01:57:26.069" end="01:57:29.369" style="s2">can keep it.</p>
<p begin="01:57:27.769" end="01:57:31.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But if it contains a treasure that</p>
<p begin="01:57:29.369" end="01:57:34.069" style="s2">catches my eye, that&#39;s my</p>
<p begin="01:57:31.869" end="01:57:34.069" style="s2">deal.</p>
<p begin="01:57:35.669" end="01:57:39.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By the way, I should tell you about my</p>
<p begin="01:57:37.569" end="01:57:41.169" style="s2">talent.</p>
<p begin="01:57:39.269" end="01:57:43.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What talent?</p>
<p begin="01:57:41.169" end="01:57:45.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mine isn&#39;t all that useful. It&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="01:57:43.069" end="01:57:47.469" style="s2">passive talent called fortune and</p>
<p begin="01:57:45.069" end="01:57:48.769" style="s2">misfortune. When I open the chest, I</p>
<p begin="01:57:47.469" end="01:57:50.569" style="s2">fished up</p>
<p begin="01:57:48.769" end="01:57:53.369" style="s2">It greatly increases the odds of both</p>
<p begin="01:57:50.569" end="01:57:55.569" style="s2">good and bad luck. I&#39;ve thought it over,</p>
<p begin="01:57:53.369" end="01:57:58.369" style="s2">and I think good and bad luck go hand in</p>
<p begin="01:57:55.569" end="01:58:00.069" style="s2">hand. The opportunity comes with a risk,</p>
<p begin="01:57:58.369" end="01:58:02.269" style="s2">and the longer I wait between opening</p>
<p begin="01:58:00.069" end="01:58:03.369" style="s2">chests, the greater both the risk and</p>
<p begin="01:58:02.269" end="01:58:06.169" style="s2">the potential reward.</p>
<p begin="01:58:03.369" end="01:58:08.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quit rambling. Get to the point.</p>
<p begin="01:58:06.169" end="01:58:10.569" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Basically, I think any chest I open will</p>
<p begin="01:58:08.469" end="01:58:11.969" style="s2">contain either something good or a wild</p>
<p begin="01:58:10.569" end="01:58:13.769" style="s2">beast.</p>
<p begin="01:58:11.969" end="01:58:16.969" style="s2">Since this will be my first time opening</p>
<p begin="01:58:13.769" end="01:58:18.969" style="s2">one, the risk and potential reward could</p>
<p begin="01:58:16.969" end="01:58:22.169" style="s2">be even greater.</p>
<p begin="01:58:18.969" end="01:58:24.569" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s an interesting talent.</p>
<p begin="01:58:22.169" end="01:58:26.969" style="s2">I get it.</p>
<p begin="01:58:24.569" end="01:58:28.570" style="s2">So you&#39;re more likely to find treasure.</p>
<p begin="01:58:26.969" end="01:58:29.570" style="s2">Here&#39;s the deal. If there&#39;s anything</p>
<p begin="01:58:28.570" end="01:58:30.670" style="s2">good,</p>
<p begin="01:58:29.570" end="01:58:34.270" style="s2">I&#39;ll take it.</p>
<p begin="01:58:30.670" end="01:58:36.470" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you some food in return.</p>
<p begin="01:58:34.270" end="01:58:39.970" style="s2">Let&#39;s say 30 portions of bread.</p>
<p begin="01:58:36.470" end="01:58:39.970" style="s2">That&#39;s settled then. You can go.</p>
<p begin="01:58:45.970" end="01:58:48.570" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could I get some of that food in</p>
<p begin="01:58:47.370" end="01:58:50.370" style="s2">advance?</p>
<p begin="01:58:48.570" end="01:58:52.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:58:50.370" end="01:58:53.970" style="s2">You can&#39;t get an advance, but we can</p>
<p begin="01:58:52.270" end="01:58:57.570" style="s2">make a trade.</p>
<p begin="01:58:53.970" end="01:59:00.470" style="s2">That would be a separate deal though.</p>
<p begin="01:58:57.570" end="01:59:00.470" style="s2">What can you offer me?</p>
<p begin="01:59:01.070" end="01:59:05.770" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="01:59:02.270" end="01:59:05.770" style="s2">What else do I have to offer?</p>
<p begin="01:59:06.870" end="01:59:10.270" style="s2">Okay. Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:59:17.570" end="01:59:22.370" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Finish eating and head back.</p>
<p begin="01:59:20.070" end="01:59:25.070" style="s2">Keep this quiet. If anything happens,</p>
<p begin="01:59:22.370" end="01:59:27.370" style="s2">I&#39;ll step in.</p>
<p begin="01:59:25.070" end="01:59:29.170" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:59:27.370" end="01:59:30.370" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not mad about what I just did,</p>
<p begin="01:59:29.170" end="01:59:32.370" style="s2">are you?</p>
<p begin="01:59:30.370" end="01:59:33.670" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t be mad. You&#39;re doing the right</p>
<p begin="01:59:32.370" end="01:59:35.770" style="s2">thing,</p>
<p begin="01:59:33.670" end="01:59:37.570" style="s2">Someone as stuck up as</p>
<p begin="01:59:35.770" end="01:59:39.670" style="s2">needs a reality check.</p>
<p begin="01:59:37.570" end="01:59:42.370" style="s2">Ye Feng, count me in next time you get a</p>
<p begin="01:59:39.670" end="01:59:44.470" style="s2">chance like that. I love seeing stuck up</p>
<p begin="01:59:42.370" end="01:59:46.770" style="s2">people like her grovel.</p>
<p begin="01:59:44.470" end="01:59:46.770" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="01:59:47.270" end="01:59:52.670" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you go see Ye Feng? Did he agree?</p>
<p begin="01:59:49.270" end="01:59:52.670" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. He refused.</p>
<p begin="01:59:53.570" end="01:59:57.070" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you.</p>
<p begin="01:59:55.070" end="01:59:57.670" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng&#39;s so selfish. Why would he help</p>
<p begin="01:59:57.070" end="01:59:58.870" style="s2">us?</p>
<p begin="01:59:57.670" end="02:00:01.970" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Convinced now?</p>
<p begin="01:59:58.870" end="02:00:01.970" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never learn.</p>
<p begin="02:00:05.770" end="02:00:09.770" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Get ready to open the chest.</p>
<p begin="02:00:16.270" end="02:00:21.770" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry up. We&#39;re all waiting.</p>
<p begin="02:00:19.270" end="02:00:21.770" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="02:00:21.970" end="02:00:26.170" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Obtain water condensation pearl</p>
<p begin="02:00:23.770" end="02:00:28.170" style="s2">blueprint. Consume this blueprint and 10</p>
<p begin="02:00:26.170" end="02:00:30.170" style="s2">survival coins to craft a water</p>
<p begin="02:00:28.170" end="02:00:32.372" style="s2">condensation pearl. Water condensation</p>
<p begin="02:00:30.170" end="02:00:34.772" style="s2">pearl, fine quality item. Once installed</p>
<p begin="02:00:32.372" end="02:00:36.672" style="s2">in your cabin, it produces 20 L of clean</p>
<p begin="02:00:34.772" end="02:00:38.872" style="s2">water a day.</p>
<p begin="02:00:36.672" end="02:00:40.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No danger. What did we get this time?</p>
<p begin="02:00:38.872" end="02:00:41.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A big stash of food.</p>
<p begin="02:00:40.772" end="02:00:43.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A blueprint.</p>
<p begin="02:00:41.972" end="02:00:46.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What good is that? Why couldn&#39;t we get</p>
<p begin="02:00:43.972" end="02:00:46.972" style="s2">an actual item?</p>
<p begin="02:00:47.072" end="02:00:50.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This blueprint must be incredibly</p>
<p begin="02:00:49.172" end="02:00:52.272" style="s2">valuable.</p>
<p begin="02:00:50.172" end="02:00:53.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A steady supply of water every day. Do</p>
<p begin="02:00:52.272" end="02:00:56.172" style="s2">you realize what that means?</p>
<p begin="02:00:53.872" end="02:00:57.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too bad it costs a whole 10 survival</p>
<p begin="02:00:56.172" end="02:00:59.072" style="s2">coins to craft.</p>
<p begin="02:00:57.672" end="02:01:01.272" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And we need a cabin before we can use</p>
<p begin="02:00:59.072" end="02:01:01.272" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="02:01:03.672" end="02:01:08.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A water condensation pearl blueprint.</p>
<p begin="02:01:06.272" end="02:01:11.772" style="s2">It&#39;s my lucky day.</p>
<p begin="02:01:08.172" end="02:01:12.772" style="s2">A guaranteed 20 L of water a day. Nice.</p>
<p begin="02:01:11.772" end="02:01:14.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ye Feng,</p>
<p begin="02:01:12.772" end="02:01:16.672" style="s2">he stole it.</p>
<p begin="02:01:14.172" end="02:01:19.072" style="s2">Give it back. Ye Feng, you&#39;re stealing</p>
<p begin="02:01:16.672" end="02:01:19.872" style="s2">from us again. Ye Feng, give that back</p>
<p begin="02:01:19.072" end="02:01:22.472" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="02:01:19.872" end="02:01:23.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean yours? This</p>
<p begin="02:01:22.472" end="02:01:25.672" style="s2">this is mine.</p>
<p begin="02:01:23.572" end="02:01:27.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We got it from a chest. Since when is it</p>
<p begin="02:01:25.672" end="02:01:29.472" style="s2">yours?</p>
<p begin="02:01:27.172" end="02:01:31.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ji Ruoyan found it in a chest, right?</p>
<p begin="02:01:29.472" end="02:01:33.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ji Ruoyan, tell them. If I want it, it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:01:31.872" end="02:01:34.272" style="s2">mine, right?</p>
<p begin="02:01:33.172" end="02:01:35.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ji Ruoyan,</p>
<p begin="02:01:34.272" end="02:01:38.072" style="s2">is that true?</p>
<p begin="02:01:35.472" end="02:01:40.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I&#39;ve already given it to Ye Feng.</p>
<p begin="02:01:38.072" end="02:01:42.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You had no right. It belongs to all of</p>
<p begin="02:01:40.872" end="02:01:45.072" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="02:01:42.672" end="02:01:46.372" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For starters, I&#39;m the one who found it.</p>
<p begin="02:01:45.072" end="02:01:48.372" style="s2">Besides,</p>
<p begin="02:01:46.372" end="02:01:49.472" style="s2">even if it belongs to us all, we should</p>
<p begin="02:01:48.372" end="02:01:51.472" style="s2">all get a say.</p>
<p begin="02:01:49.472" end="02:01:53.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It looks impressive, but it&#39;s useless to</p>
<p begin="02:01:51.472" end="02:01:56.072" style="s2">us. It costs 10 survival coins just to</p>
<p begin="02:01:53.972" end="02:01:57.172" style="s2">craft it, and you need a homestead to</p>
<p begin="02:01:56.072" end="02:01:59.672" style="s2">use it.</p>
<p begin="02:01:57.172" end="02:02:00.172" style="s2">Building a homestead cabin costs another</p>
<p begin="02:01:59.672" end="02:02:01.872" style="s2">10.</p>
<p begin="02:02:00.172" end="02:02:03.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where would we get that many survival</p>
<p begin="02:02:01.872" end="02:02:05.672" style="s2">coins? Isn&#39;t giving it to Ye Feng worth</p>
<p begin="02:02:03.872" end="02:02:07.372" style="s2">it for his protection?</p>
<p begin="02:02:05.672" end="02:02:08.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh [ __ ] What do you need his protection</p>
<p begin="02:02:07.372" end="02:02:10.172" style="s2">for? We can protect you.</p>
<p begin="02:02:08.772" end="02:02:10.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Explain yourself.</p>
<p begin="02:02:10.172" end="02:02:14.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay here.</p>
<p begin="02:02:10.872" end="02:02:14.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that that&#39;s settled, I&#39;ll be going.</p>
<p begin="02:02:20.072" end="02:02:24.072" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is Ye Feng so fast?</p>
<p begin="02:02:22.072" end="02:02:25.172" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was just thinking that. I didn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="02:02:24.072" end="02:02:26.872" style="s2">see him arrive.</p>
<p begin="02:02:25.172" end="02:02:28.872" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, he took off fast, too.</p>
<p begin="02:02:26.872" end="02:02:30.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember, he&#39;s a tier one transcendent</p>
<p begin="02:02:28.872" end="02:02:32.373" style="s2">now. He&#39;s way beyond us.</p>
<p begin="02:02:30.672" end="02:02:34.973" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Ji, remember to come collect your</p>
<p begin="02:02:32.373" end="02:02:34.973" style="s2">compensation.</p>
<p begin="02:02:39.373" end="02:02:42.373" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="02:02:43.373" end="02:02:48.073" style="s2">I told you to stay away from Ye Feng.</p>
<p begin="02:02:45.973" end="02:02:50.773" style="s2">Why did you go to him? You gave him</p>
<p begin="02:02:48.073" end="02:02:52.073" style="s2">something so valuable without asking.</p>
<p begin="02:02:50.773" end="02:02:55.473" style="s2">It&#39;s your fault.</p>
<p begin="02:02:52.073" end="02:02:55.473" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I lost that treasure.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
